#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:9
msgid "Wrong!"
msgstr "Faux!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:7
msgid "We lost?"
msgstr "Nous avons perdu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:7
msgid ""
"Yes!  Now because I'm that much smarter than you, it would be unfair to kill you.  I'll let you get by with your lives this time."
msgstr ""
"Oui ! Et comme je suis bien plus intelligent que vous, il serait injuste de vous tuer. Je vous laisse la vie sauve pour cette fois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:8
msgid "A hunting accident."
msgstr "Un accident de chasse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:8
msgid "You dumbbell!  That's the wrong answer!"
msgstr "Espèces de nigauds ! C'est la mauvaise réponse !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:9
msgid ""
"Alright, you think you're so smart!  I think I'll give you one that's not so easy: Who was the first Ursanian Emperor?"
msgstr ""
"Bon, vous vous croyez si malins ! Je vais vous en poser une qui n'est pas si facile : qui fut le premier empereur ursanien ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC130.rude:9
msgid "Hallenhalt."
msgstr "Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:10
msgid ""
"Place okay is it.  Time for once walking and living.  Trading post now it.  Farndale to help me!  Heh heh!"
msgstr ""
"Endroit correct c'est un. Temps pour une fois marcher et vivre. Comptoir maintenant c'est. Farndale m'aider à ! Hé hé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:13
msgid "Wait!  Help need come back your I!!"
msgstr "Attendez ! Aide besoin revenez votre j'ai !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:12
msgid "I will answer your questions."
msgstr "Je répondrai à vos questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:15
msgid "You're welcome.  Farewell."
msgstr "Je vous en prie. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:2
msgid ""
"I spent some time in Farndale when I was younger.  That's way down in Mendossus.  I hear it's not such a nice place anymore."
msgstr ""
"J'ai passé quelque temps à Farndale quand j'étais plus jeune. C'est tout en bas, en Mendossus. On dit que ce n'est plus un endroit si agréable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:3
msgid "After that experience?  You bet!"
msgstr "Après cette expérience ? Et comment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:3
msgid "Promise us you'll not try to woo every girl you meet."
msgstr ""
"Promettez-nous de ne plus essayer de séduire toutes les filles que vous rencontrez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:4
msgid "Feeling any better?"
msgstr "Vous vous sentez mieux ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:4
msgid "Yeah!  Thanks!  That's much better!"
msgstr "Oui ! Merci ! Ça va beaucoup mieux !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hein ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:5
msgid "Your answer I will question."
msgstr "Vos réponses je questionnerai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:6
msgid "I questions answer will your."
msgstr "Je questions répondrai vos à."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:7
msgid "It's an okay place.  It's a nice place to live usually."
msgstr "C'est un endroit correct. D'habitude, il fait bon y vivre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:8
msgid "Here, Nurtigan.  Drink this."
msgstr "Tenez, Nurtigan. Buvez ceci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:8
msgid "Take I.  Drink will."
msgstr "Prends je. Boirai le."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:9
msgid "Crazy witch court tried to I this.  She this made me way ."
msgstr "Sorcière folle courtiser j'ai essayé. Elle comme ça rendu m'a."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC131.rude:9
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "Que vous est-il arrivé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:10
msgid "Now go, and leave me alone!"
msgstr "Maintenant, partez et laissez-moi tranquille !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:2
msgid ""
"That I'll not tell.  Fear not.  I think Nurtigan is much better this way.  I'm through answering your questions.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Ça, je ne le dirai pas. N'ayez crainte. Je trouve que Nurtigan est bien mieux ainsi. J'en ai fini de répondre à vos questions. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:2
msgid "Well which is it?"
msgstr "Alors, laquelle est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:3
msgid ""
"Maybe I did nothing.  Maybe he just cannot believe that there is a woman who would resist him.  Or maybe the thought of courting me made him crazy.  Or maybe he just bothered me."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être que je n'ai rien fait. Peut-être qu'il ne peut tout simplement pas croire qu'une femme puisse lui résister. Ou peut-être que l'idée de me courtiser l'a rendu fou. Ou peut-être qu'il m'importunait, tout simplement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:3
msgid "What did you do to him?"
msgstr "Que lui avez-vous fait ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:4
msgid ""
"He thought he was some great symbol of love.  It was his claim that there was no woman who  could resist his wooing.  Well he found out that such a woman exists.  And I am she."
msgstr ""
"Il se prenait pour un grand symbole de l'amour. Il prétendait qu'aucune femme ne pouvait résister à ses avances. Eh bien, il a découvert qu'une telle femme existe. Et c'est moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:4
msgid "What happened to Nutty Nurtigan?"
msgstr "Qu'est-il arrivé à Nurtigan le Toqué ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:5
msgid "Questions?  I suppose I could hear them."
msgstr "Des questions ? Je suppose que je peux les écouter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:6
msgid "I live out in a cave!  How would I get any news?"
msgstr ""
"Je vis dans une grotte ! Comment voulez-vous que j'aie des nouvelles ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:7
msgid "That old loon?  It was his own fault he got that way!"
msgstr "Ce vieux fou ? C'est sa propre faute s'il est devenu comme ça !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:7
msgid "We've come to ask you to cure Nutty Nurtigan."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus vous demander de guérir Nurtigan le Toqué."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:8
msgid ""
"Don't you dare speak that name!  Why I have my suspicions that she is not what she seems.  I wouldn't trust her to give me Njam's own luck!"
msgstr ""
"N'osez pas prononcer ce nom ! Je la soupçonne de ne pas être ce qu'elle paraît. Je ne lui ferais pas confiance, même si elle m'offrait la chance de Njam en personne !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:9
msgid "What do you know about Yrsa the Troll?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous d'Yrsa la Trolle ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC132.rude:9
msgid "Get out of here and leave me alone."
msgstr "Partez d'ici et laissez-moi tranquille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm very interested in the games the other wizards came up with.  I'd like you to visit as many games as you can.  The more games you can report on for me, the more money I'll pay you."
msgstr ""
"Les jeux qu'ont inventés les autres sorciers m'intéressent beaucoup. J'aimerais que vous visitiez autant de jeux que possible. Plus vous me ferez de rapports sur des jeux, plus je vous paierai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:8
msgid "What can we do for you?"
msgstr "Que pouvons-nous faire pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:10
msgid ""
"Games stimulate the imagination, and are proven to keep you young.  I'll see you when your old!"
msgstr ""
"Les jeux stimulent l'imagination, et il est prouvé qu'ils gardent jeune. On se reverra quand vous serez vieux !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:10
msgid "We don't have time for silly games."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas de temps pour des jeux idiots."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:11
msgid "Do you give out any prizes?"
msgstr "Donnez-vous des prix ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:11
msgid ""
"Well, I happen to have here this wonderful Capstone of Order in my possession.  If you can give to me the entire set of prizes here at the Gathering, I will trade you for them."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, il se trouve que j'ai ici en ma possession cette merveilleuse Clé de voûte de l'Ordre. Si vous pouvez me remettre la série complète des prix d'ici, de la Grande Assemblée, je vous l'échangerai contre eux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:12
msgid "Great!  Here's the capstone."
msgstr "Formidable ! Voici la clé de voûte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:12
msgid "We've got your set of prizes."
msgstr "Nous avons votre série de prix."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:13
msgid ""
"Well, actually I'm looking for someone to star in the new trapeze act I'm starting.  They can't be anyone scruffy like you, though.  I'm looking for someone who looks brave and noble.  Like they could be a king!"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, en fait, je cherche quelqu'un pour être la vedette du nouveau numéro de trapèze que je monte. Mais ce ne peut pas être quelqu'un de débraillé comme vous. Je cherche quelqu'un qui ait l'air brave et noble. Comme s'il pouvait être roi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:13
msgid "You're not looking for any help, are you?"
msgstr "Vous ne cherchez pas d'aide, par hasard ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:14
msgid "Did Nicolai take the job?"
msgstr "Nicolai a-t-il accepté le travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:14
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I think he's going to work out fine.  For your effort, I've got a bit of a reward for you."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Je crois qu'il va très bien s'en sortir. Pour votre peine, j'ai une petite récompense pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:15
msgid "We don't have time for games today."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas le temps de jouer aujourd'hui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:15
msgid "Why?  Are you afraid of losing?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ? Vous avez peur de perdre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:16
msgid "Would you like to play a game?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous jouer à un jeu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:17
msgid ""
"There's six of them.  The wooden sword, the wooden shield, the fur cap, the cloth gloves,   the quilted armor, and the fuzzy slippers."
msgstr ""
"Il y en a six. L'épée de bois, le bouclier de bois, le bonnet de fourrure, les gants de tissu, l'armure matelassée et les pantoufles duveteuses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:17
msgid "What are the prizes you are looking for?"
msgstr "Quels sont les prix que vous recherchez ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:2
msgid "Alright!  You just better hope it's still here!"
msgstr "Très bien ! Espérez seulement qu'elle soit encore là !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:2
msgid "Well if we ever need a Capstone of Order, we'll be by."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, si un jour nous avons besoin d'une Clé de voûte de l'Ordre, nous passerons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:3
msgid "We may have just the person."
msgstr "Nous avons peut-être la personne qu'il vous faut."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:3
msgid "You have?  Great!  Bring him down!"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Formidable ! Amenez-le-moi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:4
msgid "Step right up!  You can buy a ticket from the ticket master."
msgstr ""
"Approchez, approchez ! Vous pouvez acheter un ticket auprès du vendeur de tickets."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to play a game."
msgstr "Nous aimerions jouer à un jeu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:6
msgid "Great!  Come back when you're done."
msgstr "Formidable ! Revenez quand vous aurez fini."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:6
msgid "Sounds like fun."
msgstr "Ça a l'air amusant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:7
msgid ""
"I'd really like to know what sort of games the other wizards came up with this year."
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais vraiment savoir quels jeux les autres sorciers ont inventés cette année."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC133.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC136.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC138.rude:5
