msgid "What do you know about Arslegard?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous d'Arslegard ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:4
msgid "No, it was no bother at all, really!"
msgstr "Non, ça ne m'a pas dérangé du tout, vraiment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC163.rude:5
msgid "Sure, certainly.  It was no problem."
msgstr "Bien sûr, certainement. Ce n'était pas un problème."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:1
msgid ""
"I dropped my boom boom on my toe yesterday.  It ouched very bad.  Daddy says I only 'upposed to use the boom boom for pounding nails, but it's fun to play with."
msgstr ""
"J'ai fait tomber mon boum-boum sur mon orteil hier. Ça a fait très bobo. Papa dit que je dois 'eulement me servir du boum-boum pour taper sur les clous, mais c'est rigolo de jouer avec."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:3
msgid "Nuthin'"
msgstr "Rien"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about hammers?"
msgstr "Que sais-tu des marteaux ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC164.rude:5
msgid "Okay.  Bye-bye."
msgstr "D'accord. Au revoir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:1
msgid ""
"Find yourself a partner.  If you do, love them well!  If everyone in the world did this, the world would be a better place!"
msgstr ""
"Trouvez-vous quelqu'un. Et si vous le trouvez, aimez-le de tout votre cœur ! Si tout le monde faisait ça, le monde serait meilleur !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:2
msgid "Hello!  We'd like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "Bonjour ! Nous aimerions vous poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:2
msgid "Of course!  That you may certainly do!"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Ça, vous pouvez le faire sans problème !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you couldn't tell, I love food!  My favorite dish is the stew over at Akl'ai's Spirits.  I could eat a hundred pounds of that stuff in one day!  He won't sell that much to me, though.  He says I need to watch my weight."
msgstr ""
"Vous l'aurez remarqué, j'adore manger ! Mon plat préféré, c'est le ragoût des Spiritueux d'Akl'ai. Je pourrais en manger cent livres en une journée ! Mais il refuse de m'en vendre autant. Il dit que je dois surveiller ma ligne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about food?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la nourriture ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:4
msgid "No trouble at all!"
msgstr "Aucun problème !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC165.rude:5
msgid "It was my pleasure.  Farewell."
msgstr "Tout le plaisir était pour moi. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:1
msgid ""
"I asked Lina Friggdotir out the other day.  She turned me down, though.  She handed me a stick with bristles on it, and said she might consider going out if I used it.  I don't know what it's for, though."
msgstr ""
"J'ai invité Lina Friggdotir à sortir l'autre jour. Elle m'a pourtant éconduit. Elle m'a tendu un bâtonnet avec des poils dessus, et m'a dit qu'elle envisagerait peut-être de sortir avec moi si je m'en servais. Mais je ne sais pas à quoi ça sert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:3
msgid ""
"My Dad was an adventurer.  He did a lot of things for the last Jarl of Guberland.  His boat sank on the way to Thronheim.  I didn't want to follow in his footsteps.  Drowning is no way to live!"
msgstr ""
"Mon père était aventurier. Il a fait beaucoup de choses pour le dernier Jarl de Guberland. Son bateau a coulé en route vers Thronheim. Je n'ai pas voulu suivre ses traces. La noyade, ce n'est pas une vie !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about quests?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des quêtes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:5
msgid "Have you ever washed your teeth?"
msgstr "Vous êtes-vous déjà lavé les dents ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC166.rude:5
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "Pourquoi cette question ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:1
msgid ""
"This place is just creepy.  I think it's getting time for me to leave.  The men around here are just so gross!  I mean, they hardly bathe, they don't brush their teeth, and then they come over and ask me for a date!  I really need to get out of here."
msgstr ""
"Cet endroit me donne la chair de poule. Je crois qu'il est temps pour moi de partir. Les hommes d'ici sont vraiment répugnants ! Je veux dire, ils se lavent à peine, ils ne se brossent pas les dents, et ensuite ils viennent me demander un rendez-vous ! Il faut vraiment que je parte d'ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:3
msgid ""
"That boy is a jerk!  Can you believe that he told his friends that we went to the Gathering together?  Only in his dreams, I can tell you that!  If he does it again, my brother is going to give him the what for!"
msgstr ""
"Ce garçon est un mufle ! Vous vous rendez compte, il a raconté à ses amis que nous étions allés ensemble à la Grande Assemblée ? Dans ses rêves, oui, je vous le garantis ! S’il recommence, mon frère va lui donner une bonne leçon !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC167.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Aso Stinkshirt?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous d’Aso Stinkshirt ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC168.rude:1
msgid "I won a prize at the Gathering!"
msgstr "J’ai gagné un prix à la Grande Assemblée !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC168.rude:3
msgid "It's a fun place to go to win prizes!"
msgstr "C’est un endroit amusant où l’on gagne des prix !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Guberland Players are a fine bunch of actors, but sometimes I wonder if they're accurately portraying Ursanian History."
msgstr ""
"La Troupe de Guberland est une belle bande d’acteurs, mais je me demande parfois s’ils dépeignent fidèlement l’histoire ursanienne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:3
msgid "Not very much.  Probably as much as any other person."
msgstr "Pas grand-chose. Sans doute autant que n’importe qui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC169.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Ursanian History?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’histoire ursanienne ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:1
msgid "Goodbybe."
msgstr "Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:10
msgid "I would recommend that you do.  Would you like to buy something?"
msgstr "C’est ce que je vous conseille. Voulez-vous acheter quelque chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:10
msgid "Sounds like a bad place to be.  We'll try to avoid it."
msgstr ""
"Voilà un endroit où il ne fait pas bon être. Nous tâcherons de l’éviter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:11
msgid ""
"Hallenhalt is the exalted place where the worthy go when they die.  From what I've heard about it, Skraelos keeps them fit and happy.  They stay in Hallenhalt until the time comes when Krohn needs his army."
msgstr ""
"Le Hallenhalt est le lieu glorieux où vont les dignes après leur mort. D’après ce que j’en ai entendu dire, Skraelos les y garde en forme et heureux. Ils restent au Hallenhalt jusqu’au jour où Krohn aura besoin de son armée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:11
msgid "What is Hallenhalt?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que le Hallenhalt ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:12
msgid "Of course.  Please, have a look around!"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Je vous en prie, jetez un coup d’œil !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:2
msgid "Thanks for the tip."
msgstr "Merci du conseil."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:13
msgid ""
"Watch where you sleep!  You never know when Skraelos will come for you."
msgstr ""
"Faites attention à l’endroit où vous dormez ! On ne sait jamais quand Skraelos viendra vous chercher."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:24
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:6
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "Non merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:2
msgid ""
"For the day of the Great Reckoning!  The day when even the gods must atone for their lives."
msgstr ""
"Pour le jour du Grand Jugement ! Le jour où même les dieux devront expier leur vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:2
msgid "What would Krohn need with an army?"
msgstr "Pourquoi Krohn aurait-il besoin d’une armée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:3
msgid "Thanks for the info!"
msgstr "Merci du renseignement !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:3
msgid "You're welcome.  Perhaps you would like to buy something?"
msgstr "Je vous en prie. Peut-être voudriez-vous acheter quelque chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:4
msgid ""
"Well I am no theologian, but as I understand it, they are Guilt, Confession, Suffering, Retribution, Absolution, Rebirth.  Once they are lit, you are free to choose your destination."
msgstr ""
"Je ne suis pas théologien, mais si j’ai bien compris, ce sont la Culpabilité, la Confession, la Souffrance, le Châtiment, l’Absolution et la Renaissance. Une fois qu’ils sont allumés, on est libre de choisir sa destination."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC336.rude:9
msgid "What are the Six Fires of Penance?"
msgstr "Que sont les Six Feux de la Pénitence ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:5
msgid ""
"Did you not learn your religion?  They must light the Six Fires of Penance.  If they can manage that, Skraelos will deem them worthy to ascend to Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Vous n’avez donc pas appris votre religion ? Ils doivent allumer les Six Feux de la Pénitence. S’ils y parviennent, Skraelos les jugera dignes de monter au Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:5
msgid "How do they work off their debts?"
msgstr "Comment s’acquittent-ils de leurs dettes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:6
msgid ""
"The Afterworld is where the unworthy go when they die.  It is a troublesome place, where the fallen souls work off the debts they earned in life."
msgstr ""
"L’Au-delà est le lieu où vont les indignes après leur mort. C’est un endroit pénible, où les âmes déchues s’acquittent des dettes qu’elles ont contractées de leur vivant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:6
msgid "What is the Afterworld?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que l’Au-delà ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:7
msgid ""
"Skraelos is the god of the Afterworld.  He is the one who decides whether someone goes to the Afterworld, or if they are worthy of Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Skraelos est le dieu de l’Au-delà. C’est lui qui décide si quelqu’un va dans l’Au-delà ou s’il est digne du Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:7
msgid "Who is Skraelos?"
msgstr "Qui est Skraelos ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:8
msgid "Certainly.  Please take a look"
msgstr "Certainement. Je vous en prie, regardez"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:9
msgid "We would like to look at your wares."
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir vos marchandises."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC17.rude:9
msgid "We're closed."
msgstr "C’est fermé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:3
msgid "IF you are skilled enough, I might help you."
msgstr "SI vous êtes assez compétents, je pourrai peut-être vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Elemental Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Experts en magie élémentaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:2
msgid ""
"Magic is the glue of life.  Without it, the whole world would unravel."
msgstr ""
"La magie est le ciment de la vie. Sans elle, le monde entier se déferait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Elemental Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Maîtres en magie élémentaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:4
msgid "I am a mage.  Why would I know anything about swords?"
msgstr "Je suis mage. Pourquoi m’y connaîtrais-je en épées ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about swordmastery?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’art de l’épée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:5
msgid "Seek Gudlaug Eitrissen in Lindisfare."
msgstr "Allez voir Gudlaug Eitrissen à Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC170.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Elemental Magic?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en magie élémentaire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:3
msgid "Possess you the skill?"
msgstr "Possédez-vous la compétence ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Light Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Experts en magie de la Lumière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:2
msgid ""
"I'm not sure, but I think I had a vision of Hallenhalt during yesterday's meditation."
msgstr ""
"Je n’en suis pas sûr, mais je crois avoir eu une vision du Hallenhalt pendant ma méditation d’hier."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Light Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Maîtres en magie de la Lumière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:4
msgid ""
"It's a valuable skill to know!  The more practice you have, the more spells you can cast."
msgstr ""
"C’est une compétence précieuse ! Plus vous vous exercez, plus vous pouvez lancer de sorts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about meditation?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la Méditation ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:5
msgid ""
"In Lindisfarne, seek one named Annabel A'Tryht.  She will put you on the right course."
msgstr ""
"À Lindisfarne, cherchez une certaine Annabel A’Tryht. Elle vous mettra sur la bonne voie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC171.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC274.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Light Magic?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en magie de la Lumière ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:3
msgid "And you think you are skilled enough?"
msgstr "Et vous pensez être assez compétents ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Dark Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Experts en magie de l’Ombre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Dark Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Maîtres en magie de l’Ombre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:4
msgid "Nothing I wish to share with you."
msgstr "Rien que je souhaite partager avec vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:5
msgid ""
"Go to Lindisfarne.  There is one named Alanna Etzeldotir who can help you."
msgstr ""
"Allez à Lindisfarne. Une certaine Alanna Etzeldotir pourra vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Dark Magic?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en magie de l’Ombre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC172.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:40 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC239.rude:40
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC320.rude:10
msgid "If you must."
msgstr "S’il le faut."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:3
msgid "Very well.  If you have the skills, I will train you."
msgstr "Très bien. Si vous avez les compétences, je vous formerai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Experts en magie du Spiritisme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:2
msgid ""
"Spirit is the key to the self.  Take care to learn it, and you will find yourself rewarded."
msgstr ""
"Le Spiritisme est la clef du soi. Prenez soin de l’apprendre et vous en serez récompensés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Master in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Maîtres en magie du Spiritisme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:4
msgid ""
"If you choose the path of magic, do not stray from it.  Your studies will bring you greatness."
msgstr ""
"Si vous choisissez la voie de la magie, ne vous en écartez pas. Vos études vous mèneront à la grandeur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC273.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC275.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about magic?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la magie ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:5
msgid "Find Gymir Lokissen in Lindisfarne."
msgstr "Trouvez Gymir Lokissen à Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC173.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC276.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Spirit Magic?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en magie du Spiritisme ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:3
msgid ""
"Many seek such training.  I ask you, do you possess the skill to become so?"
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup recherchent une telle formation. Je vous le demande : possédez-vous la compétence pour y parvenir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Meditation."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Experts en Méditation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:2
msgid ""
"Look inward for your answers, children.  For the external quest only matters as a reflection of inner growth."
msgstr ""
"Cherchez vos réponses en vous-mêmes, mes enfants. Car la quête extérieure ne compte que comme reflet de la croissance intérieure."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Meditation."
msgstr "Nous voudrions devenir Maîtres en Méditation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:4
msgid ""
"That is a place to the south of us.  For more answers, you should consult with a cartographer."
msgstr ""
"C’est un endroit au sud d’ici. Pour en savoir plus, vous devriez consulter un cartographe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:5
msgid ""
"Seek out Lindisfarne.  There is one who can help you there named Delano A'Lanth."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous à Lindisfarne. Quelqu’un du nom de Delano A’Lanth pourra vous y aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC277.rude:5
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Meditation?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en Méditation ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:6
msgid "Many people seek answers.  Perhaps I can help you find yours."
msgstr ""
"Beaucoup de gens cherchent des réponses. Je peux peut-être vous aider à trouver les vôtres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:7
msgid "It was not a bother enough to be sorry for."
msgstr "Ce n’était pas assez dérangeant pour que vous vous en excusiez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC174.rude:8
msgid "May you fare well on your journeys, friend."
msgstr "Puissiez-vous faire bon voyage, mon ami."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:1
msgid ""
"The actors.  That's not how it really happened.  I have evidence to prove it, too.  But the actors say, \"it's all craft!\"  And don't listen to my advice.  I don't understand this desire to change history based on \"artistic license\"!"
msgstr ""
"Les acteurs. Ce n’est pas comme ça que ça s’est vraiment passé. Et j’ai des preuves pour le démontrer. Mais les acteurs disent : « C’est notre art ! » Et ils n’écoutent pas mes conseils. Je ne comprends pas cette envie de changer l’histoire au nom de la « licence artistique » !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:1
msgid "What do you mean, get it right?"
msgstr "Comment ça, « en donner une version fidèle » ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've spent years researching it!  In fact, it wasn't Captain Ralof who killed Trislan at all!  It was Aklan'dor!  The one who conquered the Xisis!  At least they got that part right!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai passé des années à faire des recherches là-dessus ! En fait, ce n’est pas du tout le capitaine Ralof qui a tué Trislan ! C’était Aklan’dor ! Celui qui a conquis les Xisis ! Au moins, ça, ils l’ont bien rendu !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC175.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC231.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC233.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC265.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC380.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:20
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:4
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "Salut."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:1
msgid ""
"I really like spending my time watching the plays.  It takes my mind off the work I do.  They let me escape into a world of adventure and excitement!"
msgstr ""
"J’adore passer mon temps à regarder les pièces. Ça me change les idées après mon travail. Elles me font m’évader dans un monde d’aventure et de frissons !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC247.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC257.rude:18 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC332.rude:2
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC343.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC345.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:6
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr "Bien sûr !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:3
msgid ""
"That's what I do!  Whenever someone asks for a rock, I go and get it for them.  It's hard work!  Those rocks can be heavy!"
msgstr ""
"C’est mon métier ! Chaque fois que quelqu’un demande une pierre, je vais la lui chercher. C’est un travail dur ! Ces pierres peuvent être lourdes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC176.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about getting rocks?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la recherche de pierres ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm ready to get out of here.  These Guberlandians are driving me crazy!"
msgstr "J’ai hâte de partir d’ici. Ces Guberlandais me rendent fou !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:10
msgid "Very well.  See you later."
msgstr "Très bien. À plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:2
msgid "Great!  Get me off this rock!"
msgstr "Formidable ! Sortez-moi de ce rocher !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:2
msgid "Sounds good.  You're hired."
msgstr "Ça nous va. Vous êtes engagé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:3
msgid "My fee is 500 gold per month plus 2% of all the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Mes honoraires sont de 500 pièces d’or par mois, plus 2 % de tout l’or que nous trouverons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:4
msgid "So you're for hire?"
msgstr "Alors vous êtes à louer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:4
msgid ""
"Yes.  As I said, I'm a merchant.  I have a keen eye for quality, and a quick tongue.  I could help you get better prices for all the things you buy and sell."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Comme je vous l’ai dit, je suis marchand. J’ai l’œil pour la qualité et la langue bien pendue. Je pourrais vous aider à obtenir de meilleurs prix sur tout ce que vous achetez et vendez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:5
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost all my money in a bar bet.  I've been trying to hire out my services to raise some cash."
msgstr ""
"Il semble que j’aie perdu tout mon argent sur un pari de taverne. J’essaie de louer mes services pour me renflouer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:5
msgid "Why Haven't you left?"
msgstr "Pourquoi n’êtes-vous pas parti ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:7
msgid "I know I've seen enough of it!  These people are making me nuts!"
msgstr "J’en ai bien assez vu, croyez-moi ! Ces gens me rendent dingue !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:8
msgid "Alright, but you're losing money as long as I'm not around."
msgstr ""
"D’accord, mais vous perdez de l’argent tant que je ne suis pas avec vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:6
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr "Une autre fois, peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:9
msgid ""
"I'm a merchant.  I've been stranded here in Guberland for weeks.  It's beginning driving me crazy."
msgstr ""
"Je suis marchand. Je suis coincé ici à Guberland depuis des semaines. Ça commence à me rendre fou."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC177.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:19
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC423.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:4
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Que faites-vous ici ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:1
msgid ""
"Alfrigg Halfdanssen asked me to mend his sword, but before he gave it to me he changed his mind.  I still don't know why."
msgstr ""
"Alfrigg Halfdanssen m’a demandé de réparer son épée, mais avant de me la donner, il a changé d’avis. Je ne sais toujours pas pourquoi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:2
msgid "Alright.  You're hired!"
msgstr "D’accord. Vous êtes engagé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC253.rude:2
msgid "Great!  I won't let you down!"
msgstr "Formidable ! Je ne vous décevrai pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:3
msgid ""
"For the price of 600 gold per month, I would be willing to be your traveling repairman.  I'd go where you go, and fix all your stuff for free."
msgstr ""
"Pour 600 pièces d’or par mois, je serais prêt à être votre réparateur itinérant. J’irais où vous irez et je réparerais tout votre matériel gratuitement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:3
msgid "How much do you charge?"
msgstr "Combien demandez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:5
msgid "How's business?"
msgstr "Comment vont les affaires ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:4
msgid ""
"Slow.  People around here never want to let me fix their things.  They usually would rather do it themselves."
msgstr ""
"Au ralenti. Les gens d’ici ne veulent jamais me laisser réparer leurs affaires. Ils préfèrent généralement le faire eux-mêmes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:6
msgid "I can fix just about anything you give me, that's all!"
msgstr "Je peux réparer à peu près tout ce que vous me donnez, voilà tout !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about mending things?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la réparation des objets ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:7
msgid "Okay.  Bye."
msgstr "D’accord. Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:7
msgid "Sorry, we don't need anyone to fix our things."
msgstr "Désolés, nous n’avons besoin de personne pour réparer nos affaires."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:8
msgid "I'm a tinker.  I mend things."
msgstr "Je suis ferrailleur. Je répare les objets."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:6
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr "Que faites-vous ici ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:9
msgid "Alright.  I'll be around if you need me."
msgstr "D’accord. Je ne serai pas loin si vous avez besoin de moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC178.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:14
msgid "We no longer need your services."
msgstr "Nous n’avons plus besoin de vos services."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:10
msgid "I understand, friends.  May the gods bless your endeavors."
msgstr "Je comprends, mes amis. Que les dieux bénissent vos entreprises."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:11
msgid "Did you call it my time?  What a strange way to put it!"
msgstr "Vous avez dit « mon temps » ? Quelle étrange façon de parler !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:12
msgid "My time?  Why should I own time?"
msgstr "Mon temps ? Pourquoi posséderais-je le temps ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:2
msgid ""
"I have heard that on the plains of Grimknak, the Oozli have started a coup against the Hatoi.  I pray that the Hatoi sqorl their Narfti and not give in."
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire que dans les plaines de Grimknak, les Oozli ont fomenté un coup contre les Hatoi. Je prie pour que les Hatoi sqorlent leurs Narfti et ne cèdent pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:3
msgid "A bargain.  You're hired."
msgstr "Une affaire. Vous êtes engagé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:3
msgid "Your travel just got much easier."
msgstr "Vos voyages viennent de devenir bien plus faciles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  I charge 1000 gold per month plus 15% of the gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Je demande 1000 pièces d’or par mois, plus 15 % de l’or que vous trouverez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:4
msgid "You're for hire?"
msgstr "Vous êtes à louer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:5
msgid "Gods willing, I will have your answers."
msgstr "Si les dieux le veulent, j’aurai vos réponses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:6
msgid "A strange place this is.  I often long for my home in the Tizkak."
msgstr ""
"Étrange endroit que celui-ci. Je regrette souvent mon foyer dans le Tizkak."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Chedian"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Chedian ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:7
msgid "Perhaps you will find a time when money isn't so important."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être viendra-t-il un temps où l’argent ne sera pas si important pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:7
msgid "That's too deep for our pockets."
msgstr "C’est trop cher pour nos bourses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:8
msgid ""
"In your language I am called a Gate Master.  I can teleport you to any nearby city in Chedian, for a price."
msgstr ""
"Dans votre langue, on m’appelle Maître de la porte. Je peux vous téléporter dans n’importe quelle ville proche de Chedian, moyennant paiement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:6
msgid "What do you do?"
msgstr "Que faites-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC179.rude:9
msgid "We'd like you to cast Town Portal."
msgstr "Nous voudrions que vous lanciez Porte de rappel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:1
msgid "Glad to hear it.  Were you looking for passage?"
msgstr "Ravi de l’entendre. Cherchiez-vous une traversée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:1
msgid "Perhaps we will."
msgstr "Peut-être bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:11
msgid "And what sort of info would that be?"
msgstr "Et quel genre de renseignements ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:4
msgid "No thanks, I was hoping you might have some information."
msgstr "Non merci, j’espérais que vous auriez des renseignements."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:13
msgid ""
"He is the Jarl of the Thjorgard Clan.  As long as he keeps the Thjoradric Mines running, I'll never know starvation."
msgstr ""
"C’est le Jarl du clan de Thjorgard. Tant qu’il fera tourner les Mines thjoradiques, je ne connaîtrai jamais la famine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about Sven Forkbeard?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Sven Forkbeard ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:14
msgid ""
"Good and bad.  Ever since the mountain pass between Thjorgard and Thronheim has been lost, we ship captains have made a great deal of money."
msgstr ""
"Il y a du bon et du mauvais. Depuis que le col de montagne entre Thjorgard et Thronheim est perdu, nous autres capitaines de navire avons gagné beaucoup d’argent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:15
msgid "Certainly.  Anything else?"
msgstr "Certainement. Autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:2
msgid ""
"If there was something to be done about it, Tryygva Ravenlocks would have found it by now.  He wouldn't let his people starve.  Perhaps you should talk to him about it."
msgstr ""
"S’il y avait quelque chose à faire, Tryygva Ravenlocks l’aurait déjà trouvé. Il ne laisserait pas son peuple mourir de faim. Vous devriez peut-être lui en parler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:2
msgid "No one can do anything about it?"
msgstr "Personne ne peut rien y faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:3
msgid ""
"The port in Frosgard has been frozen solid.  It used to be a lucrative place to put in, but now, no ship captain in their right mind would try to brave those treacherous waters.  The poor souls who live there must be starving by now."
msgstr ""
"Le port de Frosgard est pris dans les glaces. C’était autrefois une escale lucrative, mais aujourd’hui, aucun capitaine sensé ne tenterait d’affronter ces eaux traîtresses. Les pauvres gens qui vivent là-bas doivent mourir de faim à l’heure qu’il est."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:3
msgid "What's bad then?"
msgstr "Et qu’y a-t-il de mauvais, alors ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:4
msgid "Could you take us there?"
msgstr "Pourriez-vous nous y emmener ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:4
msgid ""
"I don't know why you would be wanting me to take you there.  It's somewhere in the hills of Thjorgard.  That's all I know."
msgstr ""
"Je ne vois pas pourquoi vous voudriez que je vous y emmène. C’est quelque part dans les collines de Thjorgard. C’est tout ce que je sais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:1
msgid "And what would that be?"
msgstr "Et qu’est-ce que ce serait ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:5
msgid "Perhaps we should ask you about something else."
msgstr "Nous devrions peut-être vous interroger sur autre chose."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:6
msgid "Nothing.  Who is that?"
msgstr "Rien. Qui est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:7
msgid "I think that we will."
msgstr "Je crois que oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:8
msgid "Yes, please."
msgstr "Oui, s’il vous plaît."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:9
msgid "Aye, I've heard of that place."
msgstr "Oui, j’ai entendu parler de cet endroit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC18.rude:9
msgid "Have you heard of a place known as The Training Hall?"
msgstr ""
"Avez-vous entendu parler d’un endroit appelé la Salle d’entraînement ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:5
msgid "Tell them we will be meeting in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr "Dites-leur que nous nous réunirons à Thronheim dans deux semaines."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:1
msgid "The message is as good as sent!  I will see you at the war council."
msgstr ""
"Le message est comme envoyé ! Je vous retrouverai au conseil de guerre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:10
msgid ""
"Farewell, adventures, and thank you.  You have raised the hearts and saved the lives of thousands."
msgstr ""
"Adieu, aventuriers, et merci. Vous avez réchauffé les cœurs et sauvé des milliers de vies."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:10
msgid "We have more to do, but when that is done, we shall."
msgstr "Nous avons encore à faire, mais quand ce sera fait, nous le ferons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:11
msgid ""
"That is indeed good news.  Here is a small reward.  It may not be much, but behind it is the thanks and love of the thousands of lives you have saved."
msgstr ""
"Voilà en effet une bonne nouvelle. Voici une petite récompense. Ce n’est peut-être pas grand-chose, mais elle porte la gratitude et l’affection des milliers de personnes dont vous avez sauvé la vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:11
msgid "The boats should be coming very soon."
msgstr "Les bateaux devraient arriver très bientôt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:12
msgid "A promise?  What sort of promise?"
msgstr "Une promesse ? Quel genre de promesse ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:12
msgid "He wants you to make a promise."
msgstr "Il veut que vous lui fassiez une promesse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:13
msgid ""
"For as long as anyone can remember, there has been a frost giant who lives in Yanmir's Sky Fort.  When we were young we all heard stories of how he would come down at night and eat children.  Well the stories have turned out to be true."
msgstr ""
"Aussi loin que remontent les souvenirs, un géant du gel a toujours vécu dans le Fort céleste de Yanmir. Quand nous étions jeunes, nous avons tous entendu raconter qu’il descendait la nuit pour manger les enfants. Eh bien, ces histoires se sont révélées vraies."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:13
msgid "Tell us about the frost giant."
msgstr "Parlez-nous du géant du gel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:14
msgid ""
"Only if you could defeat the Frost Giant, or somehow break up the ice so the ships can put in to our port."
msgstr ""
"Seulement si vous parveniez à vaincre le Géant du Gel, ou à briser la glace d’une manière ou d’une autre pour que les navires puissent accoster dans notre port."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:14
msgid "Perhaps we could help?"
msgstr "Peut-être pourrions-nous aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:15
msgid "But without your help, the Chedian will perish!"
msgstr "Mais sans votre aide, les Chediens périront !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:15
msgid ""
"We are already perishing up here.  I have done all I can, and it is still not enough."
msgstr ""
"Nous périssons déjà, ici. J’ai fait tout ce que je pouvais, et ce n’est toujours pas assez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:16
msgid ""
"I am sorry.  I have no more help to give.  My nation is in shambles.  The people are starving because the boats can't get through.  Yanmir the Frost Giant is eating our children.  I have my hands full.  I cannot give any more."
msgstr ""
"Je suis désolé. Je n’ai plus d’aide à offrir. Ma nation est en ruine. Le peuple meurt de faim parce que les bateaux ne peuvent pas passer. Yanmir le Géant du Gel dévore nos enfants. J’ai déjà fort à faire. Je ne peux rien donner de plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:17
msgid "A promise to remember to celebrate him."
msgstr "La promesse de ne pas oublier de le célébrer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:17
msgid ""
"If he brings the crops back, of course I will make that promise.  How does he want it?  A declaration?  I PROMISE!!  Is that good enough?"
msgstr ""
"S’il fait revenir les récoltes, bien sûr que je ferai cette promesse. Comment la veut-il ? Une déclaration ? JE LE PROMETS !! Cela lui suffit-il ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:18
msgid ""
"A runestone promise?  I can think of nothing more binding than that.  If it brings my people back from the brink of starvation, I shall carve that runestone myself!"
msgstr ""
"Une promesse sur une pierre runique ? Je ne vois rien de plus solennel. Si cela sauve mon peuple de la famine, je graverai cette pierre runique moi-même !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:18
msgid "He wants you to carve it on a runestone."
msgstr "Il veut que vous la graviez sur une pierre runique."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:19
msgid "I appreciate that.  Thank you for all your help."
msgstr "Je vous en suis reconnaissant. Merci pour toute votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:19
msgid "We will tell him that for you."
msgstr "Nous le lui dirons de votre part."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:2
msgid ""
"News?  I only seem to deal in bad news.  My people are starving, and our children are being eaten by the Frost Giant.  How could things get any worse?"
msgstr ""
"Des nouvelles ? On dirait que je n’ai que de mauvaises nouvelles. Mon peuple meurt de faim et nos enfants sont dévorés par le Géant du Gel. Comment les choses pourraient-elles être pires ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:20
msgid ""
"No, I mean it!  You have done more for Frosgard than I ever have.  Perhaps it is you who should be Jarls.  I'm sorry; I shouldn't put that weight on you.  Was there anything else?"
msgstr ""
"Non, je suis sincère ! Vous avez fait plus pour Frosgard que je ne l’ai jamais fait. C’est peut-être vous qui devriez être Jarls. Pardonnez-moi, je ne devrais pas vous charger de ce fardeau. Y avait-il autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:16
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "Je vous en prie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:22
msgid ""
"I've heard that an army is marching towards us.  Good.  I won't put up a fight.  Maybe they will be able to rule Frosgard better than I have."
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire qu’une armée marche sur nous. Tant mieux. Je n’opposerai aucune résistance. Ils sauront peut-être mieux gouverner Frosgard que moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC278.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the hordes?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des hordes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:23
msgid ""
"Frosgard used to have a thriving port, but in the last few years, the ice that comes in the winter has never gone away.  Since the boats can't get through, they can't bring enough food to feed our people."
msgstr ""
"Frosgard avait autrefois un port prospère, mais ces dernières années, la glace qui vient en hiver n’est jamais repartie. Comme les bateaux ne peuvent pas passer, ils ne peuvent pas apporter assez de nourriture pour nourrir notre peuple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:23
msgid "Tell us about the frozen sea."
msgstr "Parlez-nous de la mer gelée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:24
msgid "Is there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "Aviez-vous besoin d’autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:25 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:37
msgid ""
"Great!  You have done a wonderful thing!  I shall send word to all the Jarls immediately!"
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! Vous avez accompli une chose merveilleuse ! Je vais prévenir tous les Jarls sur-le-champ !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:26
msgid "About those things you need done...."
msgstr "À propos de ces choses que vous voulez voir faites…"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:27
msgid ""
"Sven Svenssen you mean?  He's the Jarl of Thjorgard.  I wish I were in his shoes.  Maybe I should talk to him for some advice.  He's the most powerful man in Chedian!"
msgstr ""
"Sven Svenssen, vous voulez dire ? C’est le Jarl de Thjorgard. J’aimerais bien être à sa place. Je devrais peut-être lui demander conseil. C’est l’homme le plus puissant de Chedian !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:28
msgid "Good luck in your travels."
msgstr "Bonne chance pour vos voyages."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:29 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:39
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:33
msgid "We've already done that."
msgstr "Nous l’avons déjà fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:29
msgid ""
"You have?  Wonderful!  You have put the first smile on this old face in many years!"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Merveilleux ! Vous avez fait naître le premier sourire sur ce vieux visage depuis bien des années !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:3
msgid "May Krohn himself take an interest in your success!  Good luck!"
msgstr "Que Krohn lui-même s’intéresse à votre réussite ! Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:30
msgid "What?  How?  Even my strongest men couldn't do such a feat!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? Comment ? Même mes hommes les plus forts n’auraient pu accomplir un tel exploit !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:31
msgid "Yanmir the Frost Giant is dead."
msgstr "Yanmir le Géant du Gel est mort."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:31
msgid ""
"You have slain him?  How can that be?  He has killed some of my best soldiers before you?"
msgstr ""
"Vous l’avez tué ? Comment est-ce possible ? Il a tué certains de mes meilleurs soldats avant vous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:32
msgid "I don't blame you.  It's an impossible task."
msgstr "Je ne vous en veux pas. C’est une tâche impossible."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:32
msgid "We need more time before we can take that on."
msgstr "Il nous faut plus de temps avant de nous y attaquer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:33
msgid ""
"I have heard!!  What wonderful news!  You have put a smile on this old face for the first time in years!"
msgstr ""
"Je l’ai appris !! Quelle merveilleuse nouvelle ! Vous avez fait sourire ce vieux visage pour la première fois depuis des années !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:33
msgid "The ice has been cleared from the docks."
msgstr "La glace a été dégagée des quais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:34
msgid "I know it's an impossible task.  I don't blame you for not taking it."
msgstr ""
"Je sais que c’est une tâche impossible. Je ne vous reproche pas de la refuser."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:34
msgid "We can't do that right now."
msgstr "Nous ne pouvons pas faire cela pour le moment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:35
msgid "We have done as you asked.  Will you help us now?"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons fait ce que vous demandiez. Allez-vous nous aider maintenant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:36
msgid "It's running out for me you know.  Time that is."
msgstr "Il m’est compté, vous savez. Le temps, je veux dire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:37
msgid "The Clans have united.  It is time for the war council."
msgstr "Les clans se sont unis. L’heure du conseil de guerre est venue."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:38
msgid ""
"Maybe you should talk to Soxolf Tryygvassen.  He built the one we have in the first place.  I'm sure he'll be able to help."
msgstr ""
"Vous devriez peut-être parler à Soxolf Tryygvassen. C’est lui qui a construit celui que nous avons. Je suis sûr qu’il pourra vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:38
msgid "The Green Man asked us to fix the maypole."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert nous a demandé de réparer le mât de mai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:39
msgid "The Green Man asked you to do something for him."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert vous a demandé de faire quelque chose pour lui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:39 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:11
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC32.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC34.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:3
msgid "What is that?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que c'est ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:4
msgid ""
"If you could help me, you would find a way to break up that ice, so the boats could travel again.  If you would do that, the skalds would make sure your names lived forever!"
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez m’aider, trouvez un moyen de briser cette glace pour que les bateaux puissent de nouveau naviguer. Si vous y parveniez, les scaldes veilleraient à ce que vos noms vivent à jamais !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:4
msgid "What can we do?"
msgstr "Que pouvons-nous faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:41
msgid "We failed you Tryygva, and we are sorry."
msgstr "Nous avons échoué, Tryygva, et nous en sommes désolés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:41
msgid ""
"You may yet have the chance to save my people again, warriors.  Go, and rescue us."
msgstr ""
"Vous aurez peut-être encore l’occasion de sauver mon peuple, guerriers. Allez, et sauvez-nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:5
msgid "May the gods look kindly upon you for all your days!"
msgstr "Que les dieux vous soient favorables tous les jours de votre vie !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:6
msgid ""
"But I see you were.  That is great news!  I am certain all the families throughout Frosgard will be thanking you!  Here is a reward.  It is a pittance, I know, but we are poor here.  Think of it more as a symbol of our gratitude."
msgstr ""
"Mais je vois que si. C’est une excellente nouvelle ! Je suis certain que toutes les familles de Frosgard vous remercieront ! Voici une récompense. C’est une misère, je sais, mais nous sommes pauvres ici. Voyez-la plutôt comme un symbole de notre gratitude."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:6
msgid "Perhaps they were not strong enough."
msgstr "Peut-être n’étaient-ils pas assez forts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:35 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:7
msgid ""
"It would seem there is nothing you cannot accomplish.  I would be proud to call you allies."
msgstr ""
"On dirait que rien ne vous est impossible. Je serais fier de vous appeler mes alliés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:7
msgid "Now that we have done as you asked, will you join us?"
msgstr ""
"Maintenant que nous avons fait ce que vous demandiez, allez-vous vous joindre à nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:8
msgid ""
"If you are to help me, find a way into the Sky Fort, and slay the Frost Giant.  As far as I know, it would be impossible to kill him outright.  But the Sky Fort is old and rickety.  I'm sure there is a way you could trick him into killing himself."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez m’aider, trouvez un moyen d’entrer dans le Fort céleste et tuez le Géant du Gel. Pour autant que je sache, il est impossible de le tuer directement. Mais le Fort céleste est vieux et branlant. Je suis sûr qu’il existe un moyen de le piéger pour qu’il se tue lui-même."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:4
msgid "What can we do to help?"
msgstr "Que pouvons-nous faire pour aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:9
msgid "Send the word, and Frosgard shall be ready."
msgstr "Envoyez le signal, et Frosgard sera prêt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC180.rude:9
msgid "We shall be having a war council soon."
msgstr "Nous tiendrons bientôt un conseil de guerre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:1
msgid "The Ranger's Trial consist of two separate tasks."
msgstr "L’Épreuve du Rôdeur consiste en deux tâches distinctes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:11
msgid "Come back to me when you do."
msgstr "Revenez me voir quand ce sera le cas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:12
msgid "Tell us about the second task."
msgstr "Parlez-nous de la seconde tâche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:12
msgid ""
"There is a place in Frosgard known as the Dungeon of Secrets.  To pass the second test, you must go from one end of the dungeon to the other.  If you survive, you pass."
msgstr ""
"Il y a à Frosgard un endroit appelé le Donjon des Secrets. Pour réussir la seconde épreuve, vous devez traverser le donjon d’un bout à l’autre. Si vous survivez, vous avez réussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:13
msgid "Perhaps you are not yet worthy."
msgstr "Peut-être n’êtes-vous pas encore dignes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:14
msgid "Maybe you are not worthy just yet."
msgstr "Vous n’êtes peut-être pas encore tout à fait dignes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:15
msgid ""
"All of Frosgard has neglected nature.  It's no wonder the people are starving!"
msgstr ""
"Tout Frosgard a négligé la nature. Pas étonnant que le peuple meure de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:13
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:7
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Perhaps another time."
msgstr "Une autre fois, peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:16
msgid "You will return when you are braver."
msgstr "Vous reviendrez quand vous serez plus braves."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:17
msgid "About the Ranger's Trial."
msgstr "À propos de l’Épreuve du Rôdeur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:18
msgid ""
"Chadwick already informed me of your success.  Congratulations.  I hereby promote you to Rangers."
msgstr ""
"Chadwick m’a déjà informé de votre réussite. Félicitations. Je vous promeus par la présente au rang de Rôdeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:18
msgid "We've completed the Ranger's Trial."
msgstr "Nous avons réussi l’Épreuve du Rôdeur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:19
msgid "Good Luck"
msgstr "Bonne chance"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:19
msgid "We will do these tasks"
msgstr "Nous accomplirons ces tâches"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:2
msgid "Carry yourselves with pride and honor.  Farewell."
msgstr "Portez-vous avec fierté et honneur. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:3
msgid "Tell us about the first task."
msgstr "Parlez-nous de la première tâche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:3
msgid ""
"There is a bow known as Everstrike.  It is the greatest bow ever made.  It never misses.  To pass the first test, you need to find this bow.  The last I heard, someone named the Dook had been looking for it also.  You'd better find it before he does."
msgstr ""
"Il existe un arc appelé Everstrike. C’est le plus grand arc jamais fabriqué. Il ne manque jamais sa cible. Pour réussir la première épreuve, vous devez trouver cet arc. Aux dernières nouvelles, un certain Dook le cherchait aussi. Vous feriez bien de le trouver avant lui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:5
msgid "Very good."
msgstr "Très bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:6
msgid ""
"Frosgard is facing a plight of nature.  It's horrible.  I wish Tryygva would do something about it!"
msgstr ""
"Frosgard subit un fléau de la nature. C’est horrible. Si seulement Tryygva faisait quelque chose !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:8
msgid "Very well.  Good luck."
msgstr "Très bien. Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:9
msgid ""
"The Ranger's Test is quite an ordeal.  Do you have any that are worthy?"
msgstr ""
"L’Épreuve du Rôdeur est une rude épreuve. En avez-vous qui en soient dignes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC181.rude:9
msgid "We've heard you can promote Crusaders to Rangers."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons entendu dire que vous pouviez promouvoir les Croisés en Rôdeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:2
msgid "How do we find the Green Man?"
msgstr "Comment trouver l’Homme Vert ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:2
msgid ""
"There is a man who might be able to help you.  He is a tracker named Fland de Allasan A'Lanth a'rysha.  The last I saw of him, he was hanging around Frosgard City."
msgstr ""
"Il y a un homme qui pourrait vous aider. C’est un traqueur du nom de Fland de Allasan A’Lanth a’ryshar. La dernière fois que je l’ai vu, il traînait dans la Cité de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's a travesty how the people here have neglected the Green Man!  It's no wonder he's abandon us!"
msgstr ""
"C’est une honte, la façon dont les gens d’ici ont négligé l’Homme Vert ! Pas étonnant qu’il nous ait abandonnés !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:20
msgid "I wish you luck."
msgstr "Je vous souhaite bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:4
msgid "We will find the Green Man."
msgstr "Nous trouverons l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:5
msgid ""
"To have your worth truly measured, you must find the Green Man.  The people of Frosgard have long neglected him, and he has not been seen much anymore.  If you can find the Green Man and gain his approval, you will not need me to promote you."
msgstr ""
"Pour que votre valeur soit réellement mesurée, vous devez trouver l’Homme Vert. Les gens de Frosgard l’ont longtemps négligé et on ne le voit presque plus. Si vous trouvez l’Homme Vert et gagnez son approbation, vous n’aurez pas besoin de moi pour vous promouvoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:6
msgid "Our Healers are looking for promotion."
msgstr "Nos Guérisseurs souhaitent une promotion."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:6
msgid ""
"The Druidical Endeavor is not for the weak.  Not all Healers are worthy of becoming Druids.  Do you have any who are worthy of this promotion?"
msgstr ""
"L’Épreuve druidique n’est pas pour les faibles. Tous les Guérisseurs ne sont pas dignes de devenir Druides. En avez-vous qui soient dignes de cette promotion ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:7
msgid "He's a very difficult person to find!"
msgstr "Il est très difficile à trouver !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the Green Man?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’Homme Vert ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:8
msgid "Maybe you are not as worthy as you thought you were."
msgstr "Vous n’êtes peut-être pas aussi dignes que vous le pensiez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:8
msgid "Perhaps we will do this later."
msgstr "Nous le ferons peut-être plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC182.rude:9
msgid "Come back when you have."
msgstr "Revenez quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:1
msgid "Thanks for the advice."
msgstr "Merci du conseil."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:2
msgid ""
"Only if you wish to become a Lich.  Here, I have the first half of it.  Only by finding the second half will you be able to become a lich."
msgstr ""
"Seulement si vous souhaitez devenir Liche. Tenez, j’en ai la première moitié. Ce n’est qu’en trouvant la seconde moitié que vous pourrez devenir liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:2
msgid "We have to get this document?"
msgstr "Nous devons obtenir ce document ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:3
msgid ""
"Then I shall tell you of the Lich's Transmutation.  In the place known as Chasm of the Dead, an ancient burial ground in Drangheim lies a parchment that contains the instructions on how to become a Lich."
msgstr ""
"Alors je vais vous parler de la Transmutation de la Liche. Dans le lieu appelé Gouffre des Morts, un ancien cimetière de Drangheim, se trouve un parchemin qui contient les instructions pour devenir Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:4
msgid ""
"Perhaps one day there will be a Scholar among you who will wish to become a Lich?"
msgstr ""
"Peut-être y aura-t-il un jour parmi vous un Erudit qui souhaitera devenir Liche ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:4
msgid "What sort of information is that?"
msgstr "De quel genre de renseignements s’agit-il ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:5
msgid ""
"You have the look of someone who might be interested in the information I have."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l’air de gens que les renseignements que je détiens pourraient intéresser."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC388.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:3
msgid "Ask your questions."
msgstr "Posez vos questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:7
msgid "That is too bad.  There is gold to be had there, also."
msgstr "C’est bien dommage. Il y a aussi de l’or à gagner là-bas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC183.rude:8
msgid "More than I shall share with you."
msgstr "Plus que je ne vous en dirai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:1
msgid "Sorry"
msgstr "Désolés"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:1
msgid ""
"Well no sense in getting upset over it.  Here's a little bit for your effort.  I appreciate you trying at least.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Bah, inutile de s’énerver pour ça. Voici un petit quelque chose pour votre peine. Je vous suis reconnaissant d’avoir au moins essayé. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:10
msgid ""
"As a matter of fact, there is.  You see my apprentices have created a new brew that doesn't seem to be popular here.  It's a strange color, and there's not much of the foam on it, but I have a feeling the Guberlandians will like it."
msgstr ""
"À vrai dire, oui. Voyez-vous, mes apprentis ont créé une nouvelle bière qui ne semble pas plaire ici. Elle a une couleur étrange et peu de mousse, mais j’ai le sentiment que les Guberlandais l’aimeront."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:11
msgid "Alright.  Ask your questions."
msgstr "Très bien. Posez vos questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:12
msgid "That's great news!  How much did you get for it?"
msgstr "Excellente nouvelle ! Combien en avez-vous tiré ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:12
msgid "We sold the beer."
msgstr "Nous avons vendu la bière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:13
msgid "We couldn't sell the beer."
msgstr "Nous n’avons pas pu vendre la bière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:13
msgid ""
"You dolts!  I bet you told them my apprentices made it, didn't you!  Now what am I going to do with all this stuff?  I'll have to throw it out!"
msgstr ""
"Bande d’abrutis ! Je parie que vous leur avez dit que c’étaient mes apprentis qui l’avaient faite, hein ! Qu’est-ce que je vais faire de tout ce breuvage, maintenant ? Il va falloir que je le jette !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:2
msgid "500 gold."
msgstr "500 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:2
msgid ""
"Great!  Tell you what, why don't you keep that.  If they like it, I'm sure they'll want to order more.  Thanks for your help.  I really appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! Écoutez, pourquoi ne garderiez-vous pas cet argent ? Si elle leur plaît, je suis sûr qu’ils voudront en commander davantage. Merci pour votre aide. Je vous en suis très reconnaissant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:5
msgid ""
"Two of my apprentices have come up with a new concoction, and it's horrible!  Just the thing I can sell to the Guberland Clan."
msgstr ""
"Deux de mes apprentis ont inventé un nouveau breuvage, et il est infect ! Exactement ce que je peux vendre au clan de Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:6
msgid "Very good.  Once you've sold the keg, return to me for your reward."
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Une fois le tonnelet vendu, revenez me voir pour votre récompense."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:6
msgid "We will be happy to do that for you."
msgstr "Nous ferons cela pour vous avec plaisir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:7
msgid ""
"I want you to go to the tavern in Guberland and convince them to purchase this brew.  If they like what you give them, tell them there will be more where that came from!"
msgstr ""
"Je veux que vous alliez à la taverne de Guberland et que vous les convainquiez d’acheter cette bière. Si elle leur plaît, dites-leur qu’il y en a encore beaucoup d’où elle vient !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:8
msgid ""
"They're all pretty much suckers.  If I find a brew I've had for too long, or something that's gone bad, I can usually sell it in Guberland for outrageous profits."
msgstr ""
"Ce sont tous des pigeons, ou presque. Si j’ai une bière qui traîne depuis trop longtemps, ou quelque chose qui a tourné, je peux d’habitude la vendre à Guberland avec des bénéfices scandaleux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:9
msgid "Alright.  Well I guess I'll hang on to it a little longer then."
msgstr "Bon. Eh bien, je suppose que je vais la garder encore un peu, alors."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC184.rude:9
msgid "We don't have time to peddle beer."
msgstr "Nous n’avons pas le temps de colporter de la bière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC240.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC282.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC378.rude:2
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC36.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:3
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:8
msgid "Thanks for the tip!"
msgstr "Merci du conseil !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:2
msgid "Of course you may."
msgstr "Bien sûr que oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:3
msgid ""
"Find yourself a healer.  They will save your behind more often than any plain old fighter could!"
msgstr ""
"Trouvez-vous un guérisseur. Il vous sauvera la mise plus souvent que n’importe quel simple guerrier !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC337.rude:20
msgid "Go in peace, children."
msgstr "Allez en paix, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:7
msgid "Have you heard anything interesting?"
msgstr "Avez-vous entendu quelque chose d’intéressant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC185.rude:5
msgid "I heard Skulkil the Dark knows how to become a lich."
msgstr "J’ai entendu dire que Skulkil le Sombre sait comment devenir liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:2
msgid "Well thanks for your help.  Farewell."
msgstr "Eh bien, merci pour votre aide. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:2
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Ouais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:3
msgid ""
"Business has been pretty bad around here.  It's time for me to move on to greener pastures, I think.  I'd like to go to Thronheim, but it is a dangerous journey, and I couldn't do it alone."
msgstr ""
"Les affaires vont plutôt mal par ici. Je crois qu’il est temps pour moi d’aller voir si l’herbe est plus verte ailleurs. J’aimerais aller à Thronheim, mais le voyage est dangereux et je ne pourrais pas le faire seul."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:4
msgid "We've come to guard your boat."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus garder votre bateau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:4
msgid ""
"You have?!  Great! I plan on leaving at six tomorrow morning.  Show up at the dock at 3 am and relieve the late guard.  I'll come and relieve you myself around 6."
msgstr ""
"C’est vrai ?! Formidable ! Je compte partir demain à six heures du matin. Présentez-vous au quai à 3 heures du matin et relevez le garde de nuit. Je viendrai vous relever moi-même vers 6 heures."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:5
msgid "Thronheim is a wonderful place!  I'm sure it will make me a fortune!"
msgstr ""
"Thronheim est un endroit merveilleux ! Je suis sûr que j’y ferai fortune !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC241.rude:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC242.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC252.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC255.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC272.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC280.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Thronheim?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Thronheim ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:7
msgid "Three to six AM!"
msgstr "De trois à six heures du matin !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:7
msgid "When is our shift again?"
msgstr "C’est quand, déjà, notre tour de garde ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:8
msgid "Great, thanks to you!"
msgstr "Très bien, grâce à vous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:9
msgid "Good luck on your journey."
msgstr "Bon voyage."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC186.rude:9
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Thorfinn told me to pay you this gold for your help.  I guess this makes you a Mercenary now?"
msgstr ""
"Merci ! Thorfinn m’a dit de vous payer cet or pour votre aide. Je suppose que cela fait de vous des Mercenaires, maintenant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:1
msgid ""
"My father's business is not doing well.  We want to move to Thronheim."
msgstr ""
"Les affaires de mon père ne marchent pas bien. Nous voulons partir pour Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:3
msgid "My father says that moving there will make us rich!"
msgstr "Mon père dit que nous deviendrons riches en allant là-bas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC187.rude:5
msgid ""
"I heard Skulkil the Dark in Frosgard teaches people how to become Liches."
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire que Skulkil le Sombre, à Frosgard, enseigne aux gens comment devenir Liches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:2
msgid ""
"Good luck!  It's been a long time since there was a temple to Igdrasa in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"Bonne chance ! Cela fait bien longtemps qu’il n’y a plus eu de temple d’Igdrasa à Guberland."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC3.rude:9
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr "Parfait !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:3
msgid ""
"Here, that should do it.  Now don't lose it, I don't want you to keep bothering me!"
msgstr ""
"Tenez, ça devrait aller. Et ne le perdez pas, je ne veux pas que vous reveniez m’importuner !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:4
msgid "News?  Me?  What sort of news do you think an old priest has?"
msgstr ""
"Des nouvelles ? Moi ? Quel genre de nouvelles croyez-vous qu’un vieux prêtre puisse avoir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:5
msgid ""
"Ahh never mind.  You'll just forget it if I teach it to you.  Let me write it down."
msgstr ""
"Ah, et puis non. Vous l’oublierez de toute façon si je vous l’enseigne. Laissez-moi plutôt l’écrire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:5
msgid "Yes, please teach us."
msgstr "Oui, enseignez-le-nous, s’il vous plaît."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:6
msgid ""
"Ah, is that so?  Someone's finally replacing that Guberland Temple, eh?  I suppose I could teach you."
msgstr ""
"Ah, vraiment ? Quelqu’un remplace enfin ce temple de Guberland, hein ? Je suppose que je pourrais vous l’enseigner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:2
msgid "We need to learn the Ritual of Consecration."
msgstr "Nous devons apprendre le Rituel de Consécration."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:7
msgid "We're looking for a priest."
msgstr "Nous cherchons un prêtre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:7
msgid ""
"Well I'd say you found one.  An old one, but I've still got enough rocks in this braincase to do."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je dirais que vous en avez trouvé un. Un vieux, mais il me reste encore assez de cervelle pour faire l’affaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:8
msgid ""
"If you are seeking to be promoted to priest, seek out Gray Slemnir in Guberland."
msgstr ""
"Si vous cherchez à être promus Prêtres, allez voir Slemnir le Gris à Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC188.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about priests?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des prêtres ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:2
msgid ""
"Great!  Just remember these things.  Follow the path you had been going, always go left, and don't enter the tunnel.  Good luck."
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! Retenez seulement ceci : suivez le chemin que vous suiviez, allez toujours à gauche et n’entrez pas dans le tunnel. Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:3
msgid ""
"You're in luck.  I've tracked him before.  It shouldn't be too hard to find him again.  Unfortunately, I am unable to lead you to him.  I could tell you the path I took though.  Would that be alright?"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez de la chance. Je l’ai déjà pisté. Ça ne devrait pas être trop difficile de le retrouver. Malheureusement, je ne peux pas vous conduire jusqu’à lui. Mais je pourrais vous indiquer le chemin que j’ai pris. Cela vous irait ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:4
msgid "Not that I'm willing to share."
msgstr "Rien que je sois prêt à partager."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:5
msgid "Ah, and you need a tracker.  Very well.  I think I can help you."
msgstr ""
"Ah, et il vous faut un traqueur. Très bien. Je crois que je peux vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:5
msgid "We've been charged with finding the Green Man."
msgstr "On nous a chargés de trouver l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:6
msgid "How is that?"
msgstr "Comment cela ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:7
msgid ""
"He is the spirit of the forest.  Maybe if people around here paid more attention to him, we might not be starving."
msgstr ""
"C’est l’esprit de la forêt. Si les gens d’ici lui prêtaient un peu plus d’attention, nous ne mourrions peut-être pas de faim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC189.rude:9
msgid "I heard Skulkil the Dark knows how to become a Lich."
msgstr "J’ai entendu dire que Skulkil le Sombre sait comment devenir Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:12
msgid ""
"Isn't that the truth.  Those two clans had better put aside their differences."
msgstr ""
"N’est-ce pas la vérité ! Ces deux clans feraient bien de mettre leurs différends de côté."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:12
msgid "The world has worse things to worry about."
msgstr "Le monde a de plus grands soucis à se faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:2
msgid ""
"Johannes Bem right here in Thjorgard can help you.  You can find him in the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"Johannes Bem, ici même à Thjorgard, peut vous aider. Vous le trouverez à l’Université de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:20
msgid "The tavern is the first building south of the eastern entrance."
msgstr "La taverne est le premier bâtiment au sud de l’entrée est."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:21
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop just east of the training hall in the western part of town."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique d’armures juste à l’est de la salle d’entraînement, dans la partie ouest de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:22
msgid ""
"I've heard that Sturmford and Drangheim have not spoken to each other in at least ten years.  It's a wonder they don't go to war!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire que Sturmford et Drangheim ne se sont pas adressé la parole depuis au moins dix ans. C’est un miracle qu’ils ne soient pas en guerre !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:25
msgid "The magic shop is on the very next street to the west of us."
msgstr "La boutique de magie est dans la rue juste à l’ouest d’ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:27
msgid "Not anymore than usual."
msgstr "Pas plus que d’habitude."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:28
msgid "The temple is in the most southeasterly part of town."
msgstr "Le temple se trouve à l’extrémité sud-est de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:29
msgid ""
"Seek out Tymon the Nord right here in Thjorgard.  He can be found in the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"Allez voir Tymon le Nordique, ici même à Thjorgard. Vous le trouverez à l’Université de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:3
msgid ""
"Sven lives in the castle on the hill in the westernmost section of town."
msgstr "Sven vit dans le château sur la colline, tout à l’ouest de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:32 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC308.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:18
msgid "No thank you."
msgstr "Non merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:35
msgid ""
"The training hall is in the western section of town, to the north of the gates to Sven's Hall."
msgstr ""
"La salle d’entraînement est dans la partie ouest de la ville, au nord des portes de la Halle de Sven."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:36
msgid ""
"The apothecary is between the armor shop and the magic shop, west of here."
msgstr ""
"L’apothicaire est entre la boutique d’armures et la boutique de magie, à l’ouest d’ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:39
msgid "The general store is just east of the weapon shop, west of here."
msgstr "Le bazar est juste à l’est de la boutique d’armes, à l’ouest d’ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:39 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:50
msgid "The general store."
msgstr "Le bazar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:4
msgid "Do you have any other news?"
msgstr "Avez-vous d’autres nouvelles ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:4
msgid "I'm afraid not.  Was there anything I could help you with?"
msgstr "J’ai bien peur que non. Puis-je vous aider en quoi que ce soit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:43
msgid "The library is in the southwest section of town, next to the bank."
msgstr ""
"La bibliothèque est dans la partie sud-ouest de la ville, à côté de la banque."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:44
msgid ""
"The Arena is in the northwest section of town, just north of the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"L’Arène est dans la partie nord-ouest de la ville, juste au nord de l’Université de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:44
msgid "We're looking for The Arena."
msgstr "Nous cherchons l’Arène."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:5
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop just east of the training hall in the western part of town."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique d’armes juste à l’est de la salle d’entraînement, dans la partie ouest de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC19.rude:6
msgid ""
"You can find the bank in the southwest section of town, next to the library.  It is near the gates to Sven's Hall."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la banque dans la partie sud-ouest de la ville, à côté de la bibliothèque. Elle est près des portes de la Halle de Sven."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:1
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:11
msgid ""
"That's that awful place floating above Frosgard.  There's a big bad giant who lives in there.  If you're not careful, he'll eat your small children!  I've heard that he can't be killed!"
msgstr ""
"C’est cet horrible endroit qui flotte au-dessus de Frosgard. Un grand méchant géant vit là-dedans. Si vous ne faites pas attention, il mangera vos petits enfants ! J’ai entendu dire qu’on ne peut pas le tuer !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:11
msgid "What do you know about the Sky Fort?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du Fort céleste ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:13
msgid "That's okay.  Come back when you do."
msgstr "Ce n’est pas grave. Revenez quand vous l’aurez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:13
msgid "We don't have that much right now."
msgstr "Nous n’avons pas autant pour le moment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC223.rude:5
msgid "Frosgard needs your help."
msgstr "Frosgard a besoin de votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:14
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hein ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:15
msgid ""
"Skulkil the Dark got into another tavern fight.  If you ask me, he spends too much time in the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Skulkil le Sombre s’est encore battu à la taverne. Si vous voulez mon avis, il passe trop de temps à la taverne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:2
msgid "The Green Man requires a pledge from Frosgard."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert exige un serment de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:5
msgid "What sort of pledge?"
msgstr "Quel genre de serment ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:3
msgid ""
"Great!  I've got a few orders to take care of first, but as soon as those are done, I'll get right on the maypole."
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! J’ai d’abord quelques commandes à honorer, mais dès que ce sera fait, je m’occuperai du mât de mai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:3
msgid "Sure.  That's no problem."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Aucun problème."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:4
msgid "A pledge to not neglect him again."
msgstr "Le serment de ne plus jamais le négliger."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:4
msgid ""
"If it will help our harvests return to normal, I'll give you that pledge!"
msgstr ""
"Si cela peut ramener nos récoltes à la normale, je vous fais ce serment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:5
msgid "We'd like you to fix it."
msgstr "Nous aimerions que vous le répariez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:5
msgid ""
"You would?  I'd be happy to!  I'll have to charge you 500 gold for materials."
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? J’en serais ravi ! Je devrai vous demander 500 pièces d’or pour les matériaux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:6
msgid ""
"I am a poster.  I make posts.  You know the maypole in the center of town?  I made that a few years ago.  It's a little worse for the wear these days, but no one has asked me to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Je suis poteaulier. Je fabrique des poteaux. Vous connaissez le mât de mai au centre de la ville ? C’est moi qui l’ai fait il y a quelques années. Il est un peu usé de nos jours, mais personne ne m’a demandé de le réparer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:8
msgid "Tell the Green Man something for us.  Tell him we're sorry."
msgstr ""
"Dites quelque chose à l’Homme Vert de notre part. Dites-lui que nous sommes désolés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC190.rude:9
msgid ""
"Our harvests have been horrible lately.  If nothing is done soon, we'll all starve!"
msgstr ""
"Nos récoltes sont désastreuses depuis quelque temps. Si l’on ne fait rien bientôt, nous mourrons tous de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:2
msgid "News?  Yes!  My crops are failing!"
msgstr "Des nouvelles ? Oui ! Mes récoltes dépérissent !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:3
msgid ""
"If I remember him?  I suppose that's better than starving.  Alright.  I'll give you my pledge."
msgstr ""
"Si je me souviens de lui ? Je suppose que c’est mieux que de mourir de faim. D’accord. Je vous fais mon serment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man will fix your crops."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert sauvera vos récoltes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:4
msgid "My crops are already failing."
msgstr "Mes récoltes dépérissent déjà."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:4
msgid "Without him, your crops will fail."
msgstr "Sans lui, vos récoltes dépériront."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:5
msgid "That you will remember the Green Man."
msgstr "Que vous vous souviendrez de l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:5
msgid "The Green Man?  Why would we need to remember him?"
msgstr "L’Homme Vert ? Pourquoi aurions-nous besoin de nous souvenir de lui ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:4
msgid "A pledge?  What sort of pledge?"
msgstr "Un serment ? Quel genre de serment ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:6
msgid "We need a pledge from you."
msgstr "Nous avons besoin d’un serment de votre part."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:7
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr "De quoi avez-vous besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:8
msgid "What do I know about it?  Here's what:  it's making my crops fail!"
msgstr ""
"Ce que j’en sais ? Voilà ce que j’en sais : il fait dépérir mes récoltes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC191.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about weather?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du temps qu’il fait ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:1
msgid "If you succeed, we'll have you to thank.  Farewell."
msgstr "Si vous réussissez, ce sera grâce à vous. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:2
msgid ""
"I went out to pray to Fre last night to help my crops.  Do you know what happened?  That darned frost giant in the Sky Fort dumped his bucket out on my head!  I wish someone would do something about him!"
msgstr ""
"Hier soir, je suis allé prier Fre pour qu’elle aide mes récoltes. Savez-vous ce qui s’est passé ? Ce maudit géant du gel du Fort céleste m’a vidé son seau sur la tête ! Si seulement quelqu’un faisait quelque chose contre lui !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man does not wish to be forgotten again."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert ne veut plus être oublié."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:3
msgid ""
"The Green Man spoke to you?  He wants a pledge from me?  Of course!  I will give it right now!"
msgstr ""
"L’Homme Vert vous a parlé ? Il veut un serment de ma part ? Bien sûr ! Je vous le fais tout de suite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:4
msgid "We've come to get a pledge from you."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus obtenir un serment de votre part."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:4
msgid "What for?"
msgstr "Pour quoi faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:5
msgid "She's my favorite goddess!  I wish she would help us!"
msgstr "C’est ma déesse préférée ! Si seulement elle nous aidait !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about Fre?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Fre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC192.rude:7
msgid ""
"I'm afraid of going to the tavern.  That Skulkil the Dark is always in there.  He scares me."
msgstr ""
"J’ai peur d’aller à la taverne. Ce Skulkil le Sombre y est toujours. Il me fait peur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:2
msgid "I'm hungry.  Got a sandwich?"
msgstr "J’ai faim. Vous avez un sandwich ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:3
msgid ""
"Oh!  Well, I've never liked going hungry.  I will give you that pledge."
msgstr ""
"Oh ! Eh bien, je n’ai jamais aimé avoir faim. Je vais vous faire ce serment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:3
msgid "You won't starve anymore."
msgstr "Vous n’aurez plus faim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:4
msgid "To not forget to celebrate him again."
msgstr "De ne plus oublier de le célébrer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:4
msgid "What do we get in return?"
msgstr "Qu’obtenons-nous en retour ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC227.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC228.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC229.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC232.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC236.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man needs a pledge from you."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert a besoin d’un serment de votre part."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:6
msgid "What sort of help do you need?"
msgstr "De quel genre d’aide avez-vous besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:7
msgid ""
"It's been getting harder to find food around here.  I'm going to have to move soon just to find something to eat!"
msgstr ""
"C’est de plus en plus difficile de trouver à manger par ici. Je vais bientôt devoir déménager, rien que pour trouver de quoi manger !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC193.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about starving?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la famine ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:2
msgid ""
"Starve?  Hah!  I doubt that's going to happen.  And I think I don't like the attitude you've been giving me.  This conversation is over."
msgstr ""
"Mourir de faim ? Ha ! Ça m’étonnerait. Et je crois que je n’aime pas beaucoup votre attitude. Cette conversation est terminée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:2
msgid "You'd rather starve?"
msgstr "Vous préférez mourir de faim ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:3
msgid "The Green Man wants a promise from you!"
msgstr "L’Homme Vert veut une promesse de votre part !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:3
msgid ""
"What has he done for me?  Oh yeah!  Nothing!  He's not going to get a promise from me."
msgstr ""
"Qu’a-t-il fait pour moi ? Ah, oui ! Rien ! Il n’obtiendra aucune promesse de moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:4
msgid "We need your help!"
msgstr "Nous avons besoin de votre aide !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:4
msgid "Well you're not going to get it!"
msgstr "Eh bien, vous ne l’aurez pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:5
msgid "No!"
msgstr "Non !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC194.rude:6
msgid "Well then leave me alone!"
msgstr "Eh bien, alors laissez-moi tranquille !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:1
msgid "You are a brave and noble group.  You are most welcome.  Farewell."
msgstr "Vous êtes un groupe brave et noble. Je vous en prie. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:2
msgid "I will give that pledge!"
msgstr "Je vais faire ce serment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:2
msgid "That you will continue to have the festivals."
msgstr "Que vous continuerez à célébrer les fêtes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:3
msgid "A pledge?  For what?"
msgstr "Un serment ? Pour quoi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:3
msgid "It's time for another one.  He wants a pledge."
msgstr "Il est temps d’en refaire une. Il veut un serment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:5
msgid "The Green Man needs your help."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert a besoin de votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:4
msgid ""
"Why would the Green Man need our help?  Or want it?  We Haven't had a festival in years!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi l’Homme Vert aurait-il besoin de notre aide ? Ou même en voudrait-il ? Nous n’avons pas fait de fête depuis des années !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:5
msgid ""
"I am searching for a fair maiden to rescue.  Then I can marry her and settle down like a proper warrior!"
msgstr ""
"Je cherche une belle demoiselle à secourir. Ensuite, je pourrai l’épouser et me ranger comme un vrai guerrier !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:6
msgid ""
"Is there a fair maiden that needs to be rescued?  I shall fetch my sword and get right on it!"
msgstr ""
"Y a-t-il une belle demoiselle à secourir ? Je vais chercher mon épée et je m’y mets tout de suite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about rescuing fair maidens?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du sauvetage des belles demoiselles ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC195.rude:7
msgid ""
"When a young warrior is ready to hang up his sword and settle down, he must find a fair maiden to rescue."
msgstr ""
"Quand un jeune guerrier est prêt à raccrocher son épée et à se ranger, il doit trouver une belle demoiselle à secourir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:2
msgid ""
"My cabbage froze solid last night.  I don't think I'll be able to harvest it at all."
msgstr ""
"Mon chou a gelé pendant la nuit. Je ne crois pas que je pourrai le récolter du tout."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:3
msgid "He needs a pledge that we won't forget him again."
msgstr "Il a besoin du serment que nous ne l’oublierons plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:3
msgid ""
"Yes, of course!  I will give that pledge.  We have neglected him for far too long!"
msgstr ""
"Oui, bien sûr ! Je vais faire ce serment. Nous l’avons négligé bien trop longtemps !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man?  How can I help?"
msgstr "L’Homme Vert ? Comment puis-je aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC196.rude:5
msgid ""
"I know that if things don't get better soon, I'm going to have to move!"
msgstr ""
"Je sais que si les choses ne s’arrangent pas bientôt, je vais devoir partir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:2
msgid ""
"Yesterday my cat caught a rat in my pantry!  You know what he did then?  He left it on my pillow!"
msgstr ""
"Hier, mon chat a attrapé un rat dans mon garde-manger ! Et vous savez ce qu’il a fait ensuite ? Il l’a laissé sur mon oreiller !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:3
msgid "He wants a pledge that he won't be forgotten again."
msgstr "Il veut le serment qu’il ne sera plus oublié."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:3
msgid "You spoke to him?  He's come back?  Of course I'll give a pledge!"
msgstr ""
"Vous lui avez parlé ? Il est revenu ? Bien sûr que je vais faire un serment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:4
msgid "It's about the Green Man."
msgstr "C’est au sujet de l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:4
msgid ""
"The Green Man?  He abandon us long ago, and I don't blame him!  In fact, we abandon him, more like!"
msgstr ""
"L’Homme Vert ? Il nous a abandonnés il y a longtemps, et je ne lui en veux pas ! À vrai dire, c’est plutôt nous qui l’avons abandonné !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:6
msgid "I know the farmers are having some trouble with their crops!"
msgstr "Je sais que les fermiers ont des problèmes avec leurs récoltes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about harvesting?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des moissons ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC197.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:6
msgid "Thanks for you time."
msgstr "Merci de nous avoir accordé votre temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:1
msgid "Don't bother me again."
msgstr "Ne me dérangez plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:2
msgid ""
"Maybe if these farmers would get out of the taverns and back to work, there wouldn't be a food shortage!"
msgstr ""
"Si ces fermiers sortaient des tavernes pour retourner au travail, il n’y aurait peut-être pas de pénurie de nourriture !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:3
msgid ""
"Now you're just deluding yourself.  He's not real, and you're not going to make a fool of me.  Now be off with you!"
msgstr ""
"Là, vous vous faites des illusions. Il n’existe pas, et vous n’allez pas vous moquer de moi. Allez, ouste !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:3
msgid "We spoke to him.  He needs a pledge."
msgstr "Nous lui avons parlé. Il a besoin d’un serment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man needs it."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert en a besoin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:4
msgid "The Green Man?  Ha!  He doesn't even exist."
msgstr "L’Homme Vert ? Ha ! Il n’existe même pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:5
msgid "My help?  Why should I give you my help?"
msgstr "Mon aide ? Pourquoi devrais-je vous aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:6
msgid "I don't have time for those things."
msgstr "Je n’ai pas de temps pour ces choses-là."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC198.rude:7
msgid "See that it doesn't happen again."
msgstr "Veillez à ce que cela ne se reproduise pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:1
msgid ""
"When I was younger, a playmate of mine pulled a fish from a stream.  He said it looked like me.  Ever since then they've called me Erik the Fish-head."
msgstr ""
"Quand j’étais plus jeune, un de mes camarades de jeu a sorti un poisson d’un ruisseau. Il a dit qu’il me ressemblait. Depuis, on m’appelle Erik Tête-de-Poisson."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:3
msgid "A pledge to have a party?  Of course!  I will give that."
msgstr "Un serment de faire la fête ? Bien sûr ! Je vais le faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:3
msgid "That he won't be forgotten again.  To celebrate him again."
msgstr "Qu’il ne sera plus oublié. Qu’on le célébrera de nouveau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:4
msgid "He needs a pledge."
msgstr "Il a besoin d’un serment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:5
msgid ""
"The Green Man has returned?  Frankly I was beginning to think he didn't exist anymore.  What does he need of us?  A sword?  Is there a man I need to kill?"
msgstr ""
"L’Homme Vert est revenu ? Franchement, je commençais à croire qu’il n’existait plus. De quoi a-t-il besoin ? D’une épée ? Y a-t-il un homme que je doive tuer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:7
msgid "Nothing.  I'm a soldier, not a farmer."
msgstr "Rien. Je suis soldat, pas fermier."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC199.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about farming?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’agriculture ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:1
msgid ""
"Very well.  If you intend to stand in the way of the Beldonian conquest, then there is nothing more we have to say to each other."
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Si vous avez l’intention de vous dresser contre la conquête beldonienne, alors nous n’avons plus rien à nous dire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:1
msgid "We could never rule alongside a traitor!"
msgstr "Nous ne pourrions jamais régner aux côtés d’un traître !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:11
msgid ""
"There is only one lane in which boats can reach this dock.  Unfortunately, Bone Thrashers have been coming from one of those islands and are preventing the boat from leaving.  If we are to get off this island, we'll have to take care of them first."
msgstr ""
"Il n’y a qu’un seul chenal par lequel les bateaux peuvent atteindre ce quai. Malheureusement, des Broyeurs d’os viennent de l’une de ces îles et empêchent le bateau de partir. Si nous voulons quitter cette île, il faudra d’abord nous occuper d’eux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:12
msgid "Fair enough.  We'll take care of them then."
msgstr "Très bien. Nous allons nous occuper d’eux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:12
msgid ""
"Great.  I would be more than happy to come with you on this quest.  And you know what?  I bet there's something behind that locked door that will help us!"
msgstr ""
"Formidable. Je serais plus qu’heureux de vous accompagner dans cette quête. Et vous savez quoi ? Je parie qu’il y a derrière cette porte verrouillée quelque chose qui nous aidera !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:13
msgid "Welcome Aboard."
msgstr "Bienvenue à bord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:14
msgid ""
"It is not as bad a place as people make it out.  In the summer time, it's actually quite nice."
msgstr ""
"Ce n’est pas un endroit aussi terrible qu’on le dit. En été, c’est même plutôt agréable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:15
msgid "No.  Who is that?"
msgstr "Non. Qui est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:15
msgid ""
"She is the sage who lives on one of these islands.  She may want to speak to you."
msgstr ""
"C’est la sage qui vit sur l’une de ces îles. Elle voudra peut-être vous parler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:16
msgid "It is our destiny to unite the six clans against Tamur Leng."
msgstr "Notre destin est d’unir les six clans contre Tamur Leng."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:16
msgid ""
"Tamur Leng?  The leader of the Beldonian Hordes sweeping across Rysh?  If it is your job to kill him, then I am at your disposal.  I would like to leave as soon as you are ready, however, there is something that must be done first."
msgstr ""
"Tamur Leng ? Le chef des Hordes beldoniennes qui déferlent sur Rysh ? Si votre tâche est de le tuer, alors je suis à votre service. J’aimerais partir dès que vous serez prêts, mais il y a d’abord quelque chose à faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:17
msgid "See you soon."
msgstr "À bientôt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:17
msgid "We have a few things to do first."
msgstr "Nous avons d’abord quelques affaires à régler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:19
msgid "Not much, really.  He is the Prince of Beldonia."
msgstr "Pas grand-chose, en vérité. C’est le prince de Beldonie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:20
msgid ""
"As I recall, Bjarni is quite taken with Kira the Cold.  If she asked, I'm certain that he would put his sword into his own chest, and smile while doing it."
msgstr ""
"Si je me souviens bien, Bjarni est très épris de Kira la Froide. Si elle le lui demandait, je suis certain qu’il se planterait son épée dans la poitrine en souriant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:20
msgid "Where are we going to find someone to write a treaty?"
msgstr "Où allons-nous trouver quelqu’un pour rédiger un traité ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:21
msgid ""
"This is Thjorgard, the seat of power for Clan Thjorgard.  Without at doubt, they are the most powerful clan in Chedian.  Their Jarl, Sven Forkbeard makes most of his money off of taxing the production, refining, and smithing of Elemental Thjorad."
msgstr ""
"Voici Thjorgard, le siège du pouvoir du clan de Thjorgard. Sans aucun doute, c’est le clan le plus puissant de Chedian. Son Jarl, Sven Forkbeard, tire l’essentiel de sa fortune des taxes sur la production, le raffinage et la forge du Thjorad élémentaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:22 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:25
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:28 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:29
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:30 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:33 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC35.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:1
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:10
msgid "What do you know about this place?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de cet endroit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:22
msgid ""
"This is Sturmford, the seat for Clan Sturmford.  The Jarl of this region is named Bjarni Thorvaldssen, a straightforward, if a bit simple man.  Sturmford and their neighbor Drangheim have been fighting for centuries."
msgstr ""
"Voici Sturmford, le siège du clan de Sturmford. Le Jarl de cette région s’appelle Bjarni Thorvaldssen, un homme franc, quoiqu’un peu simple. Sturmford et sa voisine Drangheim se font la guerre depuis des siècles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:23
msgid ""
"I think you have misjudged me.  In the eyes of my master, Tamur Leng, I have just done a great service to my nation!  He has rewarded me by making me Lord of Chedian!"
msgstr ""
"Je crois que vous m’avez mal jugé. Aux yeux de mon maître, Tamur Leng, je viens de rendre un grand service à ma nation ! Il m’a récompensé en faisant de moi le Seigneur de Chedian !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:23
msgid "There you are, Traitor!!!"
msgstr "Vous voilà, traître !!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:24
msgid ""
"Those are the Verhoffin Ruins.  I wouldn't advise you to enter them.  All that's in there for you is your death."
msgstr ""
"Ce sont les Ruines de Verhoffin. Je ne vous conseille pas d’y entrer. Tout ce qui vous y attend, c’est la mort."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:25
msgid ""
"This is the seat for Clan Drangheim.  Their Jarl, Sigmund the Stressed while perhaps not the most elegant of men is a competent ruler.  They have been at odds with Sturmford ever since they broke off from them to start their own clan centuries ago."
msgstr ""
"Voici le siège du clan de Drangheim. Son Jarl, Sigmund le Stressé, n’est peut-être pas le plus raffiné des hommes, mais c’est un dirigeant compétent. Ils sont en conflit avec Sturmford depuis qu’ils s’en sont séparés pour fonder leur propre clan, il y a des siècles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:26
msgid ""
"I bet that there's a way to beat the skeletoids behind it.  Maybe we should ask Yrsa."
msgstr ""
"Je parie qu’il existe un moyen de vaincre les squelettoïdes qui se trouvent derrière. Nous devrions peut-être demander à Yrsa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:26
msgid "What was that you said about a locked door?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que vous disiez à propos d’une porte verrouillée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:27
msgid ""
"This is Guberland, probably the most unpopular Clan in Chedian.  Their Jarl, a man named Markel, chose for himself the nickname \"the Great\" however unproven that title may be.  He is a somewhat abrasive man with a flair for self-flattery."
msgstr ""
"Voici Guberland, sans doute le clan le plus impopulaire de Chedian. Son Jarl, un homme nommé Markel, s’est choisi lui-même le surnom de « le Grand », même si ce titre reste à prouver. C’est un homme assez désagréable, qui a un don pour l’autoflatterie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:28
msgid ""
"Frosgard is in bad shape.  Their ruler, Tryygva Ravenlocks, has been unable to cope with the region's problems no matter how hard he tries.  I'm fairly certain that it would take little effort to encourage the citizens to revolt."
msgstr ""
"Frosgard est en piteux état. Son dirigeant, Tryygva Ravenlocks, n’arrive pas à faire face aux problèmes de la région, malgré tous ses efforts. Je suis à peu près certain qu’il ne faudrait pas grand-chose pour pousser les habitants à se révolter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:29
msgid ""
"Thronheim is probably the second most powerful clan in Chedian, after Thjorgard.  Kira the Cold is a competent, no-nonsense ruler.  She has it in her the potential to make Thronheim more successful than it has been in a hundred years."
msgstr ""
"Thronheim est sans doute le deuxième clan le plus puissant de Chedian, après Thjorgard. Kira la Froide est une dirigeante compétente, qui ne s’embarrasse pas de fioritures. Elle a en elle de quoi rendre Thronheim plus prospère qu’il ne l’a été depuis cent ans."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:3
msgid "A quest?  What sort of quest?"
msgstr "Une quête ? Quel genre de quête ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:3
msgid "She has charged us with a quest, and we need your help."
msgstr "Elle nous a confié une quête, et nous avons besoin de votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:30
msgid ""
"Lindisfarne is a remote monastic village that is technically part of the Nation of Framon.  Its seclusion from the mainland and ready sea access has made it a popular target for the Chedian raiders."
msgstr ""
"Lindisfarne est un village monastique isolé qui fait techniquement partie de la Nation de Framon. Son éloignement du continent et son accès facile à la mer en ont fait une cible prisée des pillards chediens."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:31
msgid ""
"This is the region of Yorwick, the most easterly part of the Nation of Framon.  There has been increasing emigration from Thronheim to this region, and the mixing of cultures has created tension between the residents."
msgstr ""
"Voici la région de Yorwick, la partie la plus orientale de la Nation de Framon. L’émigration de Thronheim vers cette région ne cesse de croître, et le mélange des cultures a créé des tensions entre les habitants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:32
msgid ""
"This is the Isle of Ashes.  This is where Verhoffin's Tower stood.  Now it is all a mess of ruins, and a dangerous place to boot."
msgstr ""
"Voici l’Ile des Cendres. C’est ici que se dressait la Tour de Verhoffin. Ce n’est plus aujourd’hui qu’un amas de ruines, et un endroit dangereux de surcroît."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:33
msgid "I don't know anything.  I've never been here before."
msgstr "Je ne sais rien. Je ne suis jamais venu ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:36
msgid "Welcome aboard."
msgstr "Bienvenue à bord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:4
msgid "Climb Aboard!"
msgstr "Montez à bord !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:4
msgid "We are ready to go now."
msgstr "Nous sommes prêts à partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:5
msgid "Have you seen Yrsa the Troll?  You may want to speak to her."
msgstr "Avez-vous vu Yrsa la Trolle ? Vous devriez peut-être lui parler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:5
msgid "Our boat crashed on its way to Mendossus."
msgstr "Notre bateau a fait naufrage en route pour Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:6
msgid "I am a sailor who has traveled much.  I am new to Chedian."
msgstr "Je suis un marin qui a beaucoup voyagé. Je suis nouveau à Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:7
msgid "Yes, Kira!  Great thinking, Forad!"
msgstr "Oui, Kira ! Bien pensé, Forad !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:7
msgid "You're welcome.  I am here to help."
msgstr "Je vous en prie. Je suis là pour aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:8
msgid "She did?  What for?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Pour quoi faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:8
msgid "Yes.  Yrsa sent us to find you"
msgstr "Oui. Yrsa nous a envoyés vous trouver"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:9
msgid "Not without killing us, he hasn't!"
msgstr "Pas sans nous avoir tués d’abord !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC2.rude:9
msgid ""
"Why waste your time on such things?  Join us!  We can rule all of Chedian together!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi perdre votre temps avec de telles choses ? Joignez-vous à nous ! Nous pourrons régner ensemble sur tout Chedian !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:3
msgid "We would like to look at your books"
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir vos livres"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC20.rude:3
msgid "Sorry, We're closed"
msgstr "Désolé, c’est fermé"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:1
msgid ""
"I heard that Eva A'Washadi lost one of her children to the Frost Giant a couple nights ago.  Darn that Tryygva Ravenlocks!  He should be doing something about that!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire qu’Eva A’Washadi a perdu un de ses enfants, emporté par le Géant du Gel il y a quelques nuits. Maudit soit ce Tryygva Ravenlocks ! Il devrait faire quelque chose !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We'd like to see your weapons."
msgstr "Oui. Nous aimerions voir vos armes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:3
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr "Autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've heard that he can't be killed.  If you're thinking of trying to get rid of him, you'd better think of another way!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire qu’on ne peut pas le tuer. Si vous pensez vous débarrasser de lui, vous feriez mieux de trouver un autre moyen !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:5
msgid ""
"They call him Yanmir the Frost Giant.  From what I've heard, he's the last of the frost giants who lived in the city called the Sky Fort.  After the Great Cataclysm, the Sky Fort plunged from the sky and almost landed right on top of Frosgard!"
msgstr ""
"On l’appelle Yanmir le Géant du Gel. D’après ce que j’ai entendu, c’est le dernier des géants du gel qui vivaient dans la cité appelée le Fort céleste. Après le Grand Cataclysme, le Fort céleste est tombé du ciel et a failli s’écraser en plein sur Frosgard !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about the frost giant?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du géant du gel ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC200.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:8
msgid "Would you like to see a weapon?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous voir une arme ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:2
msgid ""
"Business has been bad since the docks froze over.  I don't understand why Tryygva hasn't done anything about it yet!"
msgstr ""
"Les affaires vont mal depuis que les quais ont gelé. Je ne comprends pas pourquoi Tryygva n’a encore rien fait !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "Oui. Nous aimerions voir vos marchandises."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:5
msgid ""
"I've been barely scraping by.  I've had to pay people to bring stuff through the mountains just to keep my stock up!"
msgstr ""
"J’arrive tout juste à m’en sortir. J’ai dû payer des gens pour faire passer des marchandises par les montagnes, rien que pour garder mon stock !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about trade?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du commerce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC201.rude:7
msgid "Next time, why don't you buy something."
msgstr "La prochaine fois, achetez donc quelque chose."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:2
msgid ""
"My sister's son in Frosgard hasn't been home in two days.  She's afraid that the Frost Giant got him!"
msgstr ""
"Le fils de ma sœur, à Frosgard, n’est pas rentré chez lui depuis deux jours. Elle a peur que le Géant du Gel l’ait emporté !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:5
msgid ""
"The frost giant in Frosgard?  He eats small children!  I heard Tryygva sent some soldiers to try and kill him.  One of them came back saying he can't be killed!"
msgstr ""
"Le géant du gel de Frosgard ? Il mange les petits enfants ! J’ai entendu dire que Tryygva avait envoyé des soldats pour essayer de le tuer. L’un d’eux est revenu en disant qu’on ne peut pas le tuer !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:5
msgid "What do you know about  Yanmir?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Yanmir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC249.rude:7
msgid "Come back soon."
msgstr "Revenez bientôt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC202.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC251.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC260.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC286.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC307.rude:5
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "Je vous en prie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard there are instructions on how to become a lich buried somewhere in Chasm of the Dead."
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire que des instructions pour devenir liche sont enfouies quelque part dans le Gouffre des Morts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC344.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see your stuff."
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:4
msgid "Sorry, but we're closed for the evening."
msgstr "Désolé, mais c’est fermé pour la soirée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC203.rude:5
msgid ""
"The best way to keep yourself alive is to get the best spells you can afford.  If your enemy is dead, how are they supposed to fight?"
msgstr ""
"Le meilleur moyen de rester en vie est d’obtenir les meilleurs sorts que vous puissiez vous offrir. Si votre ennemi est mort, comment pourrait-il se battre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:1
msgid ""
"No!  They went to raid a place called Farndale.  Apparently the Mendossian army was waiting for them there and..well you can guess the rest."
msgstr ""
"Non ! Ils sont partis piller un endroit appelé Farndale. Apparemment, l’armée mendossienne les y attendait et… eh bien, vous devinez la suite."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:1
msgid "They didn't?"
msgstr "Ils ne sont pas revenus ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:3
msgid ""
"Ravensford will be a lonely place without you here.  I'm going to miss you."
msgstr ""
"Ravensford sera un endroit bien solitaire sans vous. Vous allez me manquer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:4
msgid ""
"Watch your spell points carefully.  There is nothing more dangerous than being attacked when you are out of them!"
msgstr ""
"Surveillez bien vos points de sort. Il n’y a rien de plus dangereux que d’être attaqué quand on n’en a plus !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:5
msgid ""
"That's where the next raid is going.  I'd be careful, the last time a raiding party went there, they didn't come back!"
msgstr ""
"C’est là que va le prochain raid. Je serais prudent : la dernière fois qu’une bande de pillards y est allée, elle n’est pas revenue !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC204.rude:8
msgid "You're welcome"
msgstr "Je vous en prie"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:1
msgid ""
"Watch out for the undead.  They can do more to you than just hurt you."
msgstr ""
"Méfiez-vous des morts-vivants. Ils peuvent vous faire bien pire que simplement vous blesser."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC342.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see some spells."
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir des sorts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:2
msgid "Yes, of course."
msgstr "Oui, bien sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:3
msgid ""
"My friend claims to have been to there.  She says she swam up a backwards waterfall to get there.  I think she's lying.  How can a waterfall go backwards?"
msgstr ""
"Une amie prétend y être allée. Elle dit qu’elle a remonté à la nage une cascade à l’envers pour y arriver. Je crois qu’elle ment. Comment une cascade pourrait-elle couler à l’envers ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC205.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Yanmir's Fort?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du Fort de Yanmir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:10
msgid ""
"It's dangerous business, that's what!  If I were you, I'd stay away from it!"
msgstr ""
"C’est une affaire dangereuse, voilà ce que c’est ! Si j’étais vous, je m’en tiendrais loin !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:11
msgid "An Orb of Linking?  Great!  Go ahead and install it!"
msgstr "Un Orbe de liaison ? Formidable ! Allez-y, installez-le !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:11
msgid "We have an Orb of Linking."
msgstr "Nous avons un Orbe de liaison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:12
msgid ""
"I think it's high time we sent another raiding party to Farndale!  It's time for revenge!  That's what I say!"
msgstr ""
"Je crois qu’il est grand temps d’envoyer une nouvelle bande de pillards à Farndale ! L’heure de la vengeance a sonné ! Voilà ce que je dis !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:3
msgid ""
"Apparently Hanndl charges quite a penny to cross the bridge to the Great Gate."
msgstr ""
"Il paraît que Hanndl demande une coquette somme pour traverser le pont jusqu’à la Grande Porte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors of a place called the Inventa Storca where there are many wonderful things!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu des rumeurs sur un endroit appelé Inventa Storca, où se trouveraient beaucoup de choses merveilleuses !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:7
msgid ""
"Not much, I'm afraid.  I spend most of my time here.  I can tell you this, however.  Many of my customers have been pleased as tickles when they got kicked out of Arslegard, because I still had all their money."
msgstr ""
"Pas grand-chose, j’en ai peur. Je passe le plus clair de mon temps ici. Mais je peux vous dire ceci : beaucoup de mes clients étaient ravis comme tout quand ils se sont fait expulser d’Arslegard, parce que j’avais encore tout leur argent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC206.rude:9
msgid ""
"Well, I don't really think that you're ready to go off on some adventure, but if the old man thinks so, good luck!"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je ne crois pas vraiment que vous soyez prêts à partir à l’aventure, mais si le vieux le pense, bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:2
msgid ""
"I warned him not to, but my brother invoked the name of Njam last month.  He's been cursed ever since!"
msgstr ""
"Je l’avais prévenu de ne pas le faire, mais le mois dernier, mon frère a invoqué le nom de Njam. Il est maudit depuis !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC207.rude:5
msgid "Shhh!  Don't say that name!  You're liable to become cursed!"
msgstr "Chut ! Ne prononcez pas ce nom ! Vous risquez d’être maudits !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:1
msgid "Good luck, children."
msgstr "Bonne chance, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:2
msgid ""
"The Ritual of Consecration?  I've never heard of that.  It must be one of those strange Igdrasa rituals.  You'll need to find him.  He lives around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Le Rituel de Consécration ? Je n’en ai jamais entendu parler. Ce doit être l’un de ces étranges rituels d’Igdrasa. Il vous faudra trouver son prêtre. Il vit quelque part dans les environs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:3
msgid "Of course, children."
msgstr "Bien sûr, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC256.rude:2
msgid "We need some healing."
msgstr "Nous avons besoin de soins."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:4
msgid "Fre's blessing upon you, my children."
msgstr "Que la bénédiction de Fre soit sur vous, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:5
msgid ""
"I have others to attend to, children.  I don't have time for questions."
msgstr ""
"D’autres ont besoin de moi, mes enfants. Je n’ai pas le temps de répondre à des questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:6
msgid "I am sorry, my children.  We do not have any."
msgstr "Je suis désolé, mes enfants. Nous n’en avons pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:6
msgid "We are looking for a priest for a new church."
msgstr "Nous cherchons un prêtre pour une nouvelle église."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:7
msgid ""
"That old freak?  I'm sorry, children but he's retired.  Was there something I could help you with?"
msgstr ""
"Ce vieux toqué ? Je suis désolé, mes enfants, mais il s’est retiré. Puis-je vous aider en autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:7
msgid "We're looking for a priest named Nath'I A'Mor"
msgstr "Nous cherchons un prêtre nommé Nath’i A’Mor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC208.rude:8
msgid "Farewell, my children."
msgstr "Adieu, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:1
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:2
msgid ""
"A friend of mine sailed through Hanndl's Grasp.  He said he was attacked by a giant sea monster that sunk his boat.  I think he just doesn't know how to navigate the shallows!"
msgstr ""
"Un de mes amis a traversé l’Etreinte de Hanndl. Il dit qu’il a été attaqué par un monstre de mer géant qui a coulé son bateau. Je crois plutôt qu’il ne sait pas naviguer sur les hauts-fonds !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:3
msgid "Yes, I think we will."
msgstr "Oui, je pense que oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:5
msgid ""
"Well I'm afraid I can't help you.  You see, I'm frozen in.  If someone were to clear all the ice out from the docks, I would be glad to take you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je crains de ne pas pouvoir vous aider. Voyez-vous, je suis pris dans les glaces. Si quelqu’un dégageait toute la glace des quais, je vous emmènerais volontiers où vous voudriez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:6
msgid ""
"Hanndl's Grasp is the name our fathers gave to the collection of islands that surround the Verhoffin Sea.  The islands Guberland and Sturmford are on are part of it.  The islands from eastern Thjorgard all the way to Lachmon Cove in Mendossus."
msgstr ""
"L’Etreinte de Hanndl est le nom que nos pères ont donné à l’ensemble des îles qui entourent la mer de Verhoffin. Les îles où se trouvent Guberland et Sturmford en font partie. Elle comprend les îles qui s’étendent de l’est du Thjorgard jusqu’à la baie de Lachmon, au Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Hanndl's Grasp?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’Etreinte de Hanndl ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:8
msgid ""
"I see that!  I really appreciate all that you've done.  Here, take this dock schedule as my gift for helping me out like that!"
msgstr ""
"Je vois ça ! Je vous suis très reconnaissant de tout ce que vous avez fait. Tenez, prenez ces horaires des quais en cadeau, pour m’avoir aidé ainsi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:8
msgid "The ice is clear from the docks."
msgstr "La glace a été dégagée des quais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC209.rude:9
msgid "We're looking for some information."
msgstr "Nous cherchons des renseignements."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:2
msgid ""
"I think I could make it worth your while.  Did you need training or not?"
msgstr ""
"Je crois que je pourrais vous rendre la chose intéressante. Vous vouliez un entraînement, oui ou non ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:2
msgid "Well if we had it, we wouldn't give it to you!"
msgstr "Si nous l’avions, nous ne vous la donnerions pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:3
msgid "Do you know where it could be found?"
msgstr "Savez-vous où on peut la trouver ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:3
msgid ""
"HA!  If I knew where it could be found, I wouldn't be sitting here dreaming about it, that's for sure.  And trust me, if I knew where it was, I wouldn't tell you!"
msgstr ""
"HA ! Si je savais où la trouver, je ne serais pas assis là à en rêver, ça c’est sûr. Et croyez-moi, si je savais où elle était, je ne vous le dirais pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:4
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about a sword known as the Sing Sword.  It is supposed to make its wearer stronger in battle.  What I would give to have that sword in my hands!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu des rumeurs au sujet d’une épée qu’on appelle l’Epée Chantante. Elle rendrait celui qui la porte plus fort au combat. Que ne donnerais-je pas pour tenir cette épée entre mes mains !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC21.rude:5
msgid "Not today, thank you."
msgstr "Pas aujourd’hui, merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:10
msgid ""
"Tryygva is looking for brave men to take on the Frost Giant.  If you thing you have the courage, you can find him in the Palace."
msgstr ""
"Tryygva cherche des hommes courageux pour affronter le Géant du Gel. Si vous pensez en avoir le courage, vous le trouverez au palais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:11
msgid "We would like to ask you some questions."
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:19
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop on the western end of town, just north of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez l’armurerie à l’extrémité ouest de la ville, juste au nord du terrain d’entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:21
msgid "The tavern is just northeast of the maypole."
msgstr "La taverne se trouve juste au nord-est du mât de mai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:22
msgid ""
"That poor man!  He's having such a hard time being in charge right now!  It's no wonder he's so depressed."
msgstr ""
"Le pauvre homme ! Il a tant de mal à assumer le commandement en ce moment ! Pas étonnant qu’il soit si abattu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:22
msgid "What do you know about Tryygva"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Tryygva ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:26
msgid ""
"The magic shop is on the western end of town, just east of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"La boutique de magie se trouve à l’extrémité ouest de la ville, juste à l’est du terrain d’entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:27
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr "Non, pas vraiment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:28
msgid "The temple is just south of the maypole."
msgstr "Le temple se trouve juste au sud du mât de mai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:3
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop on the western end of town, just north of the training yard."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique d’armes à l’extrémité ouest de la ville, juste au nord du terrain d’entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:32
msgid ""
"The apothecary is on the southwestern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"L’apothicaire se trouve dans la partie sud-ouest de la ville. C’est l’une des masures creusées dans la colline."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:34
msgid ""
"The training hall is in the westerly section of town, south of the weapon shop."
msgstr ""
"La salle d’entraînement se trouve dans la partie ouest de la ville, au sud de la boutique d’armes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:38
msgid "The dock is the northernmost point from the maypole."
msgstr "Le quai est le point le plus au nord en partant du mât de mai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:43
msgid ""
"The library is in the southern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"La bibliothèque se trouve dans la partie sud de la ville. C’est l’une des masures creusées dans la colline."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:6
msgid "If you're looking for Tryygva, you can find him behind me."
msgstr "Si vous cherchez Tryygva, il est juste derrière moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC210.rude:8
msgid ""
"You can find the bank in the southern section of town.  It is one of the hovels built into the hill."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la banque dans la partie sud de la ville. C’est l’une des masures creusées dans la colline."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am a collector of old tomes, friends.  Nothing I am interested in has happened in the last three hundred years."
msgstr ""
"Je collectionne les vieux grimoires, mes amis. Rien de ce qui m’intéresse ne s’est produit depuis trois cents ans."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC350.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to see some books."
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir des livres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:5
msgid ""
"They say you have to swim up a waterfall to get to the Sky Fort.  They also say he's invincible.  But I'm convinced there is another way to kill him."
msgstr ""
"On dit qu’il faut remonter une cascade à la nage pour atteindre le Fort céleste. On dit aussi qu’il est invincible. Mais je suis convaincu qu’il existe un autre moyen de le tuer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:5
msgid "what do you know about the frost giant?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du Géant du Gel ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC211.rude:6
msgid "Very well, but be quiet about it."
msgstr "Très bien, mais restez discrets."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:1
msgid ""
"Tryygva asked me to step up the training of his solders.  I wonder why?"
msgstr ""
"Tryygva m’a demandé d’intensifier l’entraînement de ses soldats. Je me demande bien pourquoi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:3
msgid ""
"There's not many of them around any more.  I'd say they're nearly extinct.  If you somehow found one to fight, I wouldn't go against it directly.  They're too powerful.  I'd find some way to trick it into killing itself."
msgstr ""
"Il n’en reste plus beaucoup. Je dirais qu’ils ont presque disparu. Si par hasard vous en trouviez un à combattre, je ne l’affronterais pas de face. Ils sont trop puissants. Je trouverais plutôt un moyen de le piéger pour qu’il se tue lui-même."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC212.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about fighting frost giants?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du combat contre les géants du Gel ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:1
msgid ""
"My brother and I came up with a great new brew!  I don't know why Brewmaster Smith isn't selling it.  I'm sure he could make a fortune!"
msgstr ""
"Mon frère et moi avons inventé une formidable nouvelle bière ! Je ne comprends pas pourquoi le Maître brasseur Smith ne la vend pas. Je suis sûr qu’il pourrait faire fortune !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:3
msgid ""
"Look out for the fleshy headed mutants.  Radiation has made them enemies to civilization."
msgstr ""
"Méfiez-vous des mutants à tête charnue. Les radiations en ont fait des ennemis de la civilisation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:16
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "A plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC213.rude:5
msgid "See ya!"
msgstr "A plus !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:1
msgid ""
"Yeah, don't listen to my brother.  I was the one who came up with the recipe!  He just watched.  He drank most of the first batch, too."
msgstr ""
"Ouais, n’écoutez pas mon frère. C’est moi qui ai trouvé la recette ! Lui, il n’a fait que regarder. Et il a bu presque toute la première fournée, en plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:3
msgid "Yeah, oh.  See you"
msgstr "Ouais, bon. A plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:4
msgid "Don't listen to my brother.  He doesn't know what he's talking about."
msgstr "N’écoutez pas mon frère. Il ne sait pas de quoi il parle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC214.rude:5
msgid "Yeah, ok.  See you"
msgstr "Ouais, d’accord. A plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:2
msgid "I'll have the barrel sent right over!"
msgstr "Je vous fais envoyer le tonneau tout de suite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:3
msgid "On the ice just outside the dock."
msgstr "Sur la glace, juste devant le quai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:3
msgid ""
"On the ice?  Okay, but here's some advice:  If you're planning a special show, the sunflowers shine the brightest at night."
msgstr ""
"Sur la glace ? D’accord, mais voici un conseil : si vous préparez un spectacle spécial, les tournesols brillent davantage la nuit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:4
msgid ""
"I make sunflowers!  They're barrels of magic powder that explode when you shoot them!  I have a demonstration rigged up if you would like to see one!  Just go ahead and shoot that barrel."
msgstr ""
"Je fabrique des tournesols ! Ce sont des tonneaux de poudre magique qui explosent quand on tire dessus ! J’ai préparé une démonstration, si vous voulez en voir un ! Allez-y, tirez sur ce tonneau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:4
msgid "What do you do all the way out here?"
msgstr "Que faites-vous si loin de tout ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:5
msgid ""
"Watch out for your children!  The Frost Giant that lives in the sky will come down at night and eat them!  It happened to me!"
msgstr ""
"Surveillez vos enfants ! Le Géant du Gel qui vit dans le ciel descend la nuit pour les manger ! Ça m’est arrivé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:6
msgid "Certainly!  Where would you like it delivered?"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Où voulez-vous qu’on le livre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:6
msgid "Say, you wouldn't mind making a delivery would you?"
msgstr "Dites, ça ne vous dérangerait pas de faire une livraison ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:7
msgid "Watch out for him.  He can't be killed."
msgstr "Méfiez-vous de lui. On ne peut pas le tuer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC215.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the Frost Giant?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du Géant du Gel ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:1
msgid ""
"My children told me that the Frost Giant came for them, and threw them back!  Can you believe that?  They said the giant thought they taste bad!"
msgstr ""
"Mes enfants m’ont dit que le Géant du Gel était venu les chercher, puis qu’il les avait recrachés ! Vous vous rendez compte ? Ils disent que le géant les a trouvés mauvais au goût !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:3
msgid ""
"They're frozen over.  I wish there was someone who was strong enough to break up all the ice."
msgstr ""
"Ils sont pris dans les glaces. J’aimerais qu’il y ait quelqu’un d’assez fort pour briser toute cette glace."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC216.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about the docks?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des quais ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:2
msgid ""
"A pledge?   That's it?  If that's all that is required, then you have it!"
msgstr ""
"Une promesse ? C’est tout ? Si c’est tout ce qu’il faut, alors vous l’avez !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:2
msgid "Give us your pledge."
msgstr "Faites-nous votre promesse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:3
msgid "How?  If there is a way, I shall do it!"
msgstr "Comment ? S’il existe un moyen, je le ferai !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:3
msgid "You could bring back the Green Man."
msgstr "Vous pourriez faire revenir l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:4
msgid ""
"The docks are all frozen!  I don't know what we're going to do!  Without the docks, the boats can't dock!  We're all going to starve!"
msgstr ""
"Les quais sont complètement gelés ! Je ne sais pas ce que nous allons faire ! Sans les quais, les bateaux ne peuvent pas accoster ! Nous allons tous mourir de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:6
msgid "What sort of help could I give?"
msgstr "Quelle aide pourrais-je apporter ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC217.rude:7
msgid ""
"They are all frozen over.  Maybe we could get a big battering ram and break up all the ice!  Oh!  What are we going to do?"
msgstr ""
"Ils sont complètement gelés. Peut-être qu’avec un gros bélier, on pourrait briser toute la glace ! Oh ! Qu’allons-nous faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:2
msgid "Give him a pledge that you won't forget to celebrate him."
msgstr "Promettez-lui que vous n’oublierez plus de le fêter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:2
msgid "I will not ever forget to celebrate him again!  You have my word!"
msgstr "Je n’oublierai plus jamais de le fêter ! Vous avez ma parole !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:3
msgid ""
"Without the boats coming in, we'll all starve!  Our crops are failing, and our farmers can't seem to produce enough food for us all to eat!  What are we going to eat?"
msgstr ""
"Si les bateaux n’arrivent plus, nous allons tous mourir de faim ! Nos récoltes sont mauvaises et nos fermiers n’arrivent pas à produire assez de nourriture pour nous nourrir tous ! Qu’allons-nous manger ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:5
msgid "My help?  How can I help the Green Man?"
msgstr "Mon aide ? Comment puis-je aider l’Homme Vert ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:6
msgid "I don't know how we're going to break up all that ice!"
msgstr "Je ne sais pas comment nous allons briser toute cette glace !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC218.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about breaking up the ice?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous sur la façon de briser la glace ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:1
msgid "The army is coming, I tell you!  It will mean destruction for us all!"
msgstr "L’armée arrive, je vous le dis ! Ce sera notre perte à tous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:3
msgid ""
"I know that I heard someone talking about the invading army to the west.  Once they conquer Thronheim, it will be destruction for us all!"
msgstr ""
"Je sais que j’ai entendu quelqu’un parler de l’armée d’invasion à l’ouest. Une fois qu’ils auront conquis Thronheim, ce sera notre perte à tous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC219.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about invasions?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des invasions ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:1
msgid ""
"From what I have heard an army  is supposedly marching in the west.   That's trouble for certain.  I'm not sure I would call it a war, though.  More like a slaughter."
msgstr ""
"D’après ce que j’ai entendu, une armée serait en marche à l’ouest. Ça ne présage rien de bon, c’est certain. Mais je ne suis pas sûr que j’appellerais ça une guerre. Plutôt un massacre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:2
msgid "Good day to you sir."
msgstr "Bonne journée à vous, sire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:3
msgid "All one could ask is that you fight."
msgstr "Tout ce qu’on peut vous demander, c’est de vous battre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:3
msgid "I have but only my life to give."
msgstr "Je n’ai que ma vie à offrir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:4
msgid ""
"I would fight, for sure.  But I am a farmer, not a soldier.  The word is, this is the largest army since before the Great Cataclysm.  In the face of that,  I'm sure that I wouldn't be the only one to end up dead."
msgstr ""
"Je me battrais, c’est sûr. Mais je suis fermier, pas soldat. On dit que c’est la plus grande armée depuis avant le Grand Cataclysme. Face à ça, je suis sûr que je ne serais pas le seul à y laisser la vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:4
msgid "Would you not take up arms in defense of your homeland?"
msgstr "Ne prendriez-vous pas les armes pour défendre votre patrie ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:6
msgid ""
"Well, I know that Framon is the nearest nation to us, not counting Thronheim, that is.  I've heard that they are not in the best shape.  I guess they don't have much left after all the raids we've done there."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je sais que Framon est la nation la plus proche de chez nous, sans compter Thronheim, bien sûr. J’ai entendu dire qu’ils ne sont pas au mieux de leur forme. Je suppose qu’il ne leur reste plus grand-chose après tous les raids que nous avons menés là-bas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about the west?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l’ouest ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC22.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC334.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC67.rude:2
msgid "Nothing, sorry."
msgstr "Rien, désolé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:1
msgid ""
"I don't put much faith in rumors.  Like the one about the army coming to conquer us all.  I haven't seen any evidence of this!  How do we know that the army even exists?"
msgstr ""
"Je n’accorde pas beaucoup de crédit aux rumeurs. Comme celle de l’armée qui viendrait tous nous conquérir. Je n’en ai vu aucune preuve ! Comment savoir si cette armée existe seulement ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:4
msgid ""
"Tjorvi seems to think that they're going to hit Thronheim first.  But I think Thronheim is too well defended.  My first target would be Thjorgard.  Once I secured a foothold in the least defended city in Chedian, I'd..wait!  That's Frosgard!  Oh no!"
msgstr ""
"Tjorvi semble penser qu’ils vont frapper Thronheim en premier. Mais je pense que Thronheim est trop bien défendue. Ma première cible serait Thjorgard. Une fois que j’aurais pris pied dans la ville la moins défendue de Chedian, je... attendez ! C’est Frosgard ! Oh non !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC220.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about invaders?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des envahisseurs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:1
msgid ""
"This place is my home.  When I am not restoring nature, I take pleasure in taking walks here."
msgstr ""
"Ce lieu est ma demeure. Quand je ne suis pas occupé à restaurer la nature, j’aime m’y promener."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:10
msgid ""
"I mourn for Frosgard, for they have forgotten me.  Perhaps one day, someone will remind them of that."
msgstr ""
"Je pleure Frosgard, car ses habitants m’ont oublié. Peut-être qu’un jour, quelqu’un le leur rappellera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:11
msgid ""
"That is indeed good news!  I thank you for your help.  You have saved more lives than you know.  I have a gift for you, so that all who come upon you know you have received the blessings of the green man."
msgstr ""
"Voilà vraiment une bonne nouvelle ! Je vous remercie de votre aide. Vous avez sauvé plus de vies que vous ne le pensez. J’ai un cadeau pour vous, afin que tous ceux qui vous croiseront sachent que vous avez reçu la bénédiction de l’Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:11
msgid "We have completed your tasks."
msgstr "Nous avons accompli vos tâches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:13
msgid "Of course, friends."
msgstr "Bien sûr, mes amis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:14
msgid "Farewell.  Come back soon!"
msgstr "Adieu. Revenez bientôt !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:2
msgid "You are welcome, visitors.  Farewell."
msgstr "Soyez les bienvenus, visiteurs. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:4
msgid ""
"Once those things are all done, I will return.  I thank you for your visit, friends."
msgstr ""
"Une fois que tout cela sera fait, je reviendrai. Je vous remercie de votre visite, mes amis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:4
msgid "We will do that."
msgstr "Nous allons le faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:5
msgid ""
"And finally, as a symbol of their pledge to me, the Frosgard leader has to carve and place a runestone near the maypole.  The stone should declare the promise made, and the Frosgardian's intent to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Et enfin, en symbole de leur promesse envers moi, le chef de Frosgard doit tailler une pierre runique et la placer près du mât de mai. La pierre devra proclamer la promesse faite et l’intention des habitants de Frosgard de la tenir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:5
msgid "That can be done."
msgstr "Cela peut se faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:6
msgid ""
"I also need a promise from the Frosgardians that they will not neglect the festivals.  I think promises from six townsfolk would be enough."
msgstr ""
"Il me faut aussi la promesse des habitants de Frosgard qu’ils ne négligeront plus les fêtes. Je pense que les promesses de six habitants suffiraient."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:6
msgid "We can do that."
msgstr "Nous pouvons le faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:7
msgid "How can we help?"
msgstr "Comment pouvons-nous aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:7
msgid ""
"There are three things that must be done.  Firstly, the maypole in the center of town is in a sad state of repair.  If I am to return, the maypole needs to be repaired."
msgstr ""
"Trois choses doivent être faites. Premièrement, le mât de mai au centre de la ville est en piteux état. Pour que je revienne, le mât de mai doit être réparé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:8
msgid ""
"I'm afraid that they will have one celebration in my honor, and then forget about me again."
msgstr ""
"Je crains qu’ils ne célèbrent une fête en mon honneur, puis qu’ils ne m’oublient de nouveau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:8
msgid "We think the Frosgardians are eager for your return."
msgstr ""
"Nous pensons que les habitants de Frosgard attendent votre retour avec impatience."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:9
msgid ""
"It has been a long time since someone from Frosgard remembered who I was.  It pleases me to know that they have not totally forgotten me.  I long to return to Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"Il y a bien longtemps que personne à Frosgard ne s’est souvenu de moi. Je suis heureux de savoir qu’ils ne m’ont pas complètement oublié. Je rêve de retourner à Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC221.rude:9
msgid "We've come on behalf of Frosgard."
msgstr "Nous venons de la part de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC222.rude:2
msgid ""
