# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC406.rude:1
msgid ""
"That promotion is for only the most skilled in Dark Magic.  Do you possess the skills?"
msgstr ""
"Cette promotion est réservée aux plus habiles en Magie de l'Ombre. Avez-vous les compétences requises ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC406.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmaster in Dark Magic."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Magie de l'Ombre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC407.rude:1
msgid ""
"But what is news?  Would you consider flowers opening up this morning news?"
msgstr ""
"Mais qu'est-ce qu'une nouvelle ? Diriez-vous que les fleurs qui se sont ouvertes ce matin sont une nouvelle ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC407.rude:2
msgid "I can help with that.  Are you certain you are skilled enough?"
msgstr ""
"Je peux vous aider pour cela. Etes-vous certains d'être assez compétents ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC407.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Spirit Magic"
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Magie du Spiritisme"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC407.rude:3
msgid ""
"Adventuring is not about the destination.  It is about the growth of the journey."
msgstr ""
"L'aventure, ce n'est pas la destination. C'est ce que l'on gagne en chemin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC408.rude:1
msgid ""
"In a meditation recently, I came across the City of Golden Purity.  It was the most beautiful thing I ever saw!"
msgstr ""
"Lors d'une méditation récente, j'ai découvert la Cité de la Pureté dorée. C'était la plus belle chose que j'aie jamais vue !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC408.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Meditation."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Méditation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC408.rude:2
msgid "You have come to the right place.  I may help you."
msgstr "Vous êtes au bon endroit. Je peux vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC408.rude:3
msgid "Save your money, and buy the most powerful spells you can cast."
msgstr ""
"Economisez votre argent et achetez les sorts les plus puissants que vous puissiez lancer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC409.rude:1
msgid ""
"I really like old books.  I've heard there's a place in Mendossus where they've found a huge collection of them!  I want to go!"
msgstr ""
"J'adore les vieux livres. J'ai entendu dire qu'à Mendossus, on a trouvé un endroit qui en contient une immense collection ! Je veux y aller !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC409.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Identify Item."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Identifier objet."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC409.rude:3
msgid ""
"I haven't spent much time on the road, but I can tell you it'll save you a lot of money if you can identify the things you find."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas beaucoup voyagé, mais je peux vous dire que vous économiserez beaucoup d'argent si vous savez identifier ce que vous trouvez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:1
msgid "Perhaps we could ask you something else?"
msgstr "Pourrions-nous peut-être vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:11
msgid "If you think you are qualified."
msgstr "Si vous pensez en être digne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:1
msgid "We'd like to become Experts in Spear."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Experts en Lance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:5
msgid "We'd like to become Masters in Spear."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Maîtres en Lance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:12
msgid "Beldonia is a nation far to the west."
msgstr "Beldonia est un pays loin à l'ouest."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:15
msgid ""
"The elves have a long and cultured history.  Most which is lost.  My ancestors didn't keep their records in the safest place, and most of those documents are now at the bottom of the Verhoffin Sea."
msgstr ""
"Les elfes ont une histoire longue et raffinée, dont la plus grande partie est perdue. Mes ancêtres n'ont pas conservé leurs archives dans l'endroit le plus sûr, et la plupart de ces documents reposent aujourd'hui au fond de la Mer de Verhoffin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:16
msgid "If I am not mistaken, Tamur Leng is the Prince of Beldonia."
msgstr "Si je ne me trompe pas, Tamur Leng est le prince de Beldonia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:5
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "Peu importe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:2
msgid "The prince?"
msgstr "Le prince ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:2
msgid ""
"Yes.  From what I can discover, all Beldonian princes can trace their lines back to Jevar the Bastard, the man who tore the Ursanian Empire apart."
msgstr ""
"Oui. D'après ce que j'ai pu découvrir, tous les princes beldoniens descendent de Jevar le Bâtard, l'homme qui a déchiré l'Empire ursanien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:3
msgid ""
"He certainly contributed to it, yes.  But the Great Cataclysm was not the only cause of the fall of the Empire.  In fact, the Ursanian Empire lasted another thirteen years after the Great Cataclysm.  Did you know that?"
msgstr ""
"Il y a certainement contribué, oui. Mais le Grand Cataclysme n'est pas la seule cause de la chute de l'Empire. En fait, l'Empire ursanien a survécu encore treize ans après le Grand Cataclysme. Le saviez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:3
msgid "We thought Verhoffin tore the Ursanian Empire apart."
msgstr ""
"Nous pensions que c'était Verhoffin qui avait déchiré l'Empire ursanien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:4
msgid ""
"Oh yes.  It was not until Jevar the Bastard finally slew his father, Emperor Trandis in 13 AC that the empire finally fell apart."
msgstr ""
"Oh oui. Ce n'est qu'en 13 AC, lorsque Jevar le Bâtard a enfin tué son père, l'empereur Trandis, que l'empire s'est finalement effondré."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:5
msgid ""
"To become Grandmasters, you must seek out Hrrapp Spearhands in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"Pour devenir Grands maîtres, vous devez trouver Hrrapp Spearhands à Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:4
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Spear?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands maîtres en Lance ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:6
msgid ""
"It is said that Beldonia is the only province on the continent of Rysh that was not touched by the Great Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"On dit que Beldonia est la seule province du continent de Rysh à avoir été épargnée par le Grand Cataclysme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:6
msgid "What else can you tell us about it?"
msgstr "Que pouvez-vous nous en dire d'autre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:7
msgid ""
"Certainly their architecture is the same, and many of the cultural traditions are unchanged.  However, I think the collapse of the Ursanian Empire would have had a serious effect on Beldonia's economy."
msgstr ""
"Leur architecture est certes la même, et beaucoup de leurs traditions sont restées inchangées. Mais je pense que l'effondrement de l'Empire ursanien a dû gravement nuire à l'économie de Beldonia."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:7
msgid "You mean they are the same as they were back then?"
msgstr "Vous voulez dire qu'ils sont restés tels qu'à l'époque ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC41.rude:8
msgid ""
"Despite that there were no physical changes to Beldonia, I am certain they were plunged into the same dark age in which we now live."
msgstr ""
"Même si Beldonia n'a subi aucun changement physique, je suis certain qu'elle a été plongée dans le même âge sombre que celui que nous vivons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:1
msgid ""
"I found a nagate in my cellar yesterday.  What on earth was it doing there?"
msgstr "J'ai trouvé un nagate dans ma cave hier. Que diable faisait-il là ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:2
msgid "Do you have the skill?"
msgstr "Avez-vous la compétence requise ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Identify Monster."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Identifier monstre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC410.rude:3
msgid ""
"Listen, the only way to really save your hide out there is to be able to identify the monster that you are fighting."
msgstr ""
"Ecoutez, le seul moyen de sauver votre peau là-dehors, c'est de savoir identifier le monstre que vous combattez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC411.rude:1
msgid ""
"My father always used to tell me that the only way to do something is the right way.  Otherwise you're just wasting your time."
msgstr ""
"Mon père me disait toujours qu'il n'y a qu'une façon de faire les choses : la bonne. Sinon, on perd son temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC411.rude:2
msgid "If you think you're ready."
msgstr "Si vous pensez être prêts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC411.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Learning."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Apprentissage."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC411.rude:3
msgid "Study, and study hard.  That's the only way to succeed."
msgstr "Etudiez, et étudiez dur. C'est la seule façon de réussir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:1
msgid ""
"Stand back!  I've got news alright.  I've been working out for weeks on end.  Pretty soon I'll be strong enough to try out for the city guard."
msgstr ""
"Reculez ! Des nouvelles, j'en ai, c'est sûr. Je m'entraîne depuis des semaines sans relâche. Bientôt, je serai assez fort pour tenter d'entrer dans la garde de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:2
msgid "We'd like to become Grandmasters in Body Building."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Grands maîtres en Musculation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:2
msgid "You think you're ready?"
msgstr "Vous pensez être prêts ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC412.rude:3
msgid ""
"The stronger your body is, the tougher you get.  Work on making your body tough, and you'll stay alive."
msgstr ""
"Plus votre corps est fort, plus vous êtes résistant. Endurcissez votre corps et vous resterez en vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC413.rude:1
msgid "I don't share my news."
msgstr "Je ne partage pas mes nouvelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC413.rude:2
msgid ""
"The successful adventurers are the ones who can sneak up on their opponents.  If they can't see the blow coming, they can't defend against it."
msgstr ""
"Les aventuriers qui réussissent sont ceux qui savent surprendre leurs adversaires. S'ils ne voient pas venir le coup, ils ne peuvent pas s'en défendre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:1
msgid ""
"I am King of Enroth!  And the devils will be descending upon us at any minute!  As king, it's my duty to stop them!!"
msgstr ""
"Je suis le roi d'Enroth ! Et les démons vont s'abattre sur nous d'une minute à l'autre ! En tant que roi, c'est mon devoir de les arrêter !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:1
msgid "You're not our king.  This isn't..where'd you say you're from?"
msgstr ""
"Vous n'êtes pas notre roi. Ici, ce n'est pas... d'où avez-vous dit que vous veniez ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:10
msgid "How did you get here?"
msgstr "Comment êtes-vous arrivé ici ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:10
msgid ""
"Well, I was in the courtyard of Castle Ironfist, talking with my general about how best to handle the devil problem, when the ground started shaking.  This wasn't a normal earthquake, either.  Something felt..wrong."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, j'étais dans la cour du Château des Ironfist, en train de discuter avec mon général de la meilleure façon de régler le problème des démons, quand le sol s'est mis à trembler. Et ce n'était pas un tremblement de terre normal. Quelque chose clochait..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:11
msgid ""
"The shaking got more violent, and the walls to the castle started falling down.  I was buried under a mountain of rubble.  I got hit in the head with something, and when I woke up, I was here.  I can only assume that the devils took the capital city."
msgstr ""
"Les secousses sont devenues plus violentes, et les murs du château ont commencé à s'écrouler. J'ai été enseveli sous une montagne de décombres. J'ai reçu quelque chose sur la tête et, à mon réveil, j'étais ici. Je ne peux que supposer que les démons ont pris la capitale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:12
msgid ""
"Yes.  My father Roland always told me it's my duty to put my wishes aside, and lookout for the welfare of the people!"
msgstr ""
"Oui. Mon père Roland m'a toujours dit que mon devoir était de mettre mes désirs de côté et de veiller au bien-être du peuple !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:12
msgid "Your duty?"
msgstr "Votre devoir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:13
msgid ""
"When I was little, a group of adventurers just like you helped me sneak out of Castle Ironfist.  While they weren't looking, I got away from them and joined the circus!"
msgstr ""
"Quand j'étais petit, un groupe d'aventuriers comme vous m'a aidé à m'échapper du Château des Ironfist. Pendant qu'ils avaient le dos tourné, je leur ai faussé compagnie et je suis entré au cirque !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:4
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:16
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:23 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:20
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:7 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:25
msgid "We'd like to ask you a few questions."
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:15
msgid "Sorry, Nicolai.  We don't have time for that."
msgstr "Désolés, Nicolai. Nous n'avons pas le temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:15
msgid "Well, alright.  Keep an eye out for the devils!"
msgstr "Bon, d'accord. Gardez l'œil ouvert, les démons rôdent !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:16
msgid ""
"My father always said it was my job to do my duty and put the well being of the people ahead of my own."
msgstr ""
"Mon père disait toujours que mon rôle était de faire mon devoir et de placer le bien-être du peuple avant le mien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:16
msgid "What do you know about duty?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du devoir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:17
msgid "Okay!  I appreciate you helping out your king!"
msgstr "D'accord ! Merci d'aider votre roi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:15
msgid "We're still trying to find you a job."
msgstr "Nous vous cherchons toujours un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:18
msgid ""
"It's boring being king.  I really want to join the circus!  I could be a trapeze artist!  Or the strong man!  Or I could run a game booth!  Hey!  I bet you could find me a job at a circus!  What do you say?"
msgstr ""
"C'est ennuyeux d'être roi. Je veux vraiment entrer au cirque ! Je pourrais être trapéziste ! Ou l'homme fort ! Ou tenir un stand de jeu ! Hé ! Je parie que vous pourriez me trouver un travail dans un cirque ! Qu'en dites-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:18
msgid "You don't sound especially fond of your duty."
msgstr "Votre devoir ne semble pas vous enchanter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:19
msgid ""
"I have to stop the devils before they take over the world!  As King, it's my duty!"
msgstr ""
"Je dois arrêter les démons avant qu'ils ne s'emparent du monde ! En tant que roi, c'est mon devoir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:2
msgid ""
"It's hard being king when you have no money.  If I worked at the circus, I could raise money for an army!  Then we could send the devils back to where they came from!"
msgstr ""
"C'est dur d'être roi quand on n'a pas d'argent. Si je travaillais au cirque, je pourrais réunir de l'argent pour une armée ! Ensuite, nous pourrions renvoyer les démons d'où ils viennent !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:2
msgid "What happened to duty?"
msgstr "Qu'est devenu votre devoir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:18
msgid "We've found you a job."
msgstr "Nous vous avons trouvé un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:18
msgid "You have?  Where?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Où ça ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:21
msgid "Great!  I love it!  Thanks for all your help."
msgstr "Génial ! J'adore ! Merci pour toute votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:21 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:19
msgid "How's the job?"
msgstr "Comment se passe le travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:22
msgid "Bye!  Come back soon!  Thanks for visiting your king!"
msgstr "Au revoir ! Revenez vite ! Merci d'avoir rendu visite à votre roi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:23
msgid "See you later!  Thanks for visiting your king!"
msgstr "A plus tard ! Merci d'avoir rendu visite à votre roi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:3
msgid "Alright.  We'll find you a job."
msgstr "D'accord. Nous allons vous trouver un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:3
msgid "Great!  No, really!  Thanks!"
msgstr "Génial ! Non, vraiment ! Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:4
msgid "At the Gathering in Guberland."
msgstr "Au Rassemblement de Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:4
msgid ""
"Super!  Thank you very much!  We've just taken our first step in ridding the world of the devils!"
msgstr ""
"Super ! Merci beaucoup ! Nous venons de faire le premier pas pour débarrasser le monde des démons !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:5
msgid ""
"I am King Nicolai I, Defender of the Land, Bringer of Hope, King of Enroth!"
msgstr ""
"Je suis le roi Nicolai Ier, Défenseur du Royaume, Porteur d'Espoir, Roi d'Enroth !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:6
msgid "If you're a king, what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Si vous êtes roi, que faites-vous ici ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:6
msgid ""
"What do you mean?  I am your king!  Now if you'd let me be, I'm busy trying to stop the devils from taking over our world!"
msgstr ""
"Comment ça ? Je suis votre roi ! Et maintenant, si vous voulez bien me laisser, je suis occupé à empêcher les démons de s'emparer de notre monde !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:8
msgid "The Kr..  Never mind.  You don't seem to understand anyway."
msgstr ""
"Les Kr... Peu importe. De toute façon, vous n'avez pas l'air de comprendre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:8
msgid "What devils?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Quels démons ? De quoi parlez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC414.rude:9
msgid "Maybe we can ask you some questions?"
msgstr "Pourrions-nous vous poser quelques questions ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:11
msgid ""
"Not yet!  I'm hurrying as fast as I can.  I assure you I will be out of here soon."
msgstr ""
"Pas encore ! Je me dépêche autant que je peux. Je vous assure que je serai bientôt parti."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:11
msgid "You finished yet?"
msgstr "Vous avez fini ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:2
msgid "We'll pass that on to Markel."
msgstr "Nous transmettrons cela à Markel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:2
msgid "You do that!  Tell him I'm the one who's in charge!"
msgstr "C'est ça ! Dites-lui que c'est moi qui commande ici !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:3
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "Faites vite."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:3
msgid "Okay, I will!  I promise!"
msgstr "D'accord, je pars ! Promis !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:4
msgid ""
"Okay!  I will!  I promise.  Just give me some time to get my things!  Boy, I'm never going to find Everstrike now!"
msgstr ""
"D'accord ! Je pars ! Promis. Laissez-moi juste le temps de prendre mes affaires ! Bon sang, je ne trouverai jamais Everstrike maintenant !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:4
msgid "Then leave."
msgstr "Alors partez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:5
msgid ""
"Yieeee!  Please don't hurt me!  Okay?  Okay okay?  I'll do whatever you want me to!  I just don't want to get hurt!"
msgstr ""
"Iiiiih ! Ne me faites pas de mal, s'il vous plaît ! D'accord ? D'accord, d'accord ? Je ferai tout ce que vous voudrez ! Je ne veux simplement pas être blessé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:6
msgid "Well there's always the sword."
msgstr "Eh bien, il reste toujours l'épée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:6
msgid "You would use force against me?"
msgstr "Vous useriez de la force contre moi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:7
msgid "He wants you to leave."
msgstr "Il veut que vous partiez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:7
msgid ""
"Well I ain't gonna!  You tell him that I'm in charge here and there's nothing he can do to make me leave!"
msgstr ""
"Eh ben je partirai pas ! Dites-lui que c'est moi qui commande ici et qu'il ne peut rien faire pour me faire partir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:8
msgid "Him?  What does he want?"
msgstr "Lui ? Qu'est-ce qu'il veut ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:8
msgid "We've been sent by Markel the Great."
msgstr "Nous sommes envoyés par Markel le Grand."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:9
msgid "Of course not!"
msgstr "Bien sûr que non !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC415.rude:9
msgid "There's no way you'd leave?"
msgstr "Il n'y a aucun moyen de vous faire partir ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:2
msgid "No I'm not!  You'll never cage me!"
msgstr "Non, je n'y vais pas ! Vous ne me mettrez jamais en cage !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:2
msgid "Not you.  You're going to jail."
msgstr "Pas vous. Vous, vous allez en prison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:3
msgid "Unfortunately, Sven survived."
msgstr "Malheureusement, Sven a survécu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:3
msgid "You stopped it?  You pigs!  He's going to tax us all into oblivion!"
msgstr ""
"Vous l'avez arrêté ? Bande de porcs ! Il va nous écraser d'impôts jusqu'à la ruine !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:4
msgid "Seen this letter before?"
msgstr "Vous avez déjà vu cette lettre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC416.rude:4
msgid "Who are you?  Where did you get that?"
msgstr "Qui êtes-vous ? Où avez-vous trouvé ça ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:1
msgid "Wonderful.  Good luck"
msgstr "Formidable. Bonne chance"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:10
msgid "Very well.  Come back when you are ready."
msgstr "Très bien. Revenez quand vous serez prêts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:11
msgid ""
"The course is normally reserved as a testing grounds for those who would be Rangers.  I can allow you to practice, but you will not get a reward for completing it.  Is that alright?"
msgstr ""
"Ce parcours sert normalement d'épreuve à ceux qui veulent devenir Rôdeurs. Je peux vous laisser vous entraîner, mais vous ne recevrez aucune récompense en le terminant. Cela vous convient-il ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:11
msgid "We'd like to run the course."
msgstr "Nous aimerions faire le parcours."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:12
msgid "Very well.  Come back when you are ready to practice."
msgstr "Très bien. Revenez quand vous serez prêts à vous entraîner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:13
msgid "Very well.  Return when you are."
msgstr "Très bien. Revenez quand vous le serez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:14
msgid "Congratulations.  You have successfully completed the course."
msgstr "Félicitations. Vous avez terminé le parcours avec succès."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:15
msgid "No.  Sorry."
msgstr "Non. Désolé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:2
msgid ""
"You must throw the lever, and make it to the door without setting off the traps, and before the time expires.  If you fail, you must return and start over.  Good luck."
msgstr ""
"Vous devez actionner le levier et atteindre la porte sans déclencher les pièges et avant la fin du temps imparti. Si vous échouez, vous devrez revenir et recommencer. Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:3
msgid ""
"Ah yes.  Wonderful.  Let me explain the procedure.  The Dungeon of Secrets is divided into nine sections, each starts with a lever, and ends with a door."
msgstr ""
"Ah oui. Formidable. Laissez-moi vous expliquer la procédure. Le Donjon des Secrets est divisé en neuf sections, chacune commence par un levier et se termine par une porte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:3
msgid "We are here for the trial."
msgstr "Nous sommes ici pour l'épreuve."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:4
msgid ""
"Very well, let me explain the procedure.  The Dungeon of Secrets is divided into nine sections, each starts with a lever, and ends with a door."
msgstr ""
"Très bien, laissez-moi vous expliquer la procédure. Le Donjon des Secrets est divisé en neuf sections, chacune commence par un levier et se termine par une porte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:5
msgid ""
"You must throw the lever, and make it to the door without setting off the traps, and before the time expires.  If you fail, you must return and start over.  When you are finished, return to me.  Are you ready to begin?"
msgstr ""
"Vous devez actionner le levier et atteindre la porte sans déclencher les pièges et avant la fin du temps imparti. Si vous échouez, vous devrez revenir et recommencer. Quand vous aurez terminé, revenez me voir. Etes-vous prêts à commencer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:7
msgid "Welcome to the Dungeon of Secrets.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "Bienvenue au Donjon des Secrets. Puis-je vous aider ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:9
msgid "I'm afraid you set off a trap.  Would you like to try again?"
msgstr ""
"J'ai bien peur que vous ayez déclenché un piège. Voulez-vous réessayer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC417.rude:9
msgid "We'd like our reward."
msgstr "Nous aimerions notre récompense."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've always been fond of tinkering with magic items.  My old master didn't like it, and tried to make me stop.  One time my experiments went horribly wrong, and his shop exploded.  To save myself from his wrath, I fled to Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""
"J'ai toujours aimé bricoler les objets magiques. Mon ancien maître n'aimait pas ça et a essayé de m'en empêcher. Un jour, mes expériences ont horriblement mal tourné et sa boutique a explosé. Pour échapper à sa colère, je me suis enfui à Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:1
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr "Bien sûr !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:3
msgid "We'd like you to make something for us."
msgstr "Nous aimerions que vous fabriquiez quelque chose pour nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:4
msgid ""
"I know a great deal.  I've been experimenting with combining things for years.  I have nearly perfected the ability to make better magic items from two other ones."
msgstr ""
"J'en sais beaucoup. Cela fait des années que j'expérimente en combinant des objets. J'ai presque perfectionné l'art de créer un meilleur objet magique à partir de deux autres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about magic items?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des objets magiques ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:5
msgid "Okay, was there something else I could help you with?"
msgstr "Bien, puis-je vous aider pour autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC418.rude:6
msgid ""
"I'm a tinker!  If you give me any two magic items of the same type, for 500 gold, I will try to combine them into a new, better item.  Would you like me to try to make something for you?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis ferrailleur ! Si vous me donnez deux objets magiques du même type, pour 500 pièces d'or, j'essaierai de les combiner en un nouvel objet, meilleur. Voulez-vous que j'essaie de fabriquer quelque chose pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:11
msgid "busted!"
msgstr "Démasqués !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:11
msgid "None of your business.  Farewell."
msgstr "Cela ne vous regarde pas. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:12
msgid ""
"Thank you!  Don't worry about me, I'll be alright, and I won't blow your cover."
msgstr ""
"Merci ! Ne vous inquiétez pas pour moi, ça ira, et je ne vous trahirai pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:12
msgid "We've freed your brother."
msgstr "Nous avons libéré votre frère."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:2
msgid ""
"Alright.  Inside the cow's cage is a secret door that I made, and haven't the nerve to use.  That will take you all the way to the top.  Here, let me unlock it for you."
msgstr ""
"D'accord. Dans la cage de la vache se trouve une porte secrète que j'ai faite, mais que je n'ai jamais eu le courage d'utiliser. Elle vous mènera tout en haut. Tenez, je vais vous l'ouvrir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:5
msgid "Sounds like a deal!"
msgstr "Marché conclu !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:3
msgid "And what will you do for us?"
msgstr "Et que ferez-vous pour nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:3
msgid ""
"I will show you a way to get to the top level where the most prominent criminals, including your general are being held."
msgstr ""
"Je vous montrerai un moyen d'atteindre le dernier étage, où sont détenus les criminels les plus importants, dont votre général."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:4
msgid ""
"My brother Aontoni is being held in the same block as your famous general.  All I want you to do is to find him and open his cell.  I'm certain he would find his way down here."
msgstr ""
"Mon frère Aontoni est détenu dans le même quartier que votre célèbre général. Tout ce que je vous demande, c'est de le trouver et d'ouvrir sa cellule. Je suis certain qu'il trouvera le chemin jusqu'ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:4
msgid "Of course!  What sort of help did you need?"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! De quelle aide aviez-vous besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:5
msgid ""
"This place is crawling with guards, that's why not!  They'll be on you faster than your head can spin!  Of course, I guess I could help you, but you would have to help me."
msgstr ""
"Cet endroit grouille de gardes, voilà pourquoi ! Ils vous tomberont dessus avant que vous ayez eu le temps de dire ouf ! Bien sûr, je suppose que je pourrais vous aider, mais il faudrait que vous m'aidiez aussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:6
msgid "We've come to rescue Ivsar Forktooth."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus libérer Ivsar Forktooth."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:6
msgid ""
"You've broken into Drangheim's most notorious prison, and you think you're going to walk out with its most prominent prisoner?"
msgstr ""
"Vous vous êtes introduits dans la prison la plus célèbre de Drangheim, et vous croyez repartir avec son prisonnier le plus important ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:7
msgid ""
"Like eggplant you are!  You'd better explain to me why I am not calling the guards on you right now!"
msgstr ""
"C'est ça, et moi je suis une aubergine ! Vous feriez mieux de m'expliquer pourquoi je n'appelle pas les gardes tout de suite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:7
msgid "We're just passing through."
msgstr "Nous ne faisons que passer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:8
msgid ""
"I don't care what you have!  Now tell me, exactly what it is that you are doing here!  The guards are just on the other side of this door, and will be more than happy to cave your skull in!"
msgstr ""
"Je me moque de ce que vous avez ! Maintenant, dites-moi exactement ce que vous faites ici ! Les gardes sont juste de l'autre côté de cette porte et ne demandent qu'à vous défoncer le crâne !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:8
msgid "We've got a Visitor's Pass"
msgstr "Nous avons un laissez-passer de visiteur"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:9
msgid "Alright then.  I'm afraid I'll have to call the guards on you."
msgstr "Bien. Alors j'ai bien peur de devoir appeler les gardes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC419.rude:9
msgid "Sounds too dangerous."
msgstr "Ça m'a l'air trop dangereux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:1
msgid "Alright.  You're hired."
msgstr "D'accord. Vous êtes engagé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:1
msgid "I won't disappoint you."
msgstr "Je ne vous décevrai pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:10
msgid "Sorry.  We can't afford that much."
msgstr "Désolés. Nous ne pouvons pas payer autant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:11
msgid "If I find anyone looking for a spear, I'll send them your way."
msgstr "Si je trouve quelqu'un qui cherche un lancier, je vous l'enverrai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:11
msgid "Much obliged."
msgstr "Bien obligé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:13
msgid "Nice place to visit.  Wouldn't want to live there."
msgstr "Un bel endroit à visiter. Mais je n'aimerais pas y vivre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:14
msgid "Looking for work."
msgstr "Je cherche du travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:2
msgid "My fee is 300 gold per month, plus 2% of any gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Mon tarif est de 300 pièces d'or par mois, plus 2 % de tout l'or que vous trouverez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:3
msgid "I think we could use your services."
msgstr "Je crois que vos services pourraient nous être utiles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:3
msgid "I'd be happy to join you."
msgstr "Je serais heureux de me joindre à vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:4
msgid "Anything that will let me put my spear in someone's chest."
msgstr ""
"N'importe quoi, du moment que je peux planter ma lance dans la poitrine de quelqu'un."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:4
msgid "What sort of work?"
msgstr "Quel genre de travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:5
msgid ""
"Too dangerous.  With all the Chedians that raid that place, you'd hardly last a few days before you found a sword in your belly."
msgstr ""
"Trop dangereux. Avec tous les Chedians qui pillent l'endroit, vous ne tiendriez pas plus de quelques jours avant de trouver une épée dans votre ventre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:7
msgid "Heard the name before.  Don't know anything besides that."
msgstr "J'ai déjà entendu ce nom. Je ne sais rien de plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:8
msgid "Ask away."
msgstr "Je vous écoute."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:9
msgid ""
"I understand.  Well it was great!  I'll be around if you need me again!"
msgstr ""
"Je comprends. Eh bien, c'était super ! Je serai dans le coin si vous avez encore besoin de moi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC42.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:18
msgid "We will no longer be needing your services."
msgstr "Nous n'aurons plus besoin de vos services."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:2
msgid "Sure!  We'd love to!"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Avec plaisir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:3
msgid ""
"I'm a little worried about the harmony I've created in my theme.  It has a regression in it.  I know that you're not supposed to do that, but it sounds so good!"
msgstr ""
"Je m'inquiète un peu de l'harmonie que j'ai créée dans mon thème. Elle comporte une régression. Je sais qu'on n'est pas censé faire ça, mais ça sonne si bien !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:4
msgid ""
"I'm writing music!  I've been working on a theme based upon our call to prayer.  I've heard those darned bells so many times, I can't get their melody out of my head!  So I figured I'd go with it.  Would you like to hear it?"
msgstr ""
"J'écris de la musique ! Je travaille sur un thème inspiré de notre appel à la prière. J'ai entendu ces satanées cloches tant de fois que je n'arrive plus à me sortir leur mélodie de la tête ! Alors je me suis dit que j'allais m'en servir. Voulez-vous l'entendre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:4
msgid "What are you doing all the way up here?"
msgstr "Que faites-vous tout là-haut ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:6
msgid ""
"I like it here!  Not many people come up here to the rafters, so I can write in peace."
msgstr ""
"Je me plais ici ! Peu de gens montent jusqu'aux combles, alors je peux composer en paix."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:8
msgid "We'd like to hear your song again."
msgstr "Nous aimerions entendre votre chanson encore une fois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC420.rude:8
msgid "Wonderful!  I'd be happy to play it for you."
msgstr "Formidable ! Je serais heureux de la jouer pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:2
msgid ""
"I am the one who allowed our saint's relic to be stolen.  For penance, I have to stand here and guard Thjorad all day and night."
msgstr ""
"C'est moi qui ai laissé voler la relique de notre saint. Pour ma pénitence, je dois rester ici et garder Thjorad jour et nuit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:3
msgid "Interesting.  Can we ask you something else?"
msgstr "Intéressant. Pouvons-nous vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:4
msgid "So you guys are here all the time?"
msgstr "Alors vous êtes ici en permanence ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:4
msgid ""
"Unless we're at prayer.  Otherwise we are here.  It's Abbot Leffery's way of making us do our penance."
msgstr ""
"Sauf quand nous sommes à la prière. Le reste du temps, nous sommes ici. C'est la façon qu'a l'abbé Leffery de nous faire faire pénitence."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:5
msgid ""
"Brother Kennet is working on the case for Thjorad.  Since it's exposed, Abbot Leffery assigned us to guard it."
msgstr ""
"Frère Kennet travaille à la vitrine de Thjorad. Comme l'objet est exposé, l'abbé Leffery nous a chargés de le garder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:6
msgid ""
"It's a marvelous artifact.  I don't know where it came from, but I've heard it's belonged to us for a very long time."
msgstr ""
"C'est un objet magique merveilleux. Je ne sais pas d'où il vient, mais j'ai entendu dire qu'il nous appartient depuis très longtemps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC421.rude:7
msgid "Of course, friend."
msgstr "Bien sûr, mon ami."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:1
msgid "Interesting.  Thanks for your time."
msgstr "Intéressant. Merci de nous avoir accordé votre temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:2
msgid ""
"Day and night.  Well, except when the bells call us to prayer.  We can't let something like this stop us from conducting our worship."
msgstr ""
"Jour et nuit. Enfin, sauf quand les cloches nous appellent à la prière. Nous ne pouvons pas laisser une chose pareille nous empêcher de célébrer notre culte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:2
msgid "So you're here all the time?"
msgstr "Alors vous êtes ici en permanence ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:3
msgid ""
"I volunteered to Abbot Leffery to guard Thjorad for him.  He said that after our relic was stolen, we needed to guard everything we had."
msgstr ""
"Je me suis porté volontaire auprès de l'abbé Leffery pour garder Thjorad à sa place. Il a dit qu'après le vol de notre relique, nous devions garder tout ce que nous possédons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC422.rude:5
msgid ""
"I've been here for as long as I can remember.  Abbot Leffery says my parents dropped me off here because they couldn't afford to care for me.  I don't know about that.  As far as I'm concerned, the monks here are my family."
msgstr ""
"Je suis ici depuis aussi loin que je me souvienne. L'abbé Leffery dit que mes parents m'ont laissé ici parce qu'ils n'avaient pas les moyens de s'occuper de moi. Je n'en sais rien. Pour moi, les moines d'ici sont ma famille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC423.rude:1
msgid ""
"I've always wanted to see Thjorad in person, so when Abbot Leffery asked for volunteers to guard it, I was the first to offer my assistance."
msgstr ""
"J'ai toujours voulu voir Thjorad de mes propres yeux, alors quand l'abbé Leffery a demandé des volontaires pour le garder, j'ai été le premier à proposer mon aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:2
msgid "Alright.  Anything else?"
msgstr "D'accord. Autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:2
msgid ""
"Stay away from the lower level.  We abandoned that to those infernal insects years ago.  We are not responsible for your safety if you find your way down there."
msgstr ""
"Ne vous approchez pas du niveau inférieur. Nous l'avons abandonné à ces maudits insectes il y a des années. Nous ne sommes pas responsables de votre sécurité si vous y descendez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:3
msgid "See the man at the counter.  He'll give you a Visitor's Pass."
msgstr ""
"Voyez l'homme au comptoir. Il vous donnera un laissez-passer de visiteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:6
msgid "We want to get into the prison."
msgstr "Nous voulons entrer dans la prison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:4
msgid "We want to get in."
msgstr "Nous voulons entrer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:4
msgid ""
"You have a Visitor's Pass?  Very well.  Here are the rules:  No consorting with the prisoners.  Stay out of the way of the guards, and do not go into any of the security booths.  Should you do any of those, you will find yourself in deep trouble."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un laissez-passer de visiteur ? Très bien. Voici le règlement : aucun contact avec les prisonniers. Ne gênez pas les gardes et n'entrez dans aucune des guérites de sécurité. Si vous enfreignez une de ces règles, vous aurez de gros ennuis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:5
msgid "Been caught stealing, eh?  Very well.  I'll let him in."
msgstr "Pris en flagrant délit de vol, hein ? Très bien. Je le fais entrer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:5
msgid "We have a criminal here."
msgstr "Nous vous amenons un criminel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:6
msgid "We want you to open the door."
msgstr "Nous voulons que vous ouvriez la porte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:7
msgid "Thanks.  You can close the door now."
msgstr "Merci. Vous pouvez refermer la porte."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:8
msgid "Nothing.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Rien. Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC425.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC999.rude:16
msgid "blank."
msgstr "vide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:1
msgid "Okay!  That's all.  Here's your visitor's pass."
msgstr "Bien ! C'est tout. Voici votre laissez-passer de visiteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:1
msgid "Uhhh, no."
msgstr "Euh, non."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:2
msgid ""
"Great.  And one final question.  Are you or any member of your party carrying any contraband material such as knives, forks, saws, lockpicks, or birthday cakes?"
msgstr ""
"Parfait. Et une dernière question. Vous-même ou un membre de votre groupe transportez-vous du matériel de contrebande, tel que couteaux, fourchettes, scies, crochets de serrurier ou gâteaux d'anniversaire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:4
msgid ""
"Are you or any member of your party here to plan a prison break for any of the inmates?"
msgstr ""
"Vous-même ou un membre de votre groupe êtes-vous ici pour préparer l'évasion d'un détenu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:5
msgid "Are you or any member of your party a fugitive from justice?"
msgstr ""
"Vous-même ou un membre de votre groupe êtes-vous en fuite devant la justice ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:6
msgid ""
"I can issue you a Visitor's Pass.  I just need you to answer some questions."
msgstr ""
"Je peux vous délivrer un laissez-passer de visiteur. Il faut juste que vous répondiez à quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:7
msgid "Hello!  We're armed to the teeth here!"
msgstr "Bonjour ! Nous sommes armés jusqu'aux dents !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:7
msgid "Huh?  Oh!  Well now you're going to stay here permanently!"
msgstr "Hein ? Oh ! Eh bien, maintenant, vous allez rester ici pour de bon !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:8
msgid "The only prison break you'll be planning is your own!"
msgstr "La seule évasion que vous préparerez, c'est la vôtre !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC426.rude:9
msgid "Well you came to the right place!"
msgstr "Eh bien, vous êtes au bon endroit !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:1
msgid "Free?  I'm Free?  Ha ha!  I'm free!  Thank you!"
msgstr "Libre ? Je suis libre ? Ha ha ! Je suis libre ! Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:1
msgid "No torture.  You're free to go."
msgstr "Pas de torture. Vous êtes libre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:2
msgid "Are you the cooks brother?"
msgstr "Etes-vous le frère du cuisinier ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:2
msgid ""
"Yes.  If you plan to beat me, get on with it.  Otherwise leave me alone."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Si vous comptez me battre, allez-y. Sinon, laissez-moi tranquille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:3
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me!"
msgstr "Merci de m'avoir sauvé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:4
msgid "We're not guards.  We're here to rescue you."
msgstr "Nous ne sommes pas des gardes. Nous sommes venus vous libérer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:4
msgid "What sort of torture is this?  Do not tease me so!"
msgstr "Quelle est cette torture ? Ne vous moquez pas de moi ainsi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:5
msgid "b;anmk"
msgstr "b;anmk"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC427.rude:6
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Rien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC428.rude:1
msgid "I'm the best stones player in all of Thjorgard!"
msgstr "Je suis le meilleur joueur de pierres de tout Thjorgard !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC428.rude:1
msgid "You're not so tough."
msgstr "Vous n'êtes pas si coriace."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC428.rude:3
msgid "Yeah!  Thanks for helping out like this!"
msgstr "Ouais ! Merci de m'aider comme ça !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC428.rude:3
msgid "You're Sven's double?"
msgstr "Vous êtes le sosie de Sven ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:3
msgid ""
"Great!  Here's your ticket.  That will be 5 gold.  If you win, you'll get a prize!  If this is your first time, I'll give you some instructions with your ticket."
msgstr ""
"Super ! Voici votre billet. Ça fera 5 pièces d'or. Si vous gagnez, vous aurez un prix ! Si c'est votre première fois, je vous donnerai des instructions avec votre billet."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:3
msgid "Sure!  We'd love to play."
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Nous aimerions beaucoup jouer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:4
msgid "Spectacular!  You will get 10 tickets for 40 gold."
msgstr "Spectaculaire ! Vous aurez 10 billets pour 40 pièces d'or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:4
msgid "We want a batch of tickets."
msgstr "Nous voulons un lot de billets."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:5
msgid ""
"This, my friends is a boat race.  Whoever can get their boat to the end the fastest wins.  Care to play?"
msgstr ""
"Ceci, mes amis, est une course de bateaux. Celui dont le bateau atteint l'arrivée le plus vite gagne. Vous voulez jouer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:5
msgid "What sort of game is this?"
msgstr "Quel genre de jeu est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:6
msgid "Sorry kids, I don't have time for chit chat."
msgstr "Désolé, les jeunes, je n'ai pas le temps de bavarder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you're interested."
msgstr "Revenez quand ça vous intéressera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC429.rude:7
msgid "Not right now, sorry."
msgstr "Pas maintenant, désolés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:10
msgid "Waiting.  Me bash for shinies."
msgstr "Attendre. Moi cogner pour brillants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:11
msgid "Magic Shiny.  Good stuff."
msgstr "Brillant magique. Bon truc."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:12
msgid "Thanks for your time Tesar."
msgstr "Merci de nous avoir accordé votre temps, Tesar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:13
msgid "Sorry Tesar.  Perhaps another time."
msgstr "Désolés, Tesar. Une autre fois peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:14
msgid "No bright.  Good bash."
msgstr "Pas malin. Bon cogner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:14
msgid "Not too bright though, are you?"
msgstr "Mais vous n'êtes pas très malin, hein ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/TOPBLURB.rude:43
msgid "Me bash good."
msgstr "Moi bien cogner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:16
msgid "Question.  Ask."
msgstr "Question. Demander."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:18
msgid "Er?"
msgstr "Euh ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:19
msgid "Me good at it.  Me bash for shinies.  You give shinies, me bash."
msgstr ""
"Moi bon pour ça. Moi cogner pour brillants. Vous donner brillants, moi cogner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:19
msgid "What do you know about bashing?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l'art de cogner ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:2
msgid "Grandpappy is there.  With Pappy."
msgstr "Grand-papa est là-bas. Avec Papa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:20
msgid "We're sure you do."
msgstr "Nous n'en doutons pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:21
msgid "Thanks for your time, Tesar."
msgstr "Merci de nous avoir accordé votre temps, Tesar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:3
msgid "We're sure it is."
msgstr "Nous n'en doutons pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:3
msgid "You give shinies.  Me bash heads for you."
msgstr "Vous donner brillants. Moi cogner têtes pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:4
msgid "500 shinies every moon.  3 part of found shinies."
msgstr "500 brillants chaque lune. 3 part des brillants trouvés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:4
msgid "Ah, you're for hire.  How much?"
msgstr "Ah, vous êtes à louer. Combien ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:5
msgid "Alright Tesar.  You're hired."
msgstr "D'accord, Tesar. Vous êtes engagé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:5
msgid "Me bash good for you."
msgstr "Moi bien cogner pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:6
msgid "Me sword.  Good for bashing heads."
msgstr "Moi épée. Bon pour cogner têtes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:7
msgid "You give shinies.  Me bash for you."
msgstr "Vous donner brillants. Moi cogner pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:8
msgid "Er,.. Uh, oh.  You want good bash, you come back!"
msgstr "Euh... Oh oh. Vous vouloir bon cogner, vous revenir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:8
msgid "You're fired."
msgstr "Vous êtes renvoyé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:9
msgid "Isn't that nice.  Can we ask something else?"
msgstr "Comme c'est charmant. Pouvons-nous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC43.rude:9
msgid "Questions.  Ask."
msgstr "Questions. Demander."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:10
msgid ""
"Brave souls.  Go through the doors at the end of the hall.  Your opponents will enter from the two side doors.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"Ames courageuses. Passez les portes au bout du couloir. Vos adversaires entreront par les deux portes latérales. Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:10
msgid "We'd like to fight at the Knight level."
msgstr "Nous aimerions combattre au niveau Chevalier."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:11
msgid ""
"Alright.  These two creatures are the matchup for this bout.  The visitor's fee is 5 gold."
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Ces deux créatures s'affrontent dans ce combat. Le droit d'entrée des spectateurs est de 5 pièces d'or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:11
msgid "Neither, but we would like to watch a fight."
msgstr "Ni l'un ni l'autre, mais nous aimerions regarder un combat."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:12
msgid "We'd like to wager 250 gold"
msgstr "Nous aimerions parier 250 pièces d'or"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:13
msgid ""
"I hope you are as good as you are arrogant.  Go through the doors at the end of the hall.  Your opponents will enter from the two side doors.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"J'espère que vous êtes aussi forts qu'arrogants. Passez les portes au bout du couloir. Vos adversaires entreront par les deux portes latérales. Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:13
msgid "We're the best there is!  Send us in at Lord!"
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes les meilleurs qui soient ! Envoyez-nous au niveau Seigneur !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:14
msgid "Are there no more fights for today?"
msgstr "N'y a-t-il plus de combats aujourd'hui ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:14
msgid ""
"No, I'm sorry.  All the fights for the day are finished.  Come back another time."
msgstr ""
"Non, je suis désolé. Tous les combats de la journée sont terminés. Revenez une autre fois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:15
msgid "We'd like to wager 500 gold"
msgstr "Nous aimerions parier 500 pièces d'or"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:16
msgid "We'd like to wager 1000 gold"
msgstr "Nous aimerions parier 1000 pièces d'or"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:17
msgid "I see that you did, yes.  Here are your winnings.  Thanks for coming."
msgstr "Je vois que oui, en effet. Voici vos gains. Merci d'être venus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:19
msgid "We won!"
msgstr "Nous avons gagné !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:18
msgid "No harm in staying alive.  Comeback if you change your mind."
msgstr "Il n'y a pas de mal à rester en vie. Revenez si vous changez d'avis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:18
msgid "Ummm, we decided we don't want to fight today."
msgstr ""
"Euh, nous avons décidé que nous ne voulions pas combattre aujourd'hui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:19
msgid "Congratulations.  Here's your prize."
msgstr "Félicitations. Voici votre prix."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:2
msgid "Go up the stairs behind you to reach the viewing area."
msgstr "Montez l'escalier derrière vous pour rejoindre la tribune."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:2
msgid "Great."
msgstr "Parfait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:20
msgid "Very well.  Was there something else you would like to do?"
msgstr "Très bien. Y a-t-il autre chose que vous aimeriez faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:20
msgid "We changed our minds."
msgstr "Nous avons changé d'avis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:21
msgid "Come back when you're ready."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous serez prêts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:21
msgid "Nothing for us today, thank you."
msgstr "Rien pour nous aujourd'hui, merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:16
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:7
msgid ""
"Great.  If you have the money, Pick which of the contestants you would like to wager on."
msgstr ""
"Parfait. Si vous avez l'argent, choisissez le concurrent sur lequel vous voulez parier."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:3
msgid "We'd like to wager 50 gold"
msgstr "Nous aimerions parier 50 pièces d'or"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:9
msgid ""
"Alright.  Go through the doors at the end of the hall.  Your opponents will enter from the two side doors.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Passez les portes au bout du couloir. Vos adversaires entreront par les deux portes latérales. Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:4
msgid "We'd like to fight at the Page level."
msgstr "Nous aimerions combattre au niveau Page."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:5
msgid "We're here to fight."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus combattre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:5
msgid ""
"Wonderful!  It's always good to see fearless souls.  What level of a fight would you be brave enough to face?"
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! C'est toujours un plaisir de voir des âmes intrépides. A quel niveau de combat oseriez-vous vous mesurer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:6
msgid "We'd like to place a bet."
msgstr "Nous aimerions faire un pari."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:6
msgid "Wonderful.  How much would you like to wager?"
msgstr "Formidable. Combien voulez-vous parier ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:7
msgid "We'd like to wager 100 gold"
msgstr "Nous aimerions parier 100 pièces d'or"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:8
msgid "Alright.  Come back when you're interested."
msgstr "Très bien. Revenez quand ça vous intéressera."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC430.rude:9
msgid "We'd like to fight at the Squire level."
msgstr "Nous aimerions combattre au niveau Ecuyer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:1
msgid "You, my lord"
msgstr "Vous, mon seigneur"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:11
msgid "We were betrayed."
msgstr "Nous avons été trahis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:12
msgid "We serve ourselves."
msgstr "Nous nous servons nous-mêmes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:13
msgid "We owe Tamur Leng and Forad Darre a good wholluping!"
msgstr "Nous devons une bonne raclée à Tamur Leng et à Forad Darre !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:13
msgid "Wrong!  Though that might make you feel better."
msgstr "Faux ! Même si cela vous soulagerait peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:14
msgid "We must kill Forad Darre for betraying us."
msgstr "Nous devons tuer Forad Darre pour nous avoir trahis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:15
msgid "To serve you, my lord."
msgstr "Pour vous servir, mon seigneur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:15
msgid "What is the nature of your failure?"
msgstr "Quelle est la nature de votre échec ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:16
msgid "We must surrender all our gold and treasure."
msgstr "Nous devons renoncer à tout notre or et à nos trésors."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:17
msgid "We allowed a traitor to stand amongst us."
msgstr "Nous avons laissé un traître se tenir parmi nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:18
msgid "We must rescue our friends from death."
msgstr "Nous devons sauver nos amis de la mort."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:19
msgid "For what purpose do you quest?"
msgstr "Dans quel but menez-vous votre quête ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:19
msgid "You, my lord."
msgstr "Vous, mon seigneur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:2
msgid "Wrong?  What have we done wrong?"
msgstr "Faux ? Qu'avons-nous fait de mal ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:20
msgid "To gain experience and riches."
msgstr "Pour gagner expérience et richesses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:21
msgid "We must give up all that we have experienced."
msgstr "Nous devons renoncer à tout ce que nous avons vécu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:22
msgid "How must you make amends?"
msgstr "Comment devez-vous faire amende honorable ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:22
msgid "We owe those we betrayed."
msgstr "Nous avons une dette envers ceux que nous avons trahis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:23
msgid "We encouraged others to trust our misjudgement."
msgstr "Nous avons poussé d'autres à se fier à notre erreur de jugement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:23
msgid "Whom do you owe?"
msgstr "Envers qui avez-vous une dette ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:24
msgid "We serve Chedian."
msgstr "Nous servons Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:25
msgid "To save Chedian."
msgstr "Pour sauver Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:26
msgid "We owe the people of Chedian."
msgstr "Nous avons une dette envers le peuple de Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:27
msgid "We must light the Six Fires of Penance."
msgstr "Nous devons allumer les Six Feux de Pénitence."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:28
msgid "We must pay whatever price is required, my lord."
msgstr "Nous devons payer le prix exigé, quel qu'il soit, mon seigneur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:29
msgid "We serve the world."
msgstr "Nous servons le monde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:3
msgid "To save the world from Tamur Leng"
msgstr "Pour sauver le monde de Tamur Leng"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:30
msgid "Shall you pay?"
msgstr "Paierez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:30
msgid "The ultimate price, my lord.  Our lives."
msgstr "Le prix ultime, mon seigneur. Nos vies."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:31
msgid "We allowed our friends to be slain."
msgstr "Nous avons laissé nos amis se faire tuer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:32
msgid "We owe no one."
msgstr "Nous ne devons rien à personne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:33
msgid "We must stop Tamur Leng."
msgstr "Nous devons arrêter Tamur Leng."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:34
msgid "To rescue our fallen companions."
msgstr "Pour sauver nos compagnons tombés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:4
msgid "We serve the people."
msgstr "Nous servons le peuple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:5
msgid "We must kill our betrayer."
msgstr "Nous devons tuer celui qui nous a trahis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:6
msgid "Very well.  Speak again with Skraelos."
msgstr "Très bien. Parlez de nouveau à Skraelos."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:6
msgid "Yes, my lord."
msgstr "Oui, mon seigneur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:8
msgid "We must pay the price of our failure."
msgstr "Nous devons payer le prix de notre échec."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:8
msgid "What price must you pay?"
msgstr "Quel prix devez-vous payer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC432.rude:9
msgid "We trusted a traitor."
msgstr "Nous avons fait confiance à un traître."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC433.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC71.rude:1
msgid "I don't wanna answer any questions."
msgstr "J'ai pas envie de répondre à des questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC434.rude:1
msgid ""
"I'm working on the case for Thjorad, of course.  Now if you don't mind, I have to return to it!"
msgstr ""
"Je travaille à la vitrine de Thjorad, bien sûr. Maintenant, si vous le permettez, je dois m'y remettre !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC434.rude:2
msgid "No.  I'm busy."
msgstr "Non. Je suis occupé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:2
msgid "We'd like more gold."
msgstr "Nous aimerions plus d'or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:5
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:6
msgid "Your wish is granted."
msgstr "Votre souhait est exaucé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:3
msgid ""
"As a reward, I shall grant you a single benefit of your choice.  What would you like increased?"
msgstr ""
"En récompense, je vais vous accorder un unique avantage de votre choix. Que voulez-vous voir augmenter ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:4
msgid "We'd like more experience."
msgstr "Nous aimerions plus d'expérience."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:5
msgid "We'd like an item."
msgstr "Nous aimerions un objet."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC435.rude:6
msgid "We'd like an attribute bonus."
msgstr "Nous aimerions un bonus de caractéristique."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:1
msgid ""
"You've always been too big for Ravensford.  I'm sure you will find your destiny out there somewhere, not here.  I have some things left to give you.  They will impart knowledge that may keep you alive.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez toujours été trop grands pour Ravensford. Je suis sûr que vous trouverez votre destin quelque part là-bas, pas ici. J'ai encore quelques choses à vous donner. Elles vous apporteront un savoir qui pourra vous garder en vie. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:2
msgid "I have something left to give you."
msgstr "J'ai encore quelque chose à vous donner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:3
msgid "What do we do when we're finished?"
msgstr "Que faisons-nous quand nous aurons fini ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:3
msgid ""
"When you've finished all the scrolls, come back and visit me before you leave."
msgstr ""
"Quand vous aurez lu tous les parchemins, revenez me voir avant de partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:4
msgid ""
"Take these scrolls to begin with.  They will tell you all you need to know about interface.  Have a look around this museum.  Click on the buttons.  These are things you may encounter in the world.  Some may help you.  Others may, . . kill."
msgstr ""
"Prenez d'abord ces parchemins. Ils vous apprendront tout ce que vous devez savoir sur l'interface. Jetez un œil dans ce musée. Cliquez sur les boutons. Ce sont des choses que vous pourrez rencontrer dans le monde. Certaines pourront vous aider. D'autres pourraient... tuer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:4
msgid "Where do we start?"
msgstr "Par où commençons-nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:5
msgid "Goodbye, Grandpa."
msgstr "Au revoir, Grand-père."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:6
msgid ""
"Off you go then.  I doubt we shall see each other again, you've always been too big for Ravensford.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Alors, en route. Je doute que nous nous revoyions, vous avez toujours été trop grands pour Ravensford. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:6
msgid "That shouldn't be too difficult."
msgstr "Ça ne devrait pas être trop difficile."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:7
msgid ""
"Ahhh, I knew that this day would come, when your thirst for adventure would grow too strong to be quenched here in Ravensford.  Very well.  I shall help you with your training."
msgstr ""
"Ahhh, je savais que ce jour viendrait, où votre soif d'aventure deviendrait trop forte pour être étanchée ici, à Ravensford. Très bien. Je vais vous aider dans votre entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:7
msgid "We'd like to start our training."
msgstr "Nous aimerions commencer notre entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:8
msgid ""
"Think you're already strong enough, do you?  Well we'll see about that.  Standing between here and the dock to the north are a few..obstacles.  If you can make it to the dock, I think you will have proven your worth."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous croyez déjà assez forts, hein ? Eh bien, nous allons voir ça. Entre ici et le quai au nord se dressent quelques... obstacles. Si vous parvenez jusqu'au quai, je pense que vous aurez prouvé votre valeur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:8
msgid "We don't need to bother with training."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas besoin de nous entraîner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:9
msgid "We're ready to leave."
msgstr "Nous sommes prêts à partir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC436.rude:9
msgid ""
"Well, I guess you're strong enough.  Good luck.  You can find a boat waiting at the dock to the north.  I don't expect to see you again."
msgstr ""
"Bon, je suppose que vous êtes assez forts. Bonne chance. Un bateau vous attend au quai, au nord. Je ne pense pas vous revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:2
msgid "Maybe we can ask you something else?"
msgstr "Pourrions-nous vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:10
msgid "Very well.  I shall be around if you need me again."
msgstr "Très bien. Je serai dans le coin si vous avez encore besoin de moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:12
msgid "We no longer require your services."
msgstr "Nous n'avons plus besoin de vos services."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:11
msgid "Do you know anything about Verhoffin's diary?"
msgstr "Savez-vous quelque chose sur le journal de Verhoffin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:11
msgid ""
"I heard that he had one, and that Johannes Bem was looking for it.  Didn't pay enough for me to take the job."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire qu'il en tenait un et que Johannes Bem le cherchait. Il ne payait pas assez pour que j'accepte le travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:12
msgid ""
"I think he was vilified for no reason.  It was the fault of the Emperors that he caused the Great Cataclysm.  If they would have just left him alone, it would never have happened."
msgstr ""
"Je pense qu'il a été calomnié sans raison. C'est la faute des empereurs s'il a provoqué le Grand Cataclysme. S'ils l'avaient simplement laissé tranquille, cela ne serait jamais arrivé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:13
msgid "Farewell, then."
msgstr "Adieu, alors."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:2
msgid "I am for hire.  I am one of the best mages you'll ever see!"
msgstr ""
"Je suis à louer. Je suis l'un des meilleurs mages que vous verrez jamais !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:3
msgid "Alright.  You can work for us."
msgstr "D'accord. Vous pouvez travailler pour nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:3
msgid "Thank heavens!  This place was starting to get to my nerves."
msgstr "Grâce au ciel ! Cet endroit commençait à me taper sur les nerfs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:4
msgid ""
"500 Gold every month.  I also take 4% of the gold you find.  I think that's a bargain.  You won't find anything that cheap anywhere!"
msgstr ""
"500 pièces d'or par mois. Je prends aussi 4 % de l'or que vous trouvez. Je pense que c'est une affaire. Vous ne trouverez rien d'aussi bon marché nulle part !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:4
msgid "How much?"
msgstr "Combien ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:5
msgid "I'm one of the best mages around.  And for a price, I'm yours."
msgstr ""
"Je suis l'un des meilleurs mages du coin. Et pour un certain prix, je suis à vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:5
msgid "Perhaps.  Why would we be looking for you?"
msgstr "Peut-être. Pourquoi vous chercherions-nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:7
msgid "Nothing.  What is that?"
msgstr "Rien. Qu'est-ce que c'est ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC44.rude:8
msgid "That's a little steep for our pockets."
msgstr "C'est un peu cher pour notre bourse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:1
msgid "Great, come back when you've rescued him!"
msgstr "Parfait, revenez quand vous l'aurez libéré !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:10
msgid "Do you want Drangheim to get all the glory for saving Chedian?"
msgstr ""
"Voulez-vous que Drangheim récolte toute la gloire d'avoir sauvé Chedian ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:10
msgid "That's it.  I will not be manipulated.  Guards!"
msgstr "Ça suffit. Je ne me laisserai pas manipuler. Gardes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:11
msgid "If you do, I shall stop my army.  Farewell."
msgstr "Si vous y parvenez, j'arrêterai mon armée. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:11
msgid "We will get you that treaty!"
msgstr "Nous vous obtiendrons ce traité !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:12
msgid "And you expect me to help Clan Thronheim?"
msgstr "Et vous voulez que j'aide le clan Thronheim ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:12
msgid "As we speak, an army from Beldonia is marching on Thronheim."
msgstr "En ce moment même, une armée de Beldonia marche sur Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:13
msgid ""
"If you insist.  But I still think Sigmund strong-armed you into doing it for him."
msgstr ""
"Si vous insistez. Mais je pense toujours que Sigmund vous a forcé la main pour que vous le fassiez à sa place."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:13
msgid "It wasn't their fault.  The blame lies with us."
msgstr "Ce n'était pas leur faute. C'est nous qui sommes responsables."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:14
msgid ""
"If you want my help.  I can't take on these hordes without my best general.  Be careful, though.  You may need more experience before you can take on the Drangheim Prison."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez mon aide, oui. Je ne peux pas affronter ces hordes sans mon meilleur général. Soyez prudents, cependant. Il vous faudra peut-être plus d'expérience avant de vous attaquer à la Prison de Drangheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:14
msgid "You want us to break into a prison?"
msgstr "Vous voulez que nous entrions par effraction dans une prison ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:15
msgid "Great!  Come back when you're finished"
msgstr "Parfait ! Revenez quand vous aurez terminé"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:16
msgid "How will we do that?"
msgstr "Comment allons-nous faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:16
msgid ""
"It has been overrun by foul creatures.  If we are to occupy it once again, these things need to be destroyed.  You might have some trouble getting in, though. The portcullis is stuck, and the drawbridge is up."
msgstr ""
"Il a été envahi par d'immondes créatures. Si nous voulons l'occuper de nouveau, il faut détruire ces choses. Vous aurez peut-être du mal à y entrer, cependant. La herse est coincée et le pont-levis est relevé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:17
msgid ""
"There is a place called Anskram Keep in southern Sturmford that we used to use for the defense of our island.  If we are to defeat these invaders, you will need to clear the imps out."
msgstr ""
"Il existe un endroit appelé le Donjon d'Anskram, dans le sud de Sturmford, qui servait autrefois à la défense de notre île. Si nous voulons vaincre ces envahisseurs, vous devrez en chasser les diablotins."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:17
msgid "What is the first thing you need?"
msgstr "Quelle est la première chose dont vous avez besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:18
msgid ""
"I appreciate you being straight with me.  I shall give you aid.  But in order to do so, I will need you to do two things."
msgstr ""
"J'apprécie votre franchise. Je vais vous aider. Mais pour cela, j'aurai besoin que vous fassiez deux choses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:18
msgid "They come from Beldonia.  We must unite the clans against them."
msgstr "Ils viennent de Beldonia. Nous devons unir les clans contre eux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:19
msgid "He is the leader of the Hordes that will soon overrun us."
msgstr "C'est le chef des Hordes qui vont bientôt nous submerger."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:19
msgid "What are these Hordes?"
msgstr "Que sont ces Hordes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:2
msgid ""
"Besides the total destruction of Drangheim, you mean?  I suppose if I had a treaty signed by Sigmund himself, I could withdraw my troops."
msgstr ""
"A part la destruction totale de Drangheim, vous voulez dire ? Je suppose que si j'avais un traité signé par Sigmund en personne, je pourrais retirer mes troupes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:2
msgid "What would convince you to withdraw your army?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui vous convaincrait de retirer votre armée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:20
msgid "We need your help to defeat Tamur Leng."
msgstr "Nous avons besoin de votre aide pour vaincre Tamur Leng."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:20
msgid "Who is that?"
msgstr "Qui est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:21
msgid "Get to the point."
msgstr "Venez-en au fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:21
msgid "We know you are of great importance, and would like your help."
msgstr ""
"Nous savons que vous êtes très important, et nous aimerions votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:22
msgid "I will be sure to let them all know.  I will see you then!"
msgstr "Je ne manquerai pas de les prévenir tous. Je vous verrai là-bas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:22
msgid "We will meet in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr "Nous nous retrouverons à Thronheim dans deux semaines."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:23
msgid "Drangheim has already promised soldiers and arms."
msgstr "Drangheim a déjà promis des soldats et des armes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:23
msgid ""
"I feel as though you are trying to manipulate me into doing something.  That will not happen.  Be straight with me or I will take your heads."
msgstr ""
"J'ai l'impression que vous essayez de me manipuler pour me faire faire quelque chose. Cela n'arrivera pas. Soyez francs avec moi ou je vous coupe la tête."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:24
msgid ""
"Fear not, noble adventurers, Kira the Cold will be mine.  It only takes time.  Was there anything else you needed?."
msgstr ""
"N'ayez crainte, nobles aventuriers, Kira la Froide sera mienne. Ce n'est qu'une question de temps. Avez-vous besoin d'autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:24
msgid "Oh.  In that case, good luck."
msgstr "Oh. Dans ce cas, bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:25
msgid "Then I shall await your summons.  Farewell."
msgstr "Alors j'attendrai votre appel. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:25
msgid "We have much work to do, yet."
msgstr "Nous avons encore beaucoup à faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:26
msgid ""
"Alright, that is fair.  I can't blame him for not wanting to sign it first.  Plus, it will give me a chance to be with Kira before the war council convenes!"
msgstr ""
"D'accord, c'est équitable. Je ne peux pas lui reprocher de ne pas vouloir signer le premier. En plus, cela me donnera l'occasion d'être avec Kira avant que le conseil de guerre ne se réunisse !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:26
msgid "You and Sigmund will sign it together in Thronheim."
msgstr "Sigmund et vous le signerez ensemble à Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:20
msgid "We shall see you there."
msgstr "Nous vous y retrouverons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:27
msgid "Yes.  Have a safe trip."
msgstr "Oui. Faites bon voyage."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:28
msgid ""
"Ha ha!!  I can't wait to see her!  Oh will this be great!  I shall make plans to travel immediately!  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha !! J'ai hâte de la voir ! Oh, ce sera merveilleux ! Je vais préparer mon voyage sur-le-champ ! Avez-vous besoin d'autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:29
msgid "Well, she said, umm, er, well, she said..no."
msgstr "Eh bien, elle a dit, euh, hum, eh bien, elle a dit... non."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:29
msgid ""
"What?!  How could she not be aflutter?  I sent her the best love sonnet I wrote!!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ?! Comment peut-elle ne pas être tout émoustillée ? Je lui ai envoyé le plus beau sonnet d'amour que j'aie écrit !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:3
msgid "How do we get in?"
msgstr "Comment entrons-nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:3
msgid ""
"The walls are in a sorry state of disrepair.  There's probably a place where you could break through the walls."
msgstr ""
"Les murs sont dans un piteux état. Il y a sûrement un endroit où vous pourriez percer la muraille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:30
msgid "No!  That was exactly what she was afraid of."
msgstr "Non ! C'est exactement ce qu'elle craignait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:30
msgid ""
"Oh yes, there's going to be a war all right!  A war of love!  I will not stop until I win her heart!"
msgstr ""
"Oh oui, il va y avoir une guerre, c'est sûr ! Une guerre d'amour ! Je ne m'arrêterai pas avant d'avoir conquis son cœur !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:31
msgid "She called you a great warrior.  You just aren't her type."
msgstr ""
"Elle a dit que vous étiez un grand guerrier. Vous n'êtes simplement pas son genre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:31
msgid ""
"She said that, did she?  Well I appreciate your honesty.  It's time to go to war!!!"
msgstr ""
"Elle a dit ça, vraiment ? Eh bien, j'apprécie votre honnêteté. Il est temps de partir en guerre !!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:32
msgid "Ivsar!  Welcome home!!  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "Ivsar ! Bienvenue à la maison !! Avez-vous besoin d'autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:33
msgid "He is here."
msgstr "Il est ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:33
msgid "Wonderful.  Here is a little reward for your trouble."
msgstr "Formidable. Voici une petite récompense pour votre peine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:35 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:54
msgid ""
"That is the best news I've heard all day!  My messengers will be sent to all the clans at once!"
msgstr ""
"C'est la meilleure nouvelle que j'aie entendue de la journée ! J'envoie immédiatement mes messagers à tous les clans !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:36 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:40
msgid "And you wish my help?"
msgstr "Et vous voulez mon aide ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:36
msgid "If we do not unite the clans, they will conquer all the clans."
msgstr "Si nous n'unissons pas les clans, ils les conquerront tous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:37
msgid ""
"As you know, we have been on bad terms with the filthy Drangheim Clan.  In a battle near ten years ago, they captured our tactical genius, Ivsar Forktooth.  I want you to break him out of Drangheim Prison."
msgstr ""
"Comme vous le savez, nous sommes en mauvais termes avec l'infâme clan de Drangheim. Lors d'une bataille il y a près de dix ans, ils ont capturé notre génie de la tactique, Ivsar Forktooth. Je veux que vous le fassiez évader de la Prison de Drangheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:37
msgid "What is the second thing you need?"
msgstr "Quelle est la deuxième chose dont vous avez besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:38
msgid "Don't be silly.  Why would my allies do such a thing?"
msgstr ""
"Ne soyez pas ridicules. Pourquoi mes alliés feraient-ils une chose pareille ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:38
msgid "They didn't do that, we did!"
msgstr "Ce ne sont pas eux qui ont fait ça, c'est nous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:39
msgid "You have?  Wonderful!  Here is a reward!"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Formidable ! Voici une récompense !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:4
msgid "See!  I told you!  Those filthy Drangheim liars!"
msgstr "Vous voyez ! Je vous l'avais dit ! Ces sales menteurs de Drangheim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:4
msgid "Sigmund wouldn't join the coalition unless we did."
msgstr ""
"Sigmund refusait de rejoindre la coalition si nous ne le faisions pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:40
msgid "If Tamur Leng is not defeated, all of Chedian will suffer."
msgstr "Si Tamur Leng n'est pas vaincu, tout Chedian en souffrira."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:41
msgid "Do you not want glory?  Would you rather have Drangheim get it?"
msgstr ""
"Ne voulez-vous pas la gloire ? Préférez-vous que Drangheim l'obtienne ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:41
msgid "I do not like to be manipulated.  Guards!"
msgstr "Je n'aime pas être manipulé. Gardes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:42
msgid "I understand.  Should you change your mind, let me know."
msgstr "Je comprends. Si vous changez d'avis, faites-le-moi savoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:42
msgid "We don't have time to play matchmaker."
msgstr "Nous n'avons pas le temps de jouer les entremetteurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:43
msgid ""
"She did?  Of course she did!  I sent her my best love sonnet!  Ha Ha!  Thank you all!  Here's your reward!!"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Bien sûr que oui ! Je lui ai envoyé mon plus beau sonnet d'amour ! Ha ha ! Merci à vous tous ! Voici votre récompense !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:43
msgid "She, uhh, she..smiled."
msgstr "Elle, euh, elle... a souri."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:44
msgid "In fact, there might be."
msgstr "En fait, peut-être bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:45 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:12
msgid "Come back when you're serious"
msgstr "Revenez quand vous serez sérieux"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:46
msgid "Come back when you're serious."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous serez sérieux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:47
msgid "We've rescued Ivsar."
msgstr "Nous avons libéré Ivsar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:47
msgid "You have?  Great!  Where is he?  We have much to talk about!"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Parfait ! Où est-il ? Nous avons beaucoup de choses à nous dire !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:5
msgid ""
"Why should I?  They sent one of their agents into Anskram Keep and disabled all of its defenses!  They were planning an invasion already!!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi le ferais-je ? Ils ont envoyé un de leurs agents dans le Donjon d'Anskram pour désactiver toutes ses défenses ! Ils préparaient déjà une invasion !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:5
msgid "You must stop this war immediately!"
msgstr "Vous devez arrêter cette guerre immédiatement !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:50
msgid "We have come with a response from Kira the Cold."
msgstr "Nous vous apportons une réponse de Kira la Froide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:50
msgid "You have?!  What did she say??  Well?  Out with it!!"
msgstr "Vraiment ?! Qu'a-t-elle dit ?? Alors ? Parlez !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:51
msgid "Anskram Keep is clear."
msgstr "Le Donjon d'Anskram est dégagé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:51
msgid ""
"It is?  Great news!  I knew you wouldn't disappoint me!  Here is a reward for your trouble."
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Excellente nouvelle ! Je savais que vous ne me décevriez pas ! Voici une récompense pour votre peine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:52
msgid "We've done as you've asked.  Will you join the coalition?"
msgstr ""
"Nous avons fait ce que vous avez demandé. Rejoindrez-vous la coalition ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:52
msgid "Yes!  Yes of course.  When shall we have the war council?"
msgstr "Oui ! Oui, bien sûr. Quand tiendrons-nous le conseil de guerre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:53
msgid ""
"The meaning of what?  You'd better have a good reason for barging in here and yelling at me!"
msgstr ""
"Ce que ça signifie ? Vous avez intérêt à avoir une bonne raison de débarquer ici et de me crier dessus !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:53
msgid "What is the meaning of this?!"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que cela signifie ?!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:54
msgid "It is time for the war council.  The clans are united."
msgstr "Il est temps de tenir le conseil de guerre. Les clans sont unis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:55
msgid ""
"Kira wrote it?!  Wow!  I didn't know she was so interested in the affairs of Sturmford.  Very well.  As soon as Sigmund has signed it, so will I."
msgstr ""
"C'est Kira qui l'a écrit ?! Ça alors ! Je ne savais pas qu'elle s'intéressait tant aux affaires de Sturmford. Très bien. Dès que Sigmund l'aura signé, je le signerai aussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:55
msgid "We have a peace treaty written by Kira herself."
msgstr "Nous avons un traité de paix écrit par Kira elle-même."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:56
msgid "Bjarni, forgive us.  We are the ones who killed you."
msgstr "Bjarni, pardonnez-nous. C’est nous qui vous avons tué."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:56
msgid "Go, friends.  You must succeed in this.  Then all will be forgiven."
msgstr "Allez, mes amis. Vous devez réussir. Alors tout vous sera pardonné."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:6
msgid "Kira has told us you have gone to war with Drangheim!!"
msgstr "Kira nous a dit que vous étiez entré en guerre contre Drangheim !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:6
msgid ""
"That's right!  Those dirty liars are as two faced as they are ugly!  I can assure you as soon as they are wiped off the planet, I will be able to turn my attention to Tamur Leng and the Beldonians."
msgstr ""
"C’est exact ! Ces sales menteurs sont aussi fourbes qu’ils sont laids ! Je vous assure que dès qu’ils auront été rayés de la carte, je pourrai m’occuper de Tamur Leng et des Beldoniens."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:7
msgid "Of course.  We would be happy to aid you."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Nous serons heureux de vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:7
msgid "When you return with her response, I shall reward you well."
msgstr ""
"Quand vous reviendrez avec sa réponse, je vous récompenserai généreusement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:8
msgid ""
"It is no longer a secret that Kira, the Jarla of Thronheim possesses my heart, my soul, everything that I consider me.  I have composed a letter that will sweep her from her feet and make her mine.  I want you to take it to her."
msgstr ""
"Ce n’est plus un secret pour personne : Kira, la Jarla de Thronheim, possède mon cœur, mon âme, tout ce que je suis. J’ai écrit une lettre qui la fera tomber dans mes bras et la rendra mienne. Je veux que vous la lui apportiez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:9
msgid ""
"Then you shall have it.  However, there are a two things that you will need to do."
msgstr ""
"Alors vous l’aurez. Il y a cependant deux choses que vous devrez faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC45.rude:9
msgid "Yes.  We need the help of all the clans."
msgstr "Oui. Nous avons besoin de l’aide de tous les clans."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:1
msgid ""
"Be careful.  They may be spies just like us.  If you are discovered, you may jeopardize your lives."
msgstr ""
"Soyez prudents. Ce sont peut-être des espions, tout comme nous. Si vous êtes démasqués, vous risquez d’y laisser la vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:1
msgid "We will try to sniff out the spies for you."
msgstr "Nous allons essayer de débusquer les espions pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:10
msgid ""
"I would hate to use such a strong word as sabotage, but I think it is the word that fits.  I believe Drangheim agents have infiltrated our defenses and are planning an attack."
msgstr ""
"Je n’aime pas employer un mot aussi fort que sabotage, mais je crois que c’est celui qui convient. Je pense que des agents de Drangheim ont infiltré nos défenses et préparent une attaque."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:10
msgid "You think someone's been deliberately breaking these things?"
msgstr "Vous pensez que quelqu’un abîme ces choses exprès ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:11
msgid "Very well.  I will trust you to keep your lips closed about this."
msgstr "Très bien. Je compte sur vous pour tenir votre langue à ce sujet."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:11
msgid "We're not spy catchers."
msgstr "Nous ne chassons pas les espions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:12
msgid "I understand.  Perhaps if you're not busy later."
msgstr "Je comprends. Peut-être plus tard, si vous avez le temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:12
msgid "Sorry.  We've got too much to do already."
msgstr "Désolés. Nous avons déjà trop à faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:13
msgid "Keep your eyes open.  And be careful!"
msgstr "Gardez l’œil ouvert. Et soyez prudents !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:13
msgid "Still no luck on the saboteur."
msgstr "Toujours rien sur le saboteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:14
msgid "I appreciate your generosity."
msgstr "J’apprécie votre générosité."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:14
msgid "Perhaps we can buy you a drink?"
msgstr "Pouvons-nous vous offrir à boire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:15
msgid "We've discovered who the saboteur is."
msgstr "Nous avons découvert qui est le saboteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:15
msgid "You have?!  Who is he?"
msgstr "Vraiment ?! Qui est-ce ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:17 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:18
msgid "No.  Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Non. Désolés de vous avoir dérangé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:17
msgid "Yeah, whatever."
msgstr "Ouais, c’est ça."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:2
msgid ""
"Either you're very perceptive, or I've not been as discrete as I need to be.  Either way, perhaps you could help me."
msgstr ""
"Soit vous êtes très perspicaces, soit je n’ai pas été aussi discret que je le devrais. Quoi qu’il en soit, vous pourriez peut-être m’aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:2
msgid "What's your trouble?"
msgstr "Quel est votre problème ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:3
msgid ""
"There have been..things going wrong lately.  Things that should be working have been breaking.  Walls that should be in working order are found broken.  Defensive structures left wide open!"
msgstr ""
"Il y a eu… des choses qui tournent mal ces derniers temps. Des choses qui devraient fonctionner se cassent. Des murs qui devraient être en bon état sont retrouvés brisés. Des ouvrages défensifs laissés grands ouverts !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:3
msgid "We'd be happy to help."
msgstr "Nous serons heureux de vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:4
msgid "I'm not a tour guide."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas un guide touristique."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:5
msgid ""
"My cover has been blown.  Too many people know I work for Sturmford.  Perhaps you could poke your nose about and try to dig up some dirt.  It may prove to be lucrative."
msgstr ""
"Ma couverture a sauté. Trop de gens savent que je travaille pour Sturmford. Vous pourriez peut-être fouiner un peu et déterrer quelques secrets. Cela pourrait s’avérer lucratif."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:5
msgid "You can't do anything about it?"
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez rien y faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:6
msgid ""
"Disappeared you say?  He must have had a Scroll of Town Portal.  Good thinking on his part.  Don't worry, I'll make certain he pays for this!  Here's your reward."
msgstr ""
"Disparu, dites-vous ? Il devait avoir un Parchemin de Porte de rappel. Bien joué de sa part. Ne vous en faites pas, je veillerai à ce qu’il le paie ! Voici votre récompense."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:6
msgid "He disappeared."
msgstr "Il a disparu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:7
msgid "A man named Randver the Storm."
msgstr "Un homme nommé Randver la Tempête."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:7
msgid ""
"Randver?!  He's one of the Jarl's scribes!  Why, I've trusted him with some very important information!  What happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"Randver ?! C’est l’un des scribes du Jarl ! Dire que je lui ai confié des informations très importantes ! Que lui est-il arrivé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC46.rude:8
msgid "Thanks, but I won't need it."
msgstr "Merci, mais je n’en aurai pas besoin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:1
msgid "Eh?  Oh.  Thank you!"
msgstr "Hein ? Oh. Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:1
msgid "We'll get your manuscript for you."
msgstr "Nous allons récupérer votre manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:10
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah.  That would be great!  I would pay you well if you would go down there and get my manuscript!  It should be easy to find.  A bundle of papers called \"My Evermore Beloved\"."
msgstr ""
"Oh, oui. Ce serait formidable ! Je vous paierais bien si vous descendiez là-dessous récupérer mon manuscrit ! Il devrait être facile à trouver. Une liasse de papiers intitulée « Ma bien-aimée à jamais »."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:10
msgid "Perhaps we could go down there for you!"
msgstr "Nous pourrions peut-être descendre à votre place !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:11
msgid "Huh?  Questions?  I'm sorry I'm too busy for that sort of thing."
msgstr ""
"Hein ? Des questions ? Désolé, je suis trop occupé pour ce genre de choses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:11
msgid "We'd like you ask you a few questions."
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:12
msgid "Eh, what's that?  I don't hear so well these days."
msgstr ""
"Hein, qu’est-ce que vous dites ? Je n’entends plus très bien ces temps-ci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:12
msgid "We've found your manuscript."
msgstr "Nous avons trouvé votre manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:13
msgid "Eh?  You're looking for canned tulips?  Sorry, I only sell beets."
msgstr ""
"Hein ? Vous cherchez du maïs cuit ? Désolé, je ne vends que des betteraves."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:13
msgid "We're still searching for your manuscript."
msgstr "Nous cherchons toujours votre manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:14
msgid ""
"My Manuscript!!!  How did you find it?  Oh, A thousand thank yous!! Here's a reward!"
msgstr ""
"Mon manuscrit !!! Comment l’avez-vous trouvé ? Oh, mille mercis !! Voici une récompense !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:15
msgid "Alright.  Thanks anyway."
msgstr "D’accord. Merci quand même."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:15
msgid "Sorry.  We don't have time for that."
msgstr "Désolés. Nous n’avons pas le temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:16
msgid "DO YOU HAVE ANY NEWS??"
msgstr "AVEZ-VOUS DES NOUVELLES ??"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:16
msgid ""
"I've got my manuscript back, thanks to you.  I'll be sure to remember that in my dedication!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai récupéré mon manuscrit grâce à vous. Je ne manquerai pas de m’en souvenir dans ma dédicace !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:17
msgid "Eh?  Yeah, goodbye."
msgstr "Hein ? Oui, au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:18
msgid ""
"You want tanks for your what?  Your wine?  I'm sorry, I only sell beets."
msgstr ""
"Du thym pour votre quoi ? Votre vin ? Désolé, je ne vends que des betteraves."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:3
msgid ""
"What?  Oh, well you see, I'm a writer, and I've got to get my manuscript back."
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? Oh, eh bien, voyez-vous, je suis écrivain, et je dois récupérer mon manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:3
msgid "You don't look that busy to us."
msgstr "Vous n’avez pas l’air si occupé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:4
msgid ""
"Eh?  Oh, the manuscript?  Well it fell down the drain in my Beet Hoven.  I'm afraid of what's down there.  It's very important to me, though."
msgstr ""
"Hein ? Oh, le manuscrit ? Eh bien, il est tombé dans l’égout de mon Beet Hoven. J’ai peur de ce qu’il y a là-dessous. Mais il compte énormément pour moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:4
msgid "What happened to your manuscript?"
msgstr "Qu’est-il arrivé à votre manuscrit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:6
msgid ""
"Because of the monsters!  If I went down there, they would surely eat me alive!  I don't want to be eaten by monsters."
msgstr ""
"À cause des monstres ! Si je descendais là-dessous, ils me dévoreraient tout cru ! Je ne veux pas être dévoré par des monstres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:6
msgid "Why can't you go down there?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ne pouvez-vous pas y descendre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:7
msgid "Now if you don't mind, I've got some work to do."
msgstr "Maintenant, si vous le permettez, j’ai du travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:8
msgid "WE FOUND YOUR MANUSCRIPT!!"
msgstr "NOUS AVONS TROUVÉ VOTRE MANUSCRIT !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:8
msgid ""
"You have?!  Wonderful!!!  You are a brave sort.  Here's your reward.  Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ?! Merveilleux !!! Vous êtes des gens courageux. Voici votre récompense. Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:9
msgid "Huh?  What's that you said?"
msgstr "Hein ? Qu’est-ce que vous avez dit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC47.rude:9
msgid "Perhaps we could go down there for you."
msgstr "Nous pourrions peut-être descendre à votre place."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:10
msgid "See that you don't come back."
msgstr "Veillez à ne pas revenir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:2
msgid "We shall."
msgstr "Nous le ferons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:3
msgid "We found Itlor a job."
msgstr "Nous avons trouvé un travail pour Itlor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:3
msgid ""
"You have?  Well I guess I should thank you for that much at least.  If you see them, tell them I love them."
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Eh bien, je suppose que je devrais au moins vous remercier pour cela. Si vous les voyez, dites-leur que je les aime."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:4
msgid "Are you?  What of my children!?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Et mes enfants !?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:5
msgid "No!  I can't!  Please no!"
msgstr "Non ! Je ne peux pas ! Je vous en prie, non !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:5
msgid "You've committed a crime. You will have to go to prison for it."
msgstr "Vous avez commis un crime. Vous allez devoir aller en prison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:6
msgid ""
"What?  You can't!  I only did it for my children!  Without me they'll starve!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? Vous ne pouvez pas ! Je ne l’ai fait que pour mes enfants ! Sans moi, ils vont mourir de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:6
msgid "Yes.  We're going to have to arrest you."
msgstr "Oui. Nous allons devoir vous arrêter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:7
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "Ah bon ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:7
msgid "We've been watching you, Hat'lai."
msgstr "Nous vous avons à l’œil, Hat'lai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:8
msgid "I don't know anything.  Go away!"
msgstr "Je ne sais rien. Allez-vous-en !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:9
msgid "How can I know that?  I'm not there!  How will they eat?"
msgstr ""
"Comment puis-je le savoir ? Je ne suis pas là-bas ! Comment vont-ils manger ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC48.rude:9
msgid "Your children will be taken care of, Hatlati"
msgstr "On prendra soin de vos enfants, Hatlati."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:1
msgid ""
"I dunno.  A lot of people around here don't like them.  I don't know why."
msgstr ""
"J’sais pas. Beaucoup de gens par ici ne les aiment pas. Je ne sais pas pourquoi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:10
msgid "And now he's in jail."
msgstr "Et maintenant, il est en prison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:10
msgid "What are we to do?!  Without him, We'll starve!"
msgstr "Qu’allons-nous devenir ?! Sans lui, nous allons mourir de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:12
msgid ""
"A job?  What would I do?  Jobs aren't exactly easy to find around here!"
msgstr ""
"Un travail ? Pour faire quoi ? Le travail ne court pas les rues, par ici !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:12
msgid "Why don't you get a job?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ne cherchez-vous pas du travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:13
msgid "The Jarl?  Don't lie to him.  He doesn't like it when people lie."
msgstr "Le Jarl ? Ne lui mentez pas. Il n’aime pas qu’on lui mente."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:16
msgid "Thanks for your help."
msgstr "Merci de votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:15
msgid "Thank you, but hurry!  I don't want my family to starve!"
msgstr ""
"Merci, mais faites vite ! Je ne veux pas que ma famille meure de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:16
msgid ""
"My father told me to stay away from that place a long time ago.  It's filled with monsters!"
msgstr ""
"Il y a longtemps, mon père m’a dit de ne pas m’approcher de cet endroit. Il grouille de monstres !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:21
msgid "What do you know about Anskram Keep?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du Donjon d’Anskram ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:19
msgid ""
"It's great!  Injor pays me well.  I appreciate all that you've done for us."
msgstr ""
"C’est formidable ! Injor me paie bien. Je vous suis reconnaissant pour tout ce que vous avez fait pour nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:2
msgid "You're welcome.  Good luck."
msgstr "De rien. Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:20
msgid "It's good that you believe that.  Goodbye"
msgstr "C’est bien que vous le croyiez. Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:3
msgid "At the Magic Shop.  Injor needs someone to help out."
msgstr "À la boutique de magie. Injor a besoin d’un coup de main."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:3
msgid ""
"She does?  Great!  I'll see her first thing in the morning!!  Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Génial ! J’irai la voir demain à la première heure !! Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:4
msgid "Maybe if he worked an honest day, this wouldn't have happened."
msgstr "S’il avait gagné sa vie honnêtement, ce ne serait pas arrivé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:4
msgid ""
"What else would he do?  There's not a lot of 'honest work' around here."
msgstr ""
"Que pouvait-il faire d’autre ? Il n’y a pas beaucoup de « travail honnête » par ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:5
msgid ""
"I don't want to hear a lecture from you.  I get enough of those from my father."
msgstr ""
"Je ne veux pas de vos leçons de morale. Mon père m’en fait bien assez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:5
msgid "There are better ways than stealing from the market!"
msgstr "Il y a de meilleurs moyens que de voler au marché !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:7
msgid "Maybe we can help you with that."
msgstr "Nous pouvons peut-être vous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:7
msgid "You would?  Thank you!"
msgstr "Vous feriez ça ? Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC49.rude:9
msgid "It's the least we could do.  Can we ask you a few questions?"
msgstr ""
"C’est la moindre des choses. Pouvons-nous vous poser quelques questions ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:10
msgid "I'll give you 1500 gold for it."
msgstr "Je vous en donne 1500 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:10
msgid "We've got a medium piece."
msgstr "Nous avons un morceau moyen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:11
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "Plus tard, peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:11
msgid "Whatever you want."
msgstr "Comme vous voulez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:12
msgid "Great!  What size piece do you have?"
msgstr "Formidable ! Quelle taille fait votre morceau ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:12
msgid "We've got some Thjorad to sell"
msgstr "Nous avons du Thjorad à vendre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:13
msgid "I'll give you 3000 gold for it."
msgstr "Je vous en donne 3000 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:13
msgid "We've got a large piece."
msgstr "Nous avons un gros morceau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:15
msgid ""
"I am interested in purchasing any Elemental Thjorad you bring me.  The larger the size, the more I will pay."
msgstr ""
"Je suis prêt à acheter tout le Thjorad élémentaire que vous m’apporterez. Plus le morceau est gros, plus je paierai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:15
msgid "No, but perhaps we can do a job for you."
msgstr "Non, mais nous pouvons peut-être travailler pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:16
msgid "How is that?  What sort of help did you need?"
msgstr "Comment cela ? De quelle aide aviez-vous besoin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:16 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:11
msgid "We were wondering if you could help us."
msgstr "Nous nous demandions si vous pouviez nous aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:17
msgid "Come back when you're ready to do business."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous serez prêts à faire affaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:2
msgid "Sold!"
msgstr "Vendu !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:4
msgid ""
"That old thing broke again?  As I recall, the last time I made one for Hjarrand, I made two.  Why don't I trade that broken one you have for a fresh clean one?"
msgstr ""
"Ce vieux machin est encore cassé ? Si je me souviens bien, la dernière fois que j’en ai fabriqué un pour Hjarrand, j’en ai fait deux. Et si je vous échangeais celui qui est cassé contre un tout neuf ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:4
msgid "We need a replacement Slag Extractor."
msgstr "Il nous faut un Extracteur de scories de rechange."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:5
msgid "Great!  Here you go!"
msgstr "Formidable ! Tenez !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:6
msgid "I'll give you 700 gold for it."
msgstr "Je vous en donne 700 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:6
msgid "We've got a small piece."
msgstr "Nous avons un petit morceau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:7
msgid "Here you go."
msgstr "Tenez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:7
msgid "Perhaps.  Show us what you have"
msgstr "Peut-être. Montrez-nous ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:8
msgid "We'd like to do business"
msgstr "Nous aimerions faire affaire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC5.rude:9
msgid "Alright then.  Anything else I can do for you?"
msgstr "Très bien. Puis-je faire autre chose pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:1
msgid ""
"Those filthy people!  If they start another war, I'd be happy to go fight!"
msgstr ""
"Ces gens immondes ! S’ils déclenchent une nouvelle guerre, j’irai me battre avec plaisir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:10
msgid "Not anymore than any other person who hasn't been there would."
msgstr "Pas plus que n’importe qui d’autre qui n’y est jamais allé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:11
msgid "Would you like to buy something?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous acheter quelque chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:13
msgid "Are you looking for any help?"
msgstr "Avez-vous besoin d’aide ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:13
msgid ""
"Yes!  I need someone to watch the shop when I'm gone, wash the walls and mop the floors."
msgstr ""
"Oui ! J’ai besoin de quelqu’un pour garder la boutique en mon absence, laver les murs et passer la serpillière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:14
msgid ""
"I hear that he is in love with Kira the Cold.  That poor fellow!  Not that he's a bad looking fellow for a human, but I don't think she's even remotely interested!"
msgstr ""
"On dit qu’il est amoureux de Kira la Froide. Le pauvre ! Ce n’est pas qu’il soit laid, pour un humain, mais je ne crois pas qu’elle s’intéresse le moins du monde à lui !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:2
msgid "What do you know about Bjarni Thorvaldssen?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Bjarni Thorvaldssen ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:17
msgid ""
"He's doing well.  He's a hard worker, and stays on the right side of the law.  That was a wonderful thing you did for his family."
msgstr ""
"Il se débrouille bien. Il travaille dur et reste du bon côté de la loi. Vous avez fait quelque chose de merveilleux pour sa famille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:17
msgid "How's Itlor working out?"
msgstr "Comment s’en sort Itlor ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:2
msgid "We might have the perfect person."
msgstr "Nous avons peut-être la personne idéale."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:2
msgid "Who is that?  It would have to be someone I trust."
msgstr "Qui donc ? Il faudrait que ce soit quelqu’un de confiance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:3
msgid "Itlor Oord is looking for work."
msgstr "Itlor Oord cherche du travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:3
msgid ""
"Oh!  I heard his father got into some trouble.  Send him over.  I would be happy to help him out."
msgstr ""
"Oh ! J’ai entendu dire que son père avait eu des ennuis. Envoyez-le-moi. Je serai heureux de lui donner un coup de main."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:4
msgid ""
"Because they are a dirty, filthy people!  They come over here, wreck our things!  They steal our babies!  They destroy our crops!  I say get rid of them all!"
msgstr ""
"Parce que ce sont des gens sales et immondes ! Ils viennent ici et détruisent nos biens ! Ils volent nos bébés ! Ils ravagent nos récoltes ! Moi, je dis qu’il faut tous les chasser !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:4
msgid "Why do you dislike them so much?"
msgstr "Pourquoi les détestez-vous autant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:7
msgid ""
"I wouldn't be the one!  If you want to break the Jarl's heart, go right ahead!"
msgstr ""
"Ce ne sera pas moi ! Si vous voulez briser le cœur du Jarl, ne vous gênez pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:7
msgid "No one has told him?"
msgstr "Personne ne le lui a dit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC50.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:8
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:9
msgid "Show us what you have."
msgstr "Montrez-nous ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:2
msgid ""
"The wizards up at the laboratory have bought every candle in Yorwick this month.  Whatever they are writing, they write it at night."
msgstr ""
"Les mages du laboratoire ont acheté toutes les chandelles de Yorwick ce mois-ci. Quoi qu’ils écrivent, ils l’écrivent la nuit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:4
msgid "Show us your books."
msgstr "Montrez-nous vos livres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:3
msgid ""
"These are no apprentice primers.  Every tome here was copied from a master's own hand.  Look all you like, but mind the pages."
msgstr ""
"Ce ne sont pas des manuels d’apprenti. Chaque tome ici a été copié de la main même d’un maître. Regardez tant que vous voulez, mais prenez garde aux pages."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:4
msgid "The lamps are out.  Come back in the morning."
msgstr "Les lampes sont éteintes. Revenez demain matin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:5
msgid ""
"It's quiet, which suits me.  Scholars come from all over to see the laboratories, and scholars buy books."
msgstr ""
"C’est calme, et ça me convient. Des érudits viennent de partout pour voir les laboratoires, et les érudits achètent des livres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:6
msgid ""
"Here and there.  Frosgard, Lindisfarne, a wizard's widow in Thjorgard.  I don't ask how a book left its last owner, and I'd thank you not to either."
msgstr ""
"Ici et là. Frosgard, Lindisfarne, la veuve d’un mage à Thjorgard. Je ne demande pas comment un livre a quitté son dernier propriétaire, et je vous saurais gré de ne pas le demander non plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:6
msgid "Where do your books come from?"
msgstr "D’où viennent vos livres ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:7
msgid "Ask, then."
msgstr "Demandez, alors."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC500.rude:8
msgid "Then keep your fingers off the covers."
msgstr "Alors, ne touchez pas aux couvertures."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:1
msgid "Uh-oh."
msgstr "Oh oh."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:1
msgid "What?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Quoi ? De quoi parlez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:10
msgid "Not everyone."
msgstr "Pas tout le monde."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:10
msgid "We thought everyone here hated Drangheim."
msgstr "Nous pensions que tout le monde ici détestait Drangheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:12
msgid "Why would I want to?"
msgstr "Pourquoi le voudrais-je ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:12
msgid "You don't think you could stop them?"
msgstr "Vous ne pensez pas pouvoir les arrêter ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:13
msgid "Aren't you Sturmfordian?"
msgstr "N’êtes-vous pas de Sturmford ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:13
msgid "Eh?  Oh, yeah, down with Drangheim!  Those dirty pigs!"
msgstr "Hein ? Oh, si, à bas Drangheim ! Ces sales porcs !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:14
msgid "Alright.  Maybe we could ask you something else."
msgstr "D’accord. Nous pourrions peut-être vous demander autre chose."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:15
msgid "Most people here call Drangheim a Pond-hole."
msgstr "Ici, la plupart des gens disent que Drangheim est un trou boueux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:15
msgid "Watch your mouth!"
msgstr "Surveillez votre langage !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:16
msgid "Go away.  Leave me alone."
msgstr "Allez-vous-en. Laissez-moi tranquille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:17
msgid "'Those' Sturmfordians?  What do you mean?"
msgstr "« Ces » gens de Sturmford ? Que voulez-vous dire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:17
msgid "Eh, er, nothing!  I meant, 'we' Sturmfordians."
msgstr "Euh, heu, rien ! Je voulais dire « nous », les gens de Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:18
msgid "We, er, those Drangheim people are not as bad as everyone thinks."
msgstr ""
"Nous, euh, ces gens de Drangheim ne sont pas aussi mauvais que tout le monde le pense."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:19
msgid "Leave me alone, then!"
msgstr "Alors laissez-moi tranquille !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:19
msgid "Nothing.  Nevermind."
msgstr "Rien. Laissez tomber."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:2
msgid ""
"He is a pig!  I don't know how a monkey like him could call himself a Jarl!"
msgstr ""
"C’est un porc ! Je ne sais pas comment un singe comme lui peut se dire Jarl !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:21
msgid "It's filled with nasty things.  Those Sturmfordians should be glad."
msgstr ""
"Il est rempli de sales bestioles. Ces gens de Sturmford devraient s’en réjouir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:22
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr "Laissez-moi tranquille !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:3
msgid ""
"Because if they occupied it, Drangheim might have to come over here and take over."
msgstr ""
"Parce que s’ils l’occupaient, Drangheim serait peut-être obligé de venir ici prendre le pouvoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:4
msgid "Why do I think that you're lying to us?"
msgstr "Pourquoi ai-je l’impression que vous nous mentez ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:4
msgid "Why would I do that?  Hail Bjarni!  He's the best!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi ferais-je une chose pareille ? Vive Bjarni ! C’est le meilleur !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:11 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:20
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:5
msgid "I don't know anyting!"
msgstr "J’sais rien du tout !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about sabotage?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous du sabotage ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:6
msgid ""
"What do you mean?  I don't know anyting!  I'm not the one who unlocked the town gates!"
msgstr ""
"Comment ça ? J’sais rien du tout ! C’est pas moi qui ai déverrouillé les portes de la ville !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:7
msgid "BLANK"
msgstr "BLANK"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:7
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:8
msgid "He's not my Jarl!"
msgstr "Ce n’est pas mon Jarl !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:8
msgid "You would dare call your Jarl a pig?"
msgstr "Vous osez traiter votre Jarl de porc ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC51.rude:9
msgid "Er, uh nothing."
msgstr "Euh, heu, rien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:1
msgid "MMMMM!"
msgstr "MMMMM !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:10
msgid "We'd like to talk to you about your news."
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous parler de vos nouvelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:10
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "De quoi parlez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:12
msgid "Arrgh.  Mmmm."
msgstr "Arrgh. Mmmm."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:12
msgid "You don't seem to be talkative anymore."
msgstr "Vous ne semblez plus très bavard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:13
msgid "HRRRMPH!!!"
msgstr "HRRRMPH !!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:2
msgid "Guess we'll leave you alone.  See you later."
msgstr "Bon, nous allons vous laisser tranquille. À plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:2
msgid "MMMMRRRRG!!!!"
msgstr "MMMMRRRRG !!!!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:3
msgid "MMMMFFF!"
msgstr "MMMMFFF !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:3
msgid "What's that?  It's hard to understand you without a tongue."
msgstr "Pardon ? Difficile de vous comprendre sans langue."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:4
msgid "Alright.  Should have kept your mouth shut."
msgstr "Eh bien. Vous auriez dû tenir votre langue."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:4
msgid "We'll see who's sorry!"
msgstr "On verra bien qui le regrettera !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:5
msgid "Not Bjarni.  Sigmund."
msgstr "Pas Bjarni. Sigmund."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:5
msgid "The Jarl of Drangheim?  Uh,..What can he do?  Go ahead!"
msgstr "Le Jarl de Drangheim ? Euh… Que peut-il faire ? Allez-y !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:6
msgid "Bjarni?  Go ahead.  He'll give me a reward!"
msgstr "Bjarni ? Allez-y. Il me récompensera !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:6
msgid "Perhaps we will inform the Jarl."
msgstr "Nous allons peut-être prévenir le Jarl."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:7
msgid "There is nothing you can make me do."
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez rien m’obliger à faire."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:7
msgid "We've come to ask you to stop."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus vous demander d’arrêter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:8
msgid "We understand you've been spreading gossip to Drangheim."
msgstr "Il paraît que vous colportez des ragots à Drangheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:8
msgid "What would you know about that?  I have done nothing wrong."
msgstr "Qu’en savez-vous ? Je n’ai rien fait de mal."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:9
msgid "I can't be bothered with that."
msgstr "Je n’ai pas de temps à perdre avec ça."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC52.rude:9 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:8
msgid "We'd like to ask you a few questions"
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:10
msgid "I guess.  It's too bad we have to kill to solve problems."
msgstr ""
"Sans doute. C’est bien dommage de devoir tuer pour régler les problèmes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:10
msgid "Speaking of, perhaps you'd like to purchase a problem solver?"
msgstr ""
"À ce propos, vous voudriez peut-être acheter de quoi régler vos problèmes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:11
msgid "That you do."
msgstr "Ça, oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:13
msgid "I hear those filthy Drangheimers are planning another war."
msgstr "Il paraît que ces sales Drangheimois préparent une nouvelle guerre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:14
msgid "Come back when you want business!"
msgstr "Revenez quand vous voudrez faire affaire !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:14 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:10
msgid "Nothing today, thank you."
msgstr "Rien aujourd’hui, merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:2
msgid "Sure.  Show us what you have."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Montrez-nous ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:3
msgid "Heck of a way to keep the population down."
msgstr "Drôle de façon de limiter la population."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:3
msgid "Yeah.  Speaking of population trimmers, would you like to buy one?"
msgstr "Oui. À propos de régulateurs de population, vous en voulez un ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:4
msgid "Better to not have it at all."
msgstr "Mieux vaudrait qu’il n’y en ait pas du tout."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:4
msgid ""
"War isn't so bad.  Keeps the population down.  If there were no war, we'd all probably be starving to death."
msgstr ""
"La guerre, ce n’est pas si terrible. Ça limite la population. Sans la guerre, nous mourrions sans doute tous de faim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:5
msgid "Maybe a little humanity."
msgstr "Un peu d’humanité, peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:5
msgid ""
"War is war.  People are going to have it whether you want them to or not.  Better to profit by it than be destroyed by it."
msgstr ""
"La guerre, c’est la guerre. Les gens la feront, que vous le vouliez ou non. Mieux vaut en profiter que d’en être détruit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:6
msgid "That's horrible.  Is that all war is to you?  Profit?"
msgstr ""
"C’est horrible. La guerre n’est donc pour vous qu’une source de profit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:6
msgid "What do you expect?  I sell weapons."
msgstr "À quoi vous attendiez-vous ? Je vends des armes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:7
msgid ""
"They're always planning to fight.  It's all the same to me.  Because of that, I get more business."
msgstr ""
"Ils se préparent toujours à se battre. Pour moi, c’est du pareil au même. Grâce à ça, je fais de meilleures affaires."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:7
msgid "What makes you think that?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce qui vous fait dire ça ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC53.rude:9
msgid "Sorry, We're closed.  Come back tomorrow"
msgstr "Désolé, nous sommes fermés. Revenez demain."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:2
msgid ""
"There is always conflict between Sturmford and Drangheim.  It's a good time to buy armor.  Would you like some?"
msgstr ""
"Il y a toujours des conflits entre Sturmford et Drangheim. C’est le bon moment pour acheter une armure. Vous en voulez une ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:2
msgid "War?  Who is he planning to go to war against?"
msgstr "La guerre ? Contre qui compte-t-il partir en guerre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:3
msgid ""
"He claims it's to replace old and worn out suits, but I think he's getting ready to go to war."
msgstr ""
"Il prétend que c’est pour remplacer les vieilles armures usées, mais je crois qu’il se prépare à la guerre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:3
msgid "What's all that armor for?"
msgstr "À quoi servent toutes ces armures ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:5
msgid "Show us your stuff."
msgstr "Montrez-nous votre marchandise."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:6
msgid ""
"Sorry.  I don't have much time for that sort of thing.  Bjarni has me making two hundred new suits of armor, and I don't spend much time in the tavern these days."
msgstr ""
"Désolé. Je n’ai pas beaucoup de temps pour ce genre de choses. Bjarni m’a commandé deux cents armures neuves, et je ne vais plus guère à la taverne ces temps-ci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC54.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you have money, cheapskate!"
msgstr "Revenez quand vous aurez de l’argent, radin !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:1
msgid ""
"Ah, is that so?  Let me give you some advice, then.  Without the right writ, everything will be wrong."
msgstr ""
"Ah, vraiment ? Alors laissez-moi vous donner un conseil. Sans le bon écrit, tout ira de travers."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:1
msgid "We're trying to stop him."
msgstr "Nous essayons de l’arrêter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:10
msgid "Mad?  Is that what they're saying about me these days?"
msgstr "Fou ? C’est donc ce qu’on raconte sur moi ces temps-ci ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:10
msgid "We've heard you are the Mad Wizard Robinssen."
msgstr "On nous a dit que vous étiez Robinssen, le Mage fou."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:11
msgid "You want the help of a mad wizard?  What's wrong with you?"
msgstr ""
"Vous voulez l’aide d’un mage fou ? Qu’est-ce qui ne va pas chez vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:13
msgid "How did you get back?"
msgstr "Comment êtes-vous revenu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:13
msgid "Skraelos had to let me go.  He had to make good on his bet."
msgstr "Skraelos a dû me laisser partir. Il devait honorer son pari."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:14
msgid "That is very astute of you!  Perhaps you are smarter than rodents."
msgstr ""
"Voilà qui est très perspicace ! Vous êtes peut-être plus malins que des rongeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:14
msgid "You don't say.  We always thought mesonite was unstable."
msgstr ""
"Pas possible. Nous avons toujours pensé que la mésonite était instable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:15 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:4
msgid "I suppose you may."
msgstr "Je suppose que oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:16
msgid "Do you sometimes think you're Krohn?"
msgstr "Vous arrive-t-il de vous prendre pour Krohn ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:16
msgid "I've been known to dress like him on occasion."
msgstr "Il m’est arrivé de m’habiller comme lui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:17
msgid ""
"Actually, he bet me.  He didn't think I could summon a lightening bolt on command all the way in Arslegard.  He's still feeling a little burned on that, I think."
msgstr ""
"En fait, c’est lui qui a parié contre moi. Il ne croyait pas que je pourrais faire tomber la foudre sur commande jusqu’à Arslegard. Je crois qu’il en est encore un peu échaudé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:17
msgid "You bet a god?"
msgstr "Vous avez parié avec un dieu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:18
msgid "That is for you to understand."
msgstr "C’est à vous de le comprendre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:18
msgid "What is that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que c’est censé vouloir dire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:19
msgid ""
"Sure.  I had a great chat with Krohn on the formation of the universe.  A stunning fellow, that chap."
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr. J’ai eu une passionnante conversation avec Krohn sur la formation de l’univers. Un type épatant, ce Krohn."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:19
msgid "You've been there?"
msgstr "Vous y êtes allé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:2
msgid "Well you can't have it!  Now go away!"
msgstr "Eh bien, vous ne l’aurez pas ! Maintenant, allez-vous-en !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:20 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:24
msgid "Thanks for the advice.  Can we ask you something else?"
msgstr "Merci du conseil. Pouvons-nous vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:20
msgid "You may.  I might even have an answer for you."
msgstr "Vous pouvez. J’aurai peut-être même une réponse pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:21
msgid "Sorry.  We don't have that much money."
msgstr "Désolés. Nous n’avons pas autant d’argent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:21
msgid "Well I ain't going to give it to you!"
msgstr "Eh ben, j’vais pas vous l’donner !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:22
msgid "Next time it won't be free."
msgstr "La prochaine fois, ce ne sera pas gratuit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:23
msgid "Is that so?  I might have a few answers for you."
msgstr "Vraiment ? J’aurai peut-être quelques réponses pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:24
msgid "You can ask.  I might even have an answer."
msgstr "Vous pouvez demander. J’aurai peut-être même une réponse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:25
msgid ""
"It's a nice place.  Although Hanndl can sometimes be a pain.  If you ever go there, make sure you take a drink at the tavern."
msgstr ""
"C’est un endroit agréable, même si Hanndl peut parfois être pénible. Si vous y allez un jour, ne manquez pas de boire un verre à la taverne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:26
msgid ""
"That's what they all say when they want something from me.  What is it that you want?"
msgstr ""
"C’est ce qu’ils disent tous quand ils veulent quelque chose de moi. Que voulez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:26
msgid "We're sure you're not mad."
msgstr "Nous sommes sûrs que vous n’êtes pas fou."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:27
msgid "You're lucky it's free.  Next time it may not be."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez de la chance que ce soit gratuit. La prochaine fois, ce ne le sera peut-être pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:28
msgid ""
"Well we both agree that the identification of dark matter will probably unlock all the mysteries of the universe, but he thinks that dark matter will have the properties of mesonite.   Mesonite is too unstable to exist in such large amounts though."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, nous sommes tous deux d’accord pour dire que l’identification de la matière noire permettra sans doute de percer tous les mystères de l’univers, mais il pense que la matière noire aura les propriétés de la mésonite. Or la mésonite est trop instable pour exister en si grandes quantités."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:28
msgid "What did he have to say?"
msgstr "Qu’avait-il à dire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:29
msgid "Go away!  Don't bother me anymore."
msgstr "Allez-vous-en ! Ne m’importunez plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:3
msgid "Is that so?  What is it that you want?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Que voulez-vous donc ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:3
msgid "We won't go away until you help us!"
msgstr "Nous ne partirons pas tant que vous ne nous aurez pas aidés !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:30
msgid ""
"He's vastly overrated as a mage.  If he had been more skilled, he might have had enough sense to not mess with the things he was messing with."
msgstr ""
"On le surestime beaucoup en tant que mage. S’il avait été plus doué, il aurait peut-être eu le bon sens de ne pas toucher à ce qu’il touchait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:31
msgid "You should be thankful.  I should charge you for it!"
msgstr ""
"Vous devriez m’en être reconnaissants. Je devrais vous le faire payer !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:4
msgid ""
"Have it?  What is wrong with people these days?  I invented the darned thing!"
msgstr ""
"L’avoir ? Mais qu’ont donc les gens de nos jours ? C’est moi qui ai inventé ce fichu machin !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:4
msgid "We've heard you have a Black Orb of Knowledge."
msgstr "On nous a dit que vous aviez un Orbe noir du savoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:5
msgid "Do you have one?  If you do, we'd like to buy it from you."
msgstr "En avez-vous un ? Si oui, nous aimerions vous l’acheter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:5
msgid ""
"Have one?  Why sure, I've got one.  Would I sell it though?  I'm not sure."
msgstr ""
"Si j’en ai un ? Bien sûr que j’en ai un. Mais est-ce que je le vendrais ? Je n’en suis pas sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:6
msgid "Name your price."
msgstr "Fixez votre prix."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:6
msgid ""
"Well If that were the case, I'd charge you a million gold.  I'm pretty sure that you wouldn't pay that much for it.  It's a pretty useful item, though.  2000 gold."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, dans ce cas, je vous en demanderais un million de pièces d’or. Je suis à peu près sûr que vous ne le paieriez pas autant. C’est tout de même un objet bien utile. 2000 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:7
msgid "That's pretty steep."
msgstr "C’est plutôt cher."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:7
msgid ""
"Well I don't really need to sell it.  If you want it, that's how much you'll have to pay for it."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, je n’ai pas vraiment besoin de le vendre. Si vous le voulez, c’est le prix à payer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:8
msgid "Nice doing business with you."
msgstr "Ce fut un plaisir de faire affaire avec vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:8
msgid "Well, alright.  2000 gold it is."
msgstr "Bon, d’accord. Va pour 2000 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC55.rude:9
msgid ""
"That man is dangerous.  It's very possible that he'll become the new ruler of Chedian.  Perhaps the Ursanian Empire will live again."
msgstr ""
"Cet homme est dangereux. Il se pourrait bien qu’il devienne le nouveau maître de Chedian. Peut-être l’Empire ursanien renaîtra-t-il."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:12
msgid ""
"Well we need an Orb of Linking.  If we had one of those, all the banks in Chedian could be linked up!"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, il nous faut un Orbe de liaison. Si nous en avions un, toutes les banques de Chedian pourraient être reliées !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:13
msgid ""
"Our local writer, Ludwig Van has been walking around very depressed lately."
msgstr ""
"Notre écrivain local, Ludwig Van, se promène l’air très déprimé ces derniers temps."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:15
msgid "No, We would like to ask some questions."
msgstr "Non, nous aimerions poser quelques questions."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:16
msgid "An Orb of Linking?  Those are real?!  Of course you can install it!"
msgstr ""
"Un Orbe de liaison ? Ça existe vraiment ?! Bien sûr que vous pouvez l’installer !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:16
msgid "We've come to install an Orb of Linking."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus installer un Orbe de liaison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:17
msgid "Great!  Thanks for all your help!"
msgstr "À merveille ! Merci pour toute votre aide !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:2
msgid ""
"I don't know what the big deal is about.  I don't think they're half as bad as all the Sturmfordians think."
msgstr ""
"Je ne vois pas pourquoi on en fait toute une histoire. Je ne crois pas qu’ils soient à moitié aussi mauvais que le pensent les gens de Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:3
msgid "From what we've heard that sort of talk is close to treason."
msgstr ""
"D’après ce que nous avons entendu, ce genre de propos frise la trahison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:3
msgid ""
"Some people get a little overzealous about the conflict between our sister clan."
msgstr ""
"Certains se montrent un peu trop zélés au sujet du conflit avec notre clan frère."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:5
msgid "Sister Clan?"
msgstr "Clan frère ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:5
msgid ""
"Yes.  A few generations ago, there was a conflict between Sturm, our Clan leader, and his sister, Drang.  Drang finally left with her followers and became the Jarla of a new clan."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Il y a quelques générations, un conflit a éclaté entre Sturm, le chef de notre clan, et sa sœur, Drang. Drang a fini par partir avec ses partisans et elle est devenue la Jarla d’un nouveau clan."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:6
msgid ""
"Ludwig Van lives in his shop.  A place called the Beet Hoven.  It's on the corner, right across the street from the park"
msgstr ""
"Ludwig Van vit dans sa boutique. Un endroit appelé le Beet Hoven. C’est au coin de la rue, juste en face du parc."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:7
msgid "I'm not sure.  He only mumbles something about his manuscript."
msgstr ""
"Je ne sais pas trop. Il ne fait que marmonner quelque chose à propos de son manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:8
msgid "Yes.  We would like to do some banking."
msgstr "Oui. Nous aimerions effectuer quelques opérations bancaires."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:9
msgid "He's not one of our clients."
msgstr "Ce n’est pas l’un de nos clients."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC56.rude:9
msgid "What do you know about Tamur Leng"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Tamur Leng ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:1
msgid ""
"If you don't pay, you don't stay!  I won't do any business with you until you pay for that window!"
msgstr ""
"Si vous ne payez pas, vous ne restez pas ! Je ne ferai plus affaire avec vous tant que vous n’aurez pas payé cette fenêtre !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:1
msgid "What?  That's way overpriced.  We're not paying!"
msgstr "Quoi ? C’est beaucoup trop cher. Nous ne paierons pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:11
msgid "Dragons?  Tell us about the dragons."
msgstr "Des dragons ? Parlez-nous des dragons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:11
msgid ""
"Well, there aren't very many of them left in the world, I can tell you that much.  I have heard rumors, though.  Men come in here from time to time, look at my prize, and tell me the dragon stories."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, il n’en reste plus beaucoup dans le monde, ça je peux vous le dire. J’ai tout de même entendu des rumeurs. De temps en temps, des hommes viennent ici, regardent mon trophée et me racontent des histoires de dragons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:12
msgid "We'd like to hear the dragon stories."
msgstr "Nous aimerions entendre ces histoires de dragons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:12
msgid ""
"Well, they say that there's one left, though I'm not sure where he is.  But I do know someone who does!"
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, on dit qu’il en reste un, mais je ne sais pas où il se trouve. En revanche, je connais quelqu’un qui le sait !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:13
msgid ""
"His name is Snorri the Fist.  He's an old warrior who spends most of his time in a bottle."
msgstr ""
"Il s’appelle Snorri le Poing. C’est un vieux guerrier qui passe le plus clair de son temps au fond d’une bouteille."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:13
msgid "Who?"
msgstr "Qui ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:14
msgid ""
"If he's anything like I remember him, probably somewhere inside a bottle in Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"S’il n’a pas changé, il doit être quelque part au fond d’une bouteille à Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:15
msgid "Alright.  We're sorry.  We'll pay for it."
msgstr "D’accord. Nous sommes désolés. Nous allons payer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:15
msgid "Thank you.  Come back later, and I'll be happy to do business again."
msgstr ""
"Merci. Revenez plus tard, et je serai heureux de refaire affaire avec vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:16
msgid ""
"If you find one of those, look out!  They're usually heavily trapped.  But if you can get into one without getting yourself killed, the treasure inside is worth it!"
msgstr ""
"Si vous en trouvez un, prenez garde ! Ils sont généralement bourrés de pièges. Mais si vous parvenez à en ouvrir un sans vous faire tuer, le trésor qu’il renferme en vaut la peine !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:16
msgid "What do you know about Black Chests?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des Coffres noirs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:17
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "Comme vous voudrez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:17
msgid "That's nice.  Congratulations."
msgstr "C’est bien. Félicitations."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:18
msgid "Certainly.  Would you like a drink?"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Vous voulez boire quelque chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:19
msgid ""
"No!  You broke my window.  You don't get anything around here until you pay for it!  That glass cost me 300 gold!"
msgstr ""
"Non ! Vous avez cassé ma fenêtre. Vous n’aurez rien ici tant que vous ne l’aurez pas payée ! Ce verre m’a coûté 300 pièces d’or !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:2
msgid "Artifact?"
msgstr "Un artefact ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:2
msgid ""
"Yes.  Like Spencer's Obedience.  It may be a club, but it packs a better wallop than any old sword!"
msgstr ""
"Oui. Comme l’Obéissance de Spencer. Ce n’est peut-être qu’une massue, mais elle cogne plus fort que n’importe quelle vieille épée !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:22
msgid ""
"Some guy came in here the other day talking about her.  Maybe you could ask him."
msgstr ""
"Un type est passé ici l’autre jour et parlait d’elle. Vous pourriez peut-être lui demander."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:23
msgid "Anything else of interest?"
msgstr "Autre chose d’intéressant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:23
msgid ""
"Maybe.  You look the sort who would be crazy enough to be interested.  You see that dragon over the door?  That was Thoronax, the last of the great red dragons.  I slew him myself."
msgstr ""
"Peut-être. Vous m’avez l’air assez fous pour que ça vous intéresse. Vous voyez ce dragon au-dessus de la porte ? C’était Thoronax, le dernier des grands dragons rouges. Je l’ai tué moi-même."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:24
msgid "Come back when you're thirsty."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous aurez soif."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:25
msgid "Certainly.  Maybe buy a drink?"
msgstr "Bien sûr. Vous prendrez bien un verre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:3
msgid ""
"Oh, I don't know where it is.  Somebody probably has a hold of it somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Oh, je ne sais pas où il se trouve. Quelqu’un a dû mettre la main dessus quelque part."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:3
msgid "Where can we find it?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous le trouver ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:5
msgid ""
"They're scattered all over.  You're best bet would be to take a quest from someone."
msgstr ""
"Ils sont éparpillés un peu partout. Le mieux serait d’accepter une quête de quelqu’un."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:7
msgid ""
"If you can find yourself an artifact, they're usually worth the trouble they cause."
msgstr ""
"Si vous arrivez à trouver un artefact, il vaut généralement les ennuis qu’il cause."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:8
msgid "No problem.  Anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr "Pas de quoi. Puis-je faire autre chose pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC57.rude:9
msgid ""
"He's probably still hanging around Sturmford.  He said his name was Doorsbane.  Halfdan Doorsbane, I think."
msgstr ""
"Il traîne sans doute encore du côté de Sturmford. Il a dit qu’il s’appelait Fléau-des-Portes. Halfdan Fléau-des-Portes, je crois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:10
msgid "Blessings be with you, children."
msgstr "Que la bénédiction soit sur vous, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:2
msgid "Alright, we're sorry.  We'll pay for the glass."
msgstr "D’accord, nous sommes désolés. Nous allons payer le verre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:2
msgid ""
"Thank you very much!  Come back later and I would be happy to heal you."
msgstr ""
"Merci beaucoup ! Revenez plus tard et je serai heureux de vous soigner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:3
msgid ""
"You should not be asking questions about that place.  When the time comes.  All your questions will be answered."
msgstr ""
"Vous ne devriez pas poser de questions sur cet endroit. Le moment venu, vous aurez toutes vos réponses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:4
msgid "Blessings upon you."
msgstr "Soyez bénis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We would like some healing."
msgstr "Oui. Nous aimerions être soignés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:5
msgid "No way!  That's way too much!"
msgstr "Pas question ! C’est beaucoup trop cher !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:5
msgid "Then you will have to go somewhere else for your healing!"
msgstr "Alors vous devrez aller vous faire soigner ailleurs !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:6
msgid "The blessings of the gods upon you, children."
msgstr "Que les dieux vous bénissent, mes enfants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:6
msgid "We would like to make a donation"
msgstr "Nous aimerions faire un don."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:8
msgid ""
"No!  You've been fooling around in here and you broke a window!  Those windows cost seven hundred gold!  I won't heal you until you pay for them!"
msgstr ""
"Non ! Vous avez fait les imbéciles ici et vous avez cassé une fenêtre ! Ces fenêtres coûtent sept cents pièces d’or ! Je ne vous soignerai pas tant que vous ne les aurez pas payées !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:9
msgid ""
"Ah, they're finally replacing that temple in Guberland, are they?  I'm afraid I can't help you.  I am the only one here."
msgstr ""
"Ah, ils remplacent enfin ce temple de Guberland, alors ? Je crains de ne pas pouvoir vous aider. Je suis le seul ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC58.rude:9
msgid "We're looking for a priest to take to a new temple."
msgstr "Nous cherchons un prêtre pour l’emmener dans un nouveau temple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:10
msgid "Sho'!  Anything else?"
msgstr "Pour sûr ! Autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:8
msgid "Sho'!"
msgstr "Pour sûr !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:3
msgid ""
"He's in love with that Kira the Cold over in Thronheim.  I heard he's composed love sonnets to her an everthin'!"
msgstr ""
"Il est amoureux de c’te Kira la Froide, là-bas à Thronheim. Il paraît qu’il lui a écrit des sonnets d’amour et tout l’tralala !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:4
msgid "Sho'!  Have a look!"
msgstr "Pour sûr ! Jetez un œil !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:5
msgid "Sorry, we're closed for the evening."
msgstr "Désolé, nous sommes fermés pour la soirée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:6
msgid "Sho'!  You want ta do some shoppin'?"
msgstr "Pour sûr ! Z’voulez faire des emplettes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC59.rude:7
msgid "Nuthin'.  What is it?"
msgstr "Rien d’rien. C’est quoi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:1
msgid "We're ready for the challenge."
msgstr "Nous sommes prêts à relever le défi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:1
msgid ""
"You may think so.  I'm not so sure.  Go see Abbot Leffery Caid in Lindisfarne.  He will instruct you on how to summon the dragon."
msgstr ""
"Vous le pensez peut-être. Moi, je n’en suis pas si sûr. Allez voir l’abbé Leffery Caid à Lindisfarne. Il vous expliquera comment invoquer le dragon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:10
msgid "Sounds too dangerous for us."
msgstr "Ça nous paraît trop dangereux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:10
msgid ""
"They say cowards are long lived.  Perhaps one day you will be brave enough to take the challenge."
msgstr ""
"On dit que les lâches vivent longtemps. Peut-être serez-vous un jour assez braves pour relever le défi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:12
msgid ""
"Much thanks.  I can tell that you haven't yet been tested by the Training Hall.  It changes a person, you know.  Come back and buy me another drink when you've learned that for yourselves."
msgstr ""
"Grand merci. Je vois bien que vous n’avez pas encore été mis à l’épreuve par la Salle d’entraînement. Ça change un homme, vous savez. Revenez m’offrir un autre verre quand vous l’aurez appris par vous-mêmes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:13
msgid "Sorry old man.  Maybe you should get a job."
msgstr "Désolés, grand-père. Vous devriez peut-être trouver du travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:13
msgid ""
"Watch your mouth!  I may be old, but I could still show you a thing or two!"
msgstr ""
"Surveillez votre langage ! Je suis peut-être vieux, mais je pourrais encore vous apprendre deux ou trois choses !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:2
msgid ""
"There is a place I have been to.  It is a secretive place that only the bravest and best warriors dare go.  It is here the best warriors are made.  If you can pass the tests given there, you may be worthy of killing the dragon."
msgstr ""
"Il est un endroit où je suis allé. Un lieu secret où seuls les guerriers les plus braves et les meilleurs osent s’aventurer. C’est là que sont formés les meilleurs guerriers. Si vous réussissez les épreuves qu’on y fait passer, vous serez peut-être dignes de tuer le dragon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:2
msgid "What is this task?"
msgstr "Quelle est cette tâche ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:3
msgid ""
"Well perhaps you might do a task for me.  If you complete that task, I shall tell you how to slay the dragon."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, vous pourriez peut-être accomplir une tâche pour moi. Si vous la menez à bien, je vous dirai comment tuer le dragon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:3
msgid "Who us?  Of course!"
msgstr "Qui, nous ? Bien sûr !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:5
msgid "If it is there, we will find it."
msgstr "Si elle est là-bas, nous la trouverons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:5
msgid ""
"You certainly have the bravery.  If you are worthy, perhaps I shall see you again."
msgstr ""
"Le courage, ça, vous l’avez. Si vous en êtes dignes, nous nous reverrons peut-être."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:6
msgid ""
"Ahhh, that I cannot say.  It is a place you must find yourself.  I can tell you this however: It is called the Training Hall, and can be found somewhere in region of Thjorgard."
msgstr ""
"Ahhh, cela, je ne peux pas le dire. C’est un endroit que vous devez trouver vous-mêmes. Mais je peux vous dire ceci : on l’appelle la Salle d’entraînement, et elle se trouve quelque part dans la région de Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:3
msgid "Where is it?"
msgstr "Où se trouve-t-il ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:7
msgid "I bet you're interested in slaying dragons, ain't ya?"
msgstr "Je parie que vous aimeriez tuer des dragons, pas vrai ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:7
msgid "Weave your tale, old man."
msgstr "Racontez-nous votre histoire, grand-père."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:8
msgid ""
"Much thanks.  If you care to listen, I have a tale that warriors such as yourselves might find interesting."
msgstr ""
"Grand merci. Si vous voulez bien m’écouter, j’ai une histoire que des guerriers comme vous pourraient trouver intéressante."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:12 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:9
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "Bien sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC6.rude:9
msgid ""
"Much thanks.  I can see by your faces that you succeeded in surviving the Training Hall.  Well done.  But the dragon is an even greater task."
msgstr ""
"Grand merci. Je vois à vos visages que vous avez survécu à la Salle d’entraînement. Bien joué. Mais le dragon est une épreuve plus grande encore."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:1
msgid "A fine place for trade, if your boat can make it that far."
msgstr ""
"Un bon endroit pour le commerce, si votre bateau peut aller jusque-là."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:4
msgid "And what sort of information would you be looking for?"
msgstr "Et quel genre d’informations cherchez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:5
msgid ""
"If you're looking to get away from the islands that make up Hanndl's Grasp, go to Guberland.   You can travel to anywhere from there."
msgstr ""
"Si vous voulez quitter les îles qui forment l’Étreinte de Hanndl, allez à Guberland. De là, vous pourrez vous rendre n’importe où."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:5
msgid "Is there anywhere else we can go?"
msgstr "Pouvons-nous aller ailleurs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:6
msgid ""
"I won't be putting to sea for a while yet, should you change your mind."
msgstr ""
"Je ne prendrai pas la mer avant un moment, au cas où vous changeriez d’avis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC60.rude:7
msgid "Sure you're not looking for passage?"
msgstr "Vous êtes sûrs de ne pas vouloir embarquer ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:1
msgid ""
"I hear there are some hanging around the outskirts of Sturmford.  One should not be difficult to find."
msgstr ""
"On dit qu’il en traîne quelques-uns aux abords de Sturmford. Vous ne devriez pas avoir de mal à en trouver un."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:1
msgid "Where can we find the Basilisk?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous trouver le Basilic ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:10
msgid "It is within the city walls of Thjorgard."
msgstr "Elle se trouve dans l’enceinte de Thjorgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:10
msgid "Where is the Arena?"
msgstr "Où se trouve l’Arène ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:11
msgid "Is there anything else I can do for you?"
msgstr "Puis-je faire autre chose pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:12
msgid ""
"Bjarni lives in the longhouse in the middle of the northern section of town."
msgstr ""
"Bjarni vit dans la grande maison, au milieu du quartier nord de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:13
msgid "You can find the bank west of Bjarni's Longhouse."
msgstr "Vous trouverez la banque à l’ouest de la grande maison de Bjarni."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:15
msgid ""
"The first labor is to find a basilisk and kill it.  Once you have done that, bring its skin back to me."
msgstr ""
"Le premier travail consiste à trouver un basilic et à le tuer. Une fois que ce sera fait, rapportez-moi sa peau."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:15
msgid "What is the first labor?"
msgstr "Quel est le premier travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:17
msgid ""
"Very well.  There are three Gladiatorial Labors.  Before you can be promoted, you must complete all three."
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Il y a trois Travaux de gladiateur. Avant de pouvoir être promus, vous devez les accomplir tous les trois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:17
msgid "Yes, we have members who would like to be Gladiators."
msgstr "Oui, certains d’entre nous aimeraient devenir Gladiateurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:2
msgid ""
"So you have.  Congratulations.  You are hereby promoted to Gladiators."
msgstr ""
"En effet. Félicitations. Je vous promeus par la présente au rang de Gladiateurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:2
msgid "We've completed all the labors."
msgstr "Nous avons accompli tous les travaux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:24
msgid ""
"You can find the armor shop in the southern section of town next to a small park."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique d’armures dans le quartier sud de la ville, près d’un petit parc."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:26
msgid "Alright.  Is there something else you need?"
msgstr "Très bien. Avez-vous besoin d’autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:26
msgid "No, we don't have anyone who wants to be promoted to Gladiator."
msgstr "Non, personne parmi nous ne souhaite devenir Gladiateur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:27
msgid "I'm afraid not.  Sorry."
msgstr "J’ai bien peur que non. Désolé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:29
msgid ""
"The second labor is not a traditional labor, but as it's my duty to assign them, I shall choose the labors.  For some time, Bjarni has fancied Kira, the Jarla of Thronheim.  I'm sure if he had something dear to her she would welcome his love."
msgstr ""
"Le deuxième travail n’est pas un travail traditionnel, mais comme c’est à moi de les attribuer, c’est moi qui choisis. Depuis quelque temps, Bjarni a des vues sur Kira, la Jarla de Thronheim. Je suis sûr que s’il possédait un objet qui lui est cher, elle accueillerait son amour avec joie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:29
msgid "What is the second labor?"
msgstr "Quel est le deuxième travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:30
msgid ""
"Good luck on your continued quests.  Anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"Bonne chance pour la suite de vos quêtes. Puis-je faire autre chose pour vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:31
msgid "The tavern is the first building east of the northern entrance."
msgstr "La taverne est le premier bâtiment à l’est de l’entrée nord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:33
msgid "The temple is in the southern section of town, past the East Gate."
msgstr ""
"Le temple se trouve dans le quartier sud de la ville, après la porte Est."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:35
msgid ""
"In fact, we have.  Some of the shopkeepers have complained that someone has been stealing from them.  Not very much, but enough to perhaps feed a small family.  I would be grateful if you would look into it."
msgstr ""
"Justement, oui. Certains marchands se sont plaints qu’on les volait. Pas grand-chose, mais assez pour nourrir une petite famille. Je vous serais reconnaissant de vous pencher sur la question."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:36
msgid "What is the third labor?"
msgstr "Quel est le troisième travail ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:36
msgid "You must go to the Arena in Thjorgard, fight at Lord level, and win."
msgstr ""
"Vous devez aller à l’Arène de Thjorgard, combattre au niveau Seigneur et gagner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:37
msgid ""
"You can find the magic shop in the southern section of town next to a small park."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique de magie dans le quartier sud de la ville, près d’un petit parc."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:40
msgid ""
"Come back when they are completed and you shall call yourselves Gladiators."
msgstr "Revenez quand ce sera fait, et vous pourrez vous dire Gladiateurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:40
msgid "We shall do all of these things."
msgstr "Nous accomplirons tout cela."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:41
msgid "Should you wish to become a Gladiator.  I can help you with that."
msgstr "Si vous souhaitez devenir Gladiateurs, je peux vous y aider."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:41
msgid "We have heard that you can promote Mercenaries."
msgstr "On nous a dit que vous pouviez promouvoir les Mercenaires."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:44
msgid "The training hall is in the most southwesterly section of town."
msgstr "La salle d’entraînement se trouve tout au sud-ouest de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:50
msgid "The general store is west of here, north of the library."
msgstr "Le bazar est à l’ouest d’ici, au nord de la bibliothèque."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:52
msgid "The library is between the bank and the general store."
msgstr "La bibliothèque est entre la banque et le bazar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:59
msgid ""
"I want you to go to her palace in Thronheim, and steal her shield, then bring it back to me."
msgstr ""
"Je veux que vous alliez à son palais de Thronheim, que vous voliez son bouclier et que vous me le rapportiez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:60
msgid "Ah yes, so you do.  Congratulations on the completion of one labor."
msgstr "Ah oui, en effet. Félicitations, vous avez accompli un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:60
msgid "We have the Basilisk Skin"
msgstr "Nous avons la Peau de basilic."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:61
msgid ""
"Thank you!  This will win her over for sure!  Congratulations on the completion of one labor."
msgstr ""
"Merci ! Avec ça, je suis sûr de la conquérir ! Félicitations, vous avez accompli un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:61
msgid "We have Kira's Shield"
msgstr "Nous avons le Bouclier de Kira."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:62
msgid "We have won in the Arena."
msgstr "Nous avons gagné dans l’Arène."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:62
msgid ""
"You have proven your strength, adventurers.  Congratulations on the completion of one labor."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez prouvé votre force, aventuriers. Félicitations, vous avez accompli un travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:7
msgid ""
"You can find the weapon shop in the northern section of town next to a small park."
msgstr ""
"Vous trouverez la boutique d’armes dans le quartier nord de la ville, près d’un petit parc."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC61.rude:9
msgid ""
"Johannes Bem right in Thjorgard can help you.  You can find him in the Bembridge University."
msgstr ""
"Johannes Bem, ici même à Thjorgard, peut vous aider. Vous le trouverez à l’Université de Bembridge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:1
msgid "Nothing exciting has happened to me in thirty years!"
msgstr "Il ne m’est rien arrivé de passionnant depuis trente ans !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you bake their bones in cow dung, you can make a potent anti-venom!  Why, I remember this time my sword brother took ill after a fight with a snake!  I nursed him back to health with that concoction!"
msgstr ""
"Si on fait cuire leurs os dans de la bouse de vache, on obtient un puissant contrepoison ! Tenez, je me souviens qu’une fois, mon frère d’armes est tombé malade après un combat contre un serpent ! Je l’ai remis sur pied avec cette mixture !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about fighting skeletons?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous sur les combats contre les squelettes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC63.rude:5
msgid "Farewell, young warriors!"
msgstr "Adieu, jeunes guerriers !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:2
msgid ""
"He died, of course!  At least, I thought he was dead!  I even put chips of Elemental Thjorad over his eyes.  But he came back!  Thank the heavens!"
msgstr ""
"Il est mort, bien sûr ! Du moins, je le croyais mort ! J’avais même posé des éclats de Thjorad élémentaire sur ses yeux. Mais il est revenu ! Le ciel soit loué !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:2
msgid "How did he get there?"
msgstr "Comment y est-il allé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:3
msgid "My husband, of course!  He went to Arslegard, and then came back!"
msgstr "Mon mari, bien sûr ! Il est allé à Arslegard, puis il est revenu !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:3
msgid "Who did?"
msgstr "Qui donc ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC64.rude:4
msgid ""
"That poor Feargus A'Feslo!  He spent a long time in the Drangheim Prison!"
msgstr ""
"Ce pauvre Feargus A'Feslo ! Il a passé longtemps dans la prison de Drangheim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC65.rude:1
msgid ""
"Dalla!  How could someone go to Arslegard and then come back?  No one can come back from the dead!"
msgstr ""
"Dalla ! Comment quelqu’un pourrait-il aller à Arslegard et en revenir ? Personne ne revient d’entre les morts !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC65.rude:1
msgid "Who's fibbing?"
msgstr "Qui raconte des histoires ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:1
msgid ""
"Stay away from the Ruined Temple.  That place is dangerous!  My cousin's uncle went in there and never came back out!"
msgstr ""
"Ne vous approchez pas du Temple en ruine. Cet endroit est dangereux ! L’oncle de mon cousin y est entré et n’en est jamais ressorti !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:3
msgid ""
"A leader from the Dia clan sought the wanderers out.  She traveled this new wasteland, and brought us to this place.  If it weren't for Ekan'dia, the half-orcs would have become extinct."
msgstr ""
"Une cheffe du clan Dia est partie à la recherche des errants. Elle a parcouru ces nouvelles terres désolées et nous a conduits ici. Sans Ekan'dia, les demi-orques auraient disparu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:3
msgid "How did you survive?"
msgstr "Comment avez-vous survécu ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:4
msgid ""
"After the Great Cataclysm, all our homelands and culture were destroyed.  We wandered for years.  Many starved.  We were ill equipped to survive in this new and harsh world that was created."
msgstr ""
"Après le Grand Cataclysme, toutes nos terres et notre culture furent détruites. Nous avons erré pendant des années. Beaucoup sont morts de faim. Nous étions mal préparés pour survivre dans ce monde nouveau et cruel."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:4
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Bien sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:7
msgid "Would you like to hear about the history of the Half-orcs?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous entendre l’histoire des demi-orques ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC66.rude:9
msgid "If it weren't for Ekan'dia, we would never have survived."
msgstr "Sans Ekan'dia, nous n’aurions jamais survécu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC67.rude:1
msgid "I heard that Feargus A'Feslo spent some time in Drangheim Prison."
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu dire que Feargus A'Feslo avait passé un moment dans la prison de Drangheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:1
msgid ""
"Very soon I'll be going off to Lindisfarne to study!  I'm very excited!  Maybe one day I'll be invited to give a speech on Elvish history!"
msgstr ""
"Je vais bientôt partir étudier à Lindisfarne ! J’ai tellement hâte ! Peut-être qu’un jour on m’invitera à faire un discours sur l’histoire des elfes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:3
msgid ""
"My father said we were once a single nation 500 years ago!  I didn't believe him, but he studied at the University in Mendossus."
msgstr ""
"Mon père dit qu’il y a 500 ans, nous ne formions qu’une seule nation ! Je ne l’ai pas cru, mais il a étudié à l’Université de Mendossus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about Rysh?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Rysh ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:6
msgid "Not a problem.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Il n’y a pas de mal. Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:5
msgid ""
"It's this place in Mendossus that is a focal point of magical energy.  All of the great scholars go there to study!"
msgstr ""
"C’est un endroit à Mendossus qui est un foyer d’énergie magique. Tous les grands érudits vont y étudier !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC68.rude:5
msgid "What is the University?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que l’Université ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC69.rude:1
msgid ""
"Mommy gave a whole piece of gold for my birthday last year!  Can you believe that?  A whole gold piece!!"
msgstr ""
"L’année dernière, Maman m’a donné une pièce d’or entière pour mon anniversaire ! Vous vous rendez compte ? Une pièce d’or entière !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC69.rude:3
msgid ""
"Daddy says they are mean people!  He said if I ever saw one I should run away, because they might eat me!"
msgstr ""
"Papa dit que ce sont des méchants ! Il a dit que si j’en voyais un, je devais m’enfuir, parce qu’ils pourraient me manger !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC69.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:8
msgid "Bye bye!"
msgstr "Au revoir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:1
msgid "How much are you offering?"
msgstr "Combien proposez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:1
msgid "Well how much do you want?"
msgstr "Eh bien, combien voulez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:10
msgid "Forget it then.  See you later"
msgstr "Tant pis, alors. À plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:10
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "Bon débarras."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:11
msgid "Is the machine fixed yet?"
msgstr "La machine est-elle réparée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:11
msgid ""
"Settle down!  I haven't even looked at it yet!  But you'll have to come with me when I do!!"
msgstr ""
"Du calme ! Je ne l’ai même pas encore regardée ! Mais il faudra que vous veniez avec moi quand je le ferai !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:12
msgid "Hm..er..ahh..I guess..not.  That just isn't worth my time."
msgstr ""
"Hm… euh… ahh… je suppose… que non. Ça ne vaut pas la peine que je me dérange."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:12
msgid "We'll pay you 500 gold."
msgstr "Nous vous paierons 500 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:13
msgid "We have the money."
msgstr "Nous avons l’argent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:14
msgid "Mmmmm..uh..alright.  I guess I could do it for that"
msgstr ""
"Mmmmm… euh… d’accord. Je suppose que je pourrais le faire pour ce prix-là."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:14
msgid "We'll pay you 1,000 gold"
msgstr "Nous vous paierons 1 000 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:15
msgid "Did you fix the machine?"
msgstr "Avez-vous réparé la machine ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:15
msgid ""
"What?  Fix it?  Of course not!  Fixing it's your job.  That mark I made is where it is broken.  Don't dally now!  Get to work!"
msgstr ""
"Quoi ? La réparer ? Bien sûr que non ! La réparer, c’est votre travail. La marque que j’ai faite, c’est là qu’elle est cassée. Ne traînez pas ! Au travail !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:16
msgid ""
"Did you hear the good news?  They offered me my job back!  Isn't that great!  I owe it all to you.  Thanks!"
msgstr ""
"Vous connaissez la bonne nouvelle ? Ils m’ont proposé de reprendre mon travail ! C’est formidable, non ? Je vous dois tout. Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:17
msgid "We'll pay you 2,000 gold"
msgstr "Nous vous paierons 2 000 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:17
msgid "YAAA-Heee!  Saddle 'em up!  I'll take a look at that machine for ya."
msgstr ""
"YAAA-HOUUU ! En selle ! Je vais jeter un œil à cette machine pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:18
msgid ""
"I got the last replacement from Gunnar Thjorsmith, the Armor Merchant.  I don't know if he's still in business, though."
msgstr ""
"Le dernier de rechange, je l’ai eu de Gunnar Thjorsmith, le marchand d’armures. Mais je ne sais pas s’il est toujours en activité."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:18
msgid "Where can we find a new Slag Extractor?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous trouver un nouvel Extracteur de scories ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:19
msgid "Nothing.  Sorry to bother you"
msgstr "Rien. Désolés de vous avoir dérangé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:2
msgid ""
"Heh heh.  First they fire me for being too old, and now that something has broken, they have to come running to me to fix it.  Is there money involved?"
msgstr ""
"Hé hé. D’abord, ils me renvoient parce que je suis trop vieux, et maintenant que quelque chose est cassé, ils viennent me supplier de le réparer. Il y a de l’argent à la clé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:2
msgid "They say you're the only one who could fix it."
msgstr "On dit que vous êtes le seul à pouvoir la réparer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:3
msgid "Hah!  Fat chance.  Maybe you should find some other sucker."
msgstr "Ha ! Vous pouvez toujours courir. Trouvez-vous donc un autre pigeon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:3
msgid "We'll pay you 50 gold"
msgstr "Nous vous paierons 50 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:4
msgid "One of the machines in the Refinery is broken."
msgstr "L’une des machines de la Raffinerie est cassée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:4
msgid "What should I care about that?"
msgstr "Et pourquoi est-ce que ça me préoccuperait ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:6
msgid "OK.  Thanks."
msgstr "D’accord. Merci."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:8
msgid "Alright!  Let's go."
msgstr "Très bien ! Allons-y."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:8
msgid "I know the way.  See you there."
msgstr "Je connais le chemin. On se retrouve là-bas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:9
msgid "I could almost be bothered to get out of my bed for that."
msgstr "Pour ça, j’arriverais presque à sortir de mon lit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC7.rude:9
msgid "We'll pay you 100 gold"
msgstr "Nous vous paierons 100 pièces d’or."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:1
msgid ""
"I caught a snake yesterday, but it bit my finger, and I had to let it go."
msgstr ""
"Hier, j’ai attrapé un serpent, mais il m’a mordu le doigt et j’ai dû le lâcher."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:3
msgid "I hate school!"
msgstr "Je déteste l’école !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC72.rude:3
msgid "What do you know about teachers?"
msgstr "Que sais-tu des professeurs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:2
msgid "I hope he does better than Pappa did!"
msgstr "J’espère qu’il fera mieux que Papa !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:2
msgid "Itlor has found a job.  He'll care for you."
msgstr "Itlor a trouvé du travail. Il va s’occuper de vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:3
msgid "I want Pappa!"
msgstr "Je veux mon Papa !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:3
msgid "We Haven't seen your pappa."
msgstr "Nous n’avons pas vu ton papa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:4
msgid "Who's going to take care of us now?"
msgstr "Qui va s’occuper de nous maintenant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:4
msgid "Your pappa is in jail for stealing."
msgstr "Ton papa est en prison pour vol."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:5
msgid "Pappa always took care of us!"
msgstr "Papa s’est toujours occupé de nous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC73.rude:5
msgid "We'll find a way for you to care for yourselves."
msgstr ""
"Nous trouverons un moyen pour que vous puissiez vous débrouiller seuls."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:2
msgid "He's got to do his time."
msgstr "Il doit purger sa peine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:2
msgid "I hope it doesn't take long!"
msgstr "J’espère que ça ne sera pas long !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:3
msgid "Hurry!  I don't want to starve!"
msgstr "Vite ! Je ne veux pas mourir de faim !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:3
msgid "We'll find a way for you to be taken care of."
msgstr "Nous trouverons quelqu’un pour s’occuper de vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:4
msgid "If you do, tell him his children are looking for him."
msgstr "Si vous le voyez, dites-lui que ses enfants le cherchent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:4
msgid "We Haven't seen him either."
msgstr "Nous ne l’avons pas vu non plus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:5
msgid "He will?  What of Pappa?"
msgstr "C’est vrai ? Et Papa ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:5 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:4
msgid "Itlor will be taking care of you."
msgstr "Itlor va s’occuper de vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:6
msgid "What?!  What are we going to do now?"
msgstr "Quoi ?! Qu’est-ce qu’on va faire maintenant ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC74.rude:6
msgid "Your pappa has gone to jail.  He got caught stealing."
msgstr "Ton papa est allé en prison. Il s’est fait prendre en train de voler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:2
msgid "I don't want to starve!!"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas mourir de faim !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:2
msgid "We'll think of something."
msgstr "Nous trouverons une solution."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:3
msgid "If we see him, we'll tell him to come home."
msgstr "Si nous le voyons, nous lui dirons de rentrer à la maison."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:4
msgid "Of course he will!  He's my big brother!"
msgstr "Bien sûr qu’il va le faire ! C’est mon grand frère !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:5
msgid "Pappa's in jail.  He got caught stealing."
msgstr "Papa est en prison. Il s’est fait prendre en train de voler."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC75.rude:5
msgid "What'll we do?!  I don't want to starve!!"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce qu’on va faire ?! Je ne veux pas mourir de faim !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:1
msgid ""
"She said whatever it was that I was fighting would kill me.  She said I would go to Hallenhalt."
msgstr ""
"Elle a dit que, quoi que ce soit que je combattrais, cela me tuerait. Elle a dit que j’irais à Hallenhalt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:1
msgid "What else did she say?"
msgstr "Qu’a-t-elle dit d’autre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:10
msgid "I've heard that there is a basilisk that lives near Anskram Keep."
msgstr "J’ai entendu dire qu’un basilic vit près du Donjon d’Anskram."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:2
msgid "Sure"
msgstr "Bien sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:3
msgid ""
"My real name is Halfdan Gjalpssen.  When we were on the raid, the monks tried to lock us out.  While Thakkrad tried to hack down the door, I put my shoulder into it.  It shattered into pieces."
msgstr ""
"Mon vrai nom est Halfdan Gjalpssen. Pendant le raid, les moines ont essayé de nous empêcher d’entrer. Pendant que Thakkrad essayait d’abattre la porte à la hache, j’ai donné un coup d’épaule dedans. Elle a volé en éclats."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:3
msgid "Seems like an odd place to gain a name."
msgstr "Drôle d’endroit pour se faire un nom."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:4
msgid "I got it on my first raid to Lindisfarne."
msgstr "Je l’ai gagné lors de mon premier raid sur Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:4
msgid "Where'd you get the name Doorsbane?"
msgstr "D’où vous vient ce nom de Fléau-des-Portes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:7
msgid ""
"I heard Lindisfarne has a great artifact called Thjorad.  I couldn't find it, though."
msgstr ""
"Il paraît que Lindisfarne possède un grand artefact appelé Thjorad. Mais je ne l’ai pas trouvé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about Artifacts?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des artefacts ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:8
msgid "See ya later."
msgstr "À plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC76.rude:9
msgid ""
"She spoke to me when we spent the night on the Isle of Ashes.  She said that a time would soon come when I would fight bravely."
msgstr ""
"Elle m’a parlé la nuit où nous avons dormi sur l’Île des Cendres. Elle m’a dit que viendrait bientôt le moment où je combattrais vaillamment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:5
msgid "If you have the skill."
msgstr "Si vous en avez la compétence."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:3
msgid ""
"My uncle died and went to Hallenhalt.  He came to me in a dream.  He said to be careful!  There are foul monsters there.  I thought Hallenhalt was supposed to be a beautiful place!"
msgstr ""
"Mon oncle est mort et il est allé à Hallenhalt. Il m’est apparu en rêve. Il m’a dit d’être prudent ! Il y a d’ignobles monstres là-bas. Je croyais que Hallenhalt était censé être un endroit magnifique !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC77.rude:4
msgid ""
"Find Hrrapp Spearhands in Thjorgard.  He can help you achieve your goals."
msgstr ""
"Allez voir Hrrapp Mains-de-Lance à Thjorgard. Il peut vous aider à atteindre vos objectifs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:5
msgid "If you have the skills, I can teach you."
msgstr "Si vous en avez les compétences, je peux vous l’enseigner."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:3
msgid ""
"There are foul things in Anskram Keep.  If I were going to go in there, I'd bring some healing potions for sure!"
msgstr ""
"Il y a d’ignobles créatures dans le Donjon d’Anskram. Si je devais y aller, j’emporterais sûrement des potions de soin !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:10 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:9
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:8
msgid "See you later."
msgstr "À plus tard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:7
msgid ""
"He bashes good!  He's a good fighter.  If I were looking to hire someone to do some fighting for me, I think he would be near the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"Il cogne dur ! C’est un bon combattant. Si je cherchais quelqu’un à engager pour se battre à ma place, il serait parmi les premiers de la liste."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC78.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about Tesar Olin?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de Tesar Olin ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:2 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:4
msgid "If I must help you."
msgstr "S’il le faut vraiment."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:3
msgid "Where can we become Grandmasters in Dodge?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en Esquive ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC79.rude:6
msgid "No!  Leave me alone.  Well, alright."
msgstr "Non ! Laissez-moi tranquille. Bon, d’accord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:10
msgid "I noticed.  I hope that you're alright."
msgstr "Je l’ai remarqué. J’espère que vous n’avez rien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:10
msgid "We've found your cave in."
msgstr "Nous avons trouvé votre éboulement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:11
msgid "A fine idea!  I doubt that he'll do anything about it."
msgstr "Bonne idée ! Mais je doute qu’il fasse quoi que ce soit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:11
msgid "Sounds dangerous.  Maybe we should report this to Sven Svenssen"
msgstr ""
"Ça a l’air dangereux. Nous devrions peut-être en informer Sven Svenssen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:12
msgid "He wants to know why you're not working."
msgstr "Il veut savoir pourquoi vous ne travaillez pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:12
msgid ""
"If he wants the Elemental Thjorad so bad, you tell him to go in there and get it himself!"
msgstr ""
"S’il tient tant que ça au Thjorad élémentaire, dites-lui d’aller le chercher lui-même là-dedans !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:13
msgid "Here, let me show you."
msgstr "Tenez, je vais vous montrer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:13
msgid "Where is the cave again?"
msgstr "Où est la grotte, déjà ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:14
msgid "Is this it?"
msgstr "C’est ici ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:14
msgid ""
"Yes.  You can see that big crack in the floor for yourself.  I'm not going any further."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Vous voyez vous-mêmes cette grosse fissure dans le sol. Je ne vais pas plus loin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:15
msgid "Careful on your way out!"
msgstr "Faites attention en sortant !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:15
msgid "Sorry.  Nevermind"
msgstr "Désolés. Laissez tomber."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:2
msgid "OK."
msgstr "D’accord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:3
msgid ""
"It's against my better judgment, but I better show you where it is.  Follow me."
msgstr ""
"Ce n’est pas très raisonnable, mais je ferais mieux de vous montrer où c’est. Suivez-moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:4
msgid "Good!  Thanks for helping us like that.  Now we can get back to work!"
msgstr ""
"Bien ! Merci de nous avoir aidés. Nous allons pouvoir reprendre le travail !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:4
msgid "We are."
msgstr "Nous allons bien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:6
msgid "Maybe we should go have a look."
msgstr "Nous devrions peut-être aller jeter un œil."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:6
msgid "You're fools!  You'll only walk out to your death."
msgstr "Vous êtes fous ! Vous allez droit à la mort."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:7
msgid ""
"We've been diggin' too much.  If we dig anymore, there's likely to be a cave-in.  We've lost too many miners as it is.  They don't wanna to go in, and I ain't gonna force them!"
msgstr ""
"On a trop creusé. Si on creuse encore, il risque d’y avoir un éboulement. On a déjà perdu trop de mineurs. Ils veulent pas y aller, et c’est pas moi qui vais les forcer !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:8
msgid "It's dangerous in there!"
msgstr "C’est dangereux là-dedans !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:8
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr "Pourquoi dites-vous cela ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:9
msgid "Inspect the mines?  You're braver than I am."
msgstr "Inspecter les mines ? Vous êtes plus courageux que moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC8.rude:9
msgid "Sven Svenssen sent us to inspect the mines."
msgstr "Sven Svenssen nous a envoyés inspecter les mines."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:2
msgid "Thanks!  Can we ask you something else?"
msgstr "Merci ! Pouvons-nous vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:3
msgid ""
"I've heard that mummies are afraid of fire.  If I were going to fight some of those, I'd definitely use fire against them."
msgstr ""
"Il paraît que les momies ont peur du feu. Si je devais en combattre, j’utiliserais le feu contre elles, c’est sûr."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:4
msgid "Where can we become Grandmaster in Blade?"
msgstr "Où pouvons-nous devenir Grands Maîtres en Lame ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:5
msgid "We'd like to become Master  in Blade."
msgstr "Nous aimerions devenir Maîtres en Lame."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:6
msgid "Sure.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Bien sûr. Au revoir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC80.rude:7
msgid ""
"I've heard of this sword called Excala Banna.  It is supposed to be very lucky.  Man do I wish I had one of those!"
msgstr ""
"J’ai entendu parler d’une épée appelée Excala Banna. Elle porterait chance. Ce que j’aimerais en avoir une !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:1
msgid "Lucky for you."
msgstr "Une chance pour vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:1
msgid "Yeah!  Because of that, I escaped!"
msgstr "Oui ! C’est grâce à ça que je me suis évadé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you have any small children, I'd stay away from Frosgard.  I heard there's a frost giant who eats them there!"
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez de jeunes enfants, je ne m’approcherais pas de Frosgard. Il paraît qu’un géant du givre y mange les enfants !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:6
msgid ""
"Sturmford is the place if you want to learn weapon or armor skills!  There's plenty of teachers around here!"
msgstr ""
"Sturmford est l’endroit idéal pour apprendre les compétences d’armes ou d’armures ! Il y a plein de professeurs par ici !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Teachers?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des professeurs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:8
msgid ""
"I served some time in the Drangheim Prison when I was younger.  One time when I was particularly rowdy, they threw me down into the basement block with all the nagate.  Little did they know in one of the old cells, there is a tunnel to the outside!"
msgstr ""
"Quand j’étais plus jeune, j’ai purgé une peine dans la prison de Drangheim. Une fois où j’avais été particulièrement turbulent, ils m’ont jeté au sous-sol avec tous les Nagates. Ils ignoraient que dans l’une des vieilles cellules, il y a un tunnel qui mène dehors !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC81.rude:8
msgid "What do you know about prisons?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des prisons ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC82.rude:2
msgid ""
"Ludwig Van is my favorite writer!  I think it's tragic that he lost his manuscript.  If only someone would go find it for him!"
msgstr ""
"Ludwig Van est mon écrivain préféré ! Je trouve tragique qu’il ait perdu son manuscrit. Si seulement quelqu’un allait le lui retrouver !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC82.rude:5
msgid ""
"Those Honkies have a temple in Guberland.  I wish they would just go there and stay there!  They're always coming over to my house and bothering me!"
msgstr ""
"Ces Honkiens ont un temple à Guberland. J’aimerais qu’ils y aillent et qu’ils y restent ! Ils viennent sans arrêt chez moi pour m’importuner !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:1
msgid "I suppose it's alright."
msgstr "Je suppose que oui."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:2
msgid "My sister just had a baby!  Isn't that great!"
msgstr "Ma sœur vient d’avoir un bébé ! C’est formidable, non ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:4
msgid ""
"Look for Katrina Vianni, she lives around here, and is the best sword teacher around!"
msgstr ""
"Cherchez Katrina Vianni, elle vit dans le coin et c’est la meilleure maîtresse d’épée des environs !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:4
msgid "What do you know about Sword Mastery?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la maîtrise de l’Épée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC83.rude:7
msgid ""
"I was talking to Feargus A'Feslo a while back about the Drangheim Prison.  Did you know he escaped from there?"
msgstr ""
"Il y a quelque temps, je parlais de la prison de Drangheim avec Feargus A'Feslo. Vous saviez qu’il s’en était évadé ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:5
msgid "I can help you with that, if you are skilled enough."
msgstr "Je peux vous aider, si vous êtes assez doués."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:3
msgid ""
"I'm planning to move to Thjorgard and become a Thjoradric Smith!  Then I can get rich!"
msgstr ""
"Je compte m’installer à Thjorgard pour devenir forgeron thjoradrique ! Comme ça, je pourrai devenir riche !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:7
msgid ""
"Not very much, but it can't be that hard, can it?  You just bang on a piece of Elemental Thjorad with a hammer!  Easy!"
msgstr ""
"Pas grand-chose, mais ça ne doit pas être si difficile, non ? Il suffit de taper sur un morceau de Thjorad élémentaire avec un marteau ! Facile !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:7
msgid "What do you know about making weapons?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de la fabrication des armes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC84.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:8 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:6
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:4
msgid "Can we ask you a few questions?"
msgstr "Pouvons-nous vous poser quelques questions ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:1
msgid "Can we ask you something else."
msgstr "Pouvons-nous vous demander autre chose ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:1
msgid "You can ask."
msgstr "Vous pouvez demander."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:10
msgid "Nuthin'."
msgstr "Rien d’rien."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:11
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Ouais."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:12
msgid "We're not interested in hiring you."
msgstr "Nous ne voulons pas vous engager."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:13
msgid "Come back when you can afford me."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous aurez les moyens de m’engager."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:13
msgid "Sorry.  That's too much"
msgstr "Désolés. C’est trop cher."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:14
msgid ""
"That figures!  Never know good talent when they see one.  See you around."
msgstr ""
"Évidemment ! Ils ne savent jamais reconnaître le talent quand ils le voient. À la prochaine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:15
msgid "That's right you weren't!"
msgstr "Ça, c’est sûr que vous ne regardiez pas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:15
msgid "We weren't looking anywhere."
msgstr "Nous ne regardions rien du tout."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:2
msgid ""
"Ha!  I been sitting here for weeks trying to find a job.  You'd think I'd get an earful of news, but I ain't got nothing!"
msgstr ""
"Ha ! Ça fait des semaines que je suis assis là à chercher du travail. On pourrait croire que j’en entends, des nouvelles, mais j’ai rien du tout !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:3
msgid "Congratulations!  You're hired!"
msgstr "Félicitations ! Vous êtes engagé !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:3
msgid "Great!  Let me get my things."
msgstr "Formidable ! Je vais chercher mes affaires."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:4
msgid ""
"What does it look like I'm doing?  I'm an out of work gladiator!  We gladiators need to pay the bills too, you know!"
msgstr ""
"À votre avis ? Je suis un gladiateur sans emploi ! Nous autres gladiateurs, on doit aussi payer nos factures, vous savez !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:5
msgid "Great!  I charge 700 gold per month plus 10% of the gold we find."
msgstr ""
"Formidable ! Je prends 700 pièces d’or par mois plus 10% de l’or que nous trouverons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:5
msgid "We might be interested in hiring you."
msgstr "Nous serions peut-être intéressés par vos services."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:7
msgid "I'm an out of work gladiator.  Maybe you got a job for me?"
msgstr ""
"Je suis un gladiateur sans emploi. Vous avez peut-être du travail pour moi ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:7
msgid "What's it to you?"
msgstr "Qu’est-ce que ça peut vous faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:8
msgid "You can ask.  Doesn't mean I'll answer."
msgstr "Vous pouvez demander. Ça ne veut pas dire que je répondrai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC85.rude:9
msgid "Sorry to hear it.  Thanks for the talk."
msgstr "Désolés de l’apprendre. Merci pour la conversation."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:10
msgid ""
"My brother went to Mendossus to look for Old Ursana, the empire's capital.  It is supposedly filled with riches!  He never came back for me, though.  He said he would!"
msgstr ""
"Mon frère est parti à Mendossus à la recherche de la Vieille Ursana, la capitale de l’empire. On dit qu’elle regorge de richesses ! Mais il n’est jamais revenu me chercher. Il avait promis !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:12
msgid "Very well.  I understand."
msgstr "Très bien. Je comprends."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:2
msgid "Consider us benefactors.  Welcome aboard."
msgstr "Considérez-nous comme vos bienfaiteurs. Bienvenue parmi nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:2
msgid "Your generosity will be repaid tenfold."
msgstr "Votre générosité vous sera rendue au centuple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:3
msgid "Are you saying you would like to come with us?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous dire que vous aimeriez venir avec nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:3
msgid ""
"If you would but donate 1000 gold per month to my temple, I would be happy to aid you in your quest."
msgstr ""
"Si vous faisiez don de 1000 pièces d'or par mois à mon temple, je serais heureux de vous aider dans votre quête."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:4
msgid ""
"A noble quest if I should live another day to hear one.  That quest is worthy of a champion of good like myself."
msgstr ""
"Une noble quête, s'il m'est donné de vivre un jour de plus pour en entendre une. Cette quête est digne d'un champion du bien tel que moi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:4
msgid "We must unite the clans against Tamur Leng and his Hordes."
msgstr "Nous devons unir les clans contre Tamur Leng et ses Hordes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:6
msgid "I am sorry.  I do not put much trust in rumors."
msgstr "Je suis désolé. Je n'accorde guère de crédit aux rumeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:7
msgid "That we are."
msgstr "En effet."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:7
msgid "What is your mission?"
msgstr "Quelle est votre mission ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:8
msgid ""
"Should you find yourself in a position to accept my help, then by all means, return."
msgstr ""
"Si vous êtes un jour en mesure d'accepter mon aide, alors revenez sans hésiter."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC86.rude:8
msgid "That's a little steep for a donation."
msgstr "C'est un peu cher pour un don."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:1
msgid ""
"Oh no!  This is too much!  I mean it only figures, of course, all the problems land on my head.  What if they come here?  What if they army is too strong for us?  What can I do?  Drangheim will be destroyed!"
msgstr ""
"Oh non ! C'en est trop ! Évidemment, tous les problèmes me tombent sur la tête. Et s'ils venaient ici ? Et si leur armée était trop forte pour nous ? Que puis-je faire ? Drangheim sera détruite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:1
msgid "The Beldonian Hordes are marching to Chedian."
msgstr "Les Hordes beldoniennes marchent sur Chedian."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:10
msgid ""
"When you find the source, try to make them stop.  If you cannot, tell me.  I will find a way to silence their foul mouth.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"Quand vous aurez trouvé la source, essayez de la faire taire. Si vous n'y parvenez pas, dites-le-moi. Je trouverai bien un moyen de clouer ce bec immonde. Bonne chance !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:11
msgid "That is a problem."
msgstr "Voilà qui pose problème."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:11
msgid ""
"Why don't you do that for me?  Yes!  I think you should.  Go find Greudach A'Dorad.  She should be somewhere around town.  Ask her where she got the rumor from, and keep asking until you find the source!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi ne le feriez-vous pas pour moi ? Oui ! Je crois que vous devriez. Allez trouver Greudach A’Dorad. Elle doit être quelque part en ville. Demandez-lui de qui elle tient cette rumeur, et remontez la piste jusqu'à la source !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:12
msgid ""
"Well, Greudach A'Dorad has often been telling me troubling news as of late.  I think she's quite taken with gossip.  I'd like to know who is at the root of these rumors."
msgstr ""
"Eh bien, Greudach A’Dorad me rapporte souvent des nouvelles inquiétantes ces derniers temps. Je crois qu'elle raffole des commérages. J'aimerais savoir qui est à l'origine de ces rumeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:12
msgid "What rumors?"
msgstr "Quelles rumeurs ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:13
msgid "I'm worried about the rumors."
msgstr "Ces rumeurs m'inquiètent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:14
msgid "We have come seeking your aid."
msgstr "Nous venons solliciter votre aide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:14
msgid "What is it that you want?"
msgstr "Que voulez-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:15
msgid "I will let them know!  See you at the council!"
msgstr "Je vais les prévenir ! Rendez-vous au conseil !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:15
msgid "Tell them we are meeting in Thronheim in two weeks."
msgstr "Dites-leur que nous nous réunissons à Thronheim dans deux semaines."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:16
msgid ""
"There is a fort called Anskram Keep along our border located in Sturmford.  It is rightfully ours.  Go to this fort, and disable all of its defenses.  Take this key.  One of our agents returned with it."
msgstr ""
"Il y a un fort appelé le Donjon d’Anskram, sur notre frontière, à Sturmford. Il nous revient de droit. Rendez-vous dans ce fort et neutralisez toutes ses défenses. Prenez cette clef. L'un de nos agents l'a rapportée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:16
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "Que faut-il faire ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:18
msgctxt "said by the party"
msgid "Certainly."
msgstr "Certainement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:18
msgid ""
"What a beautiful artifact!  No one will dispute my claim to the Jarlship now!  Here's a little something for your troubles."
msgstr ""
"Quel magnifique objet magique ! Plus personne ne contestera mon droit au titre de Jarl ! Voici un petit quelque chose pour votre peine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:2
msgid "No, thank you!  Was there anything else you wanted today?"
msgstr "Non, merci ! Désiriez-vous autre chose aujourd'hui ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:21
msgid ""
"Thronheim?!  That Bjarni doesn't trust me enough to sign it first?!  Very well, I will go to Thronheim and sign this treaty."
msgstr ""
"Thronheim ?! Ce Bjarni ne me fait pas assez confiance pour le signer en premier ?! Très bien, j'irai à Thronheim signer ce traité."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:21
msgid "You and Bjarni will both sign it in Thronheim."
msgstr "Vous et Bjarni le signerez tous deux à Thronheim."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:22
msgid "Bjarni said he needed his general.  We gave it to him."
msgstr ""
"Bjarni a dit qu'il avait besoin de son général. Nous le lui avons ramené."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:22
msgid ""
"You did it!  It doesn't matter anyway.  Sturmford wouldn't stop now anyway."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez fait ça ! Peu importe, de toute façon. Sturmford ne s'arrêterait plus maintenant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:23
msgid "Great!  I shall be ready.  Farewell."
msgstr "Parfait ! Je serai prêt. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:23
msgid "We have much to do, yet.  We'll let you know."
msgstr "Nous avons encore fort à faire. Nous vous tiendrons au courant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:24
msgid "A person named Marsaili A'Lanth in Sturmford."
msgstr "Une certaine Marsaili A'Lanth, à Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:24
msgid ""
"In Sturmford?  Must be one of Bjarni's spies.  Very well.  I shall take care of it.  Thank you.  Here is something for your hard work."
msgstr ""
"À Sturmford ? Ce doit être l'une des espionnes de Bjarni. Très bien. Je m'en occupe. Merci. Voici quelque chose pour votre peine."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:26 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:44
msgid "That is great!  I shall dispatch messengers to the Jarls immediately."
msgstr "Excellent ! Je vais envoyer sur-le-champ des messagers aux Jarls."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:26
msgid "The clans are united.  Now is the time for the war council."
msgstr ""
"Les clans sont unis. L'heure est venue de réunir le conseil de guerre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:27
msgid "We've already retrieved that."
msgstr "Nous l'avons déjà récupérée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:27 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:39
msgid "You have?  Let me see it!"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Montrez-la-moi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:28
msgid "Sorry.  We're much to busy to root out rumors."
msgstr "Désolés. Nous sommes bien trop occupés pour traquer des rumeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:29
msgid "We can't do this for you right now."
msgstr "Nous ne pouvons pas faire cela pour vous pour l'instant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:3
msgid ""
"A treaty?!  Yes, I suppose that would work.  Find someone to write us a treaty, and bring it to me.  I will sign it."
msgstr ""
"Un traité ?! Oui, je suppose que cela pourrait marcher. Trouvez quelqu'un qui nous rédige un traité, et apportez-le-moi. Je le signerai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:3
msgid "What if we got him to sign a treaty?"
msgstr "Et si nous lui faisions signer un traité ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:30
msgid "No, thanks to you!  The rumors have quieted down.  I am in you debt."
msgstr ""
"Non, grâce à vous ! Les rumeurs se sont calmées. Je suis votre débiteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:40
msgid "Now that we've done both tasks for you, will you join us?"
msgstr ""
"Maintenant que nous avons accompli vos deux tâches, allez-vous vous joindre à nous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:31 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:40
msgid ""
"Of course I will!  I assume that you will be working out all the details?"
msgstr ""
"Bien sûr que oui ! Je suppose que vous vous chargerez de régler tous les détails ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:32
msgid ""
"There is some question about my legitimacy to serve as Jarl of Drangheim.  There is an item, called the Crona Kiga that will erase any questions of that.  I would like you to visit Chasm of the Dead and retrieve it."
msgstr ""
"Ma légitimité en tant que Jarl de Drangheim est quelque peu mise en doute. Il existe un objet, appelé la Crona Kiga, qui balaiera tous ces doutes. J'aimerais que vous vous rendiez au Gouffre des Morts pour la récupérer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:32
msgid "What else do you need done?"
msgstr "Que faut-il faire d'autre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:33
msgid ""
"You have?  That's great news!  Oh, are those Sturmfordians going to pay now!!  Here's a little something for you, too."
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Excellente nouvelle ! Ah, ces Sturmfordiens vont payer, maintenant !! Voici un petit quelque chose pour vous aussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:34
msgid ""
"He's the guy in charge of Sturmford!  Those Sturmfordians must have rocks in their brains for picking him!"
msgstr ""
"C'est lui qui commande à Sturmford ! Ces Sturmfordiens doivent avoir des cailloux dans la cervelle pour l'avoir choisi !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:35
msgid "We haven't finished them yet."
msgstr "Nous ne les avons pas encore terminées."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:35
msgid "Well hurry up!"
msgstr "Eh bien, dépêchez-vous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:37
msgid "About those things you needed done.."
msgstr "À propos de ce que vous vouliez que nous fassions..."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:38
msgid ""
"That's great news!  Oh, are those Sturmfordians going to pay now!!  Here's a little something for you, too."
msgstr ""
"Excellente nouvelle ! Ah, ces Sturmfordiens vont payer, maintenant !! Voici un petit quelque chose pour vous aussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:38
msgid "We've disabled Anskram Keep's defenses."
msgstr "Nous avons neutralisé les défenses du Donjon d’Anskram."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:39
msgid "We've got the Crona Kiga."
msgstr "Nous avons la Crona Kiga."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:4
msgid "Sturmford didn't do it.  We did."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas Sturmford. C'est nous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:4
msgid "YOU!??  Why on earth would you do such a thing?"
msgstr "VOUS !?? Mais pourquoi diable avez-vous fait une chose pareille ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:43
msgid "Is that so?  Who has been spreading these foul lies?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Qui donc répand ces infâmes mensonges ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:43
msgid "We've found out who's been spreading the gossip."
msgstr "Nous avons découvert qui répand ces commérages."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:45
msgid "Why have you gone to war with Sturmford?!"
msgstr "Pourquoi êtes-vous entré en guerre contre Sturmford ?!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:45
msgid ""
"Why?  I'll tell you why!  Because some filthy agents from Sturmford broke into my prison and stole away with Ivsar Forktooth, that's why!!  They are no good, and don't deserve to be on this continent, let along the same island as we!"
msgstr ""
"Pourquoi ? Je vais vous dire pourquoi ! Parce que de sales agents de Sturmford se sont introduits dans ma prison et se sont enfuis avec Ivsar Forktooth, voilà pourquoi !! Ce sont des bons à rien, ils ne méritent pas de vivre sur ce continent, et encore moins sur la même île que nous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:46
msgid ""
"Kira wrote it?  She is a fair and just ruler, I will trust her words.  Very well, as soon as Bjarni signs it, so will I."
msgstr ""
"C'est Kira qui l'a rédigé ? C'est une souveraine juste et équitable, je me fierai à sa parole. Très bien, dès que Bjarni l'aura signé, je le signerai aussi."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:46
msgid "We have a peace treaty written by Kira the Cold."
msgstr "Nous avons un traité de paix rédigé par Kira la Froide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:47
msgid "Perservere.  Your ignorance has not failed us yet."
msgstr "Persévérez. Votre ignorance ne nous a pas encore trahis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:47
msgid "We are sorry, Sigmund.  Our ignorance killed you."
msgstr "Nous sommes désolés, Sigmund. Notre ignorance vous a coûté la vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:48
msgid "Greudach A'Dorad talked."
msgstr "Greudach A’Dorad a parlé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:48
msgid "She did, did she?  Well go find the person responsible!"
msgstr "Ah oui, vraiment ? Eh bien, allez trouver le responsable !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:5
msgid ""
"Great!  Chasm of the Dead is located just outside Drangheim.  I must give you this warning.  Chasm of the Dead is heavily trapped and EXTREMELY dangerous.  Stick close to the walls if you value your lives.  Good luck."
msgstr ""
"Parfait ! Le Gouffre des Morts se trouve juste à l'extérieur de Drangheim. Je dois vous mettre en garde. Le Gouffre des Morts regorge de pièges et il est EXTRÊMEMENT dangereux. Longez les murs si vous tenez à la vie. Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:6
msgid "Great!  Good luck."
msgstr "Parfait ! Bonne chance."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:7
msgid ""
"Great!  One less thing I have to worry about.  When is the war council?"
msgstr "Parfait ! Un souci de moins. Quand se tient le conseil de guerre ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:8
msgid "Join us!  We are trying to unite the Clans against them."
msgstr "Rejoignez-nous ! Nous tentons d'unir les clans contre eux."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:8
msgid ""
"Join you?  Hmmm.  I've got my hands full with Sturmford these days.  Perhaps if you would help me with that, I would be able to help you."
msgstr ""
"Vous rejoindre ? Hmmm. J'ai déjà fort à faire avec Sturmford ces temps-ci. Si vous m'aidiez sur ce point, je pourrais peut-être vous aider en retour."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:9
msgid ""
"Very well.  Once Bjarni has signed it, I will withdraw my troops.  Farewell."
msgstr ""
"Très bien. Dès que Bjarni l'aura signé, je retirerai mes troupes. Adieu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC87.rude:9
msgid "We will get you a treaty."
msgstr "Nous vous procurerons un traité."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:11
msgid "So you have.  Congratulations.  You are hereby promoted to Assassins."
msgstr ""
"En effet. Félicitations. Vous êtes désormais promus au rang d'Assassins."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:12
msgid "We shall see your worth."
msgstr "Nous verrons ce que vous valez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:2
msgid "sdef"
msgstr "sdef"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:4
msgid ""
"A certain noble, who we will call Mr. Kluso, would like to test his security devices.  An assassin should be able to get past any security device the mind can think of.  Find his house, and steal whatever it is he holds valuable enough to guard."
msgstr ""
"Un certain noble, que nous appellerons M. Kluso, souhaite mettre à l'épreuve ses dispositifs de sécurité. Un assassin doit pouvoir déjouer tous les dispositifs de sécurité que l'esprit puisse concevoir. Trouvez sa maison et volez ce qu'il juge assez précieux pour le faire garder."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:5
msgid ""
"I will be the judge of that.  The Assassin's Trial consists of two tasks."
msgstr ""
"J'en serai seul juge. L'Épreuve de l'Assassin se compose de deux tâches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:6
msgid ""
"Is that so?  Is there among you those mercenaries who would be worthy to become assassins?"
msgstr ""
"Vraiment ? Y a-t-il parmi vous des mercenaires dignes de devenir assassins ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:8
msgid "We have come seeking promotions."
msgstr "Nous venons demander une promotion."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:8
msgid ""
"Another skill of the Assassin is murder.  There are many who would pay great price for the death of another.  Someone has already paid me for the life of Guaire A'Velsi.  If you are worthy, find this man, and in broad daylight, kill him."
msgstr ""
"Le meurtre est une autre compétence de l'Assassin. Nombreux sont ceux qui paieraient cher la mort d'autrui. Quelqu'un m'a déjà payé pour la vie de Guaire A’Velsi. Si vous en êtes dignes, trouvez cet homme et tuez-le en plein jour."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:8
msgid "What is the Second Task?"
msgstr "Quelle est la Seconde Tâche ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC88.rude:9
msgid "Then come back when there are."
msgstr "Alors revenez quand il y en aura."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:10
msgid "Come back if you do."
msgstr "Revenez si c'est le cas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:10
msgid "We do not have anyone who would like to become a Crusader."
msgstr "Personne parmi nous ne souhaite devenir Croisé."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:11
msgid "I am not here to entertain you."
msgstr "Je ne suis pas là pour vous divertir."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:12
msgid "About that promotion quest."
msgstr "À propos de cette quête de promotion."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:13
msgid ""
"The villagers have been praising your names to me already.  Congratulations.  I hearby promote you to Crusaders!"
msgstr ""
"Les villageois m'ont déjà fait votre éloge. Félicitations. Je vous promeus par la présente au rang de Croisés !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:13
msgid "We have completed the task."
msgstr "Nous avons accompli la tâche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:3
msgid ""
"Don't forget.  Crusaders carry themselves with honor.  Be honorable and do the order proud."
msgstr ""
"N'oubliez pas. Les Croisés se conduisent avec honneur. Soyez honorables et faites honneur à l'ordre."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:4 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:6
msgid ""
"As you may have heard from the villagers, just outside of Drangheim there is a gang known as the Yobboe Gang.  They have been extorting money from the villagers nearby.  Go to the Yobboe camp, defeat the bandits, and return the villagers' things to them."
msgstr ""
"Comme les villageois vous l'ont peut-être dit, une bande connue sous le nom de Bande des Yobboes sévit juste à l'extérieur de Drangheim. Ces brigands extorquent de l'argent aux villageois des environs. Rendez-vous au camp des Yobboes, battez les bandits et rendez leurs biens aux villageois."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:4
msgid "What was the task again?"
msgstr "Quelle était cette tâche, déjà ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:5
msgid "We will accept this task."
msgstr "Nous acceptons cette tâche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:6
msgid "What is the task?"
msgstr "Quelle est la tâche ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:7
msgid "I will give you the task then."
msgstr "Je vais donc vous confier la tâche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:7
msgid "Yes.  Some of us would like to become Crusaders."
msgstr "Oui. Certains d'entre nous aimeraient devenir Croisés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:8
msgid "There are those among you who would wish to become Crusaders?"
msgstr "Y a-t-il parmi vous des gens qui souhaiteraient devenir Croisés ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC89.rude:9
msgid "We're not ready to accept this quest."
msgstr "Nous ne sommes pas prêts à accepter cette quête."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:1 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:8
msgid ""
"It's in the hallway behind me.  Take the first corridor to your right and follow it until it ends."
msgstr ""
"C'est dans le couloir derrière moi. Prenez le premier passage à droite et suivez-le jusqu'au bout."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:1
msgid "Where is this section?"
msgstr "Où se trouve cet endroit ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:4
msgid "Good.  Once this rock is cleared, we can get back to work."
msgstr ""
"Bien. Une fois cette roche dégagée, nous pourrons nous remettre au travail."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:4
msgid "We'll give it a try."
msgstr "Nous allons essayer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:5
msgid "I don't think he'll accept that answer."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas qu'il se contentera de cette réponse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:5
msgid ""
"Maybe you can try to break through.  My geologist tells me there's a cave with normal rock beyond this stuff."
msgstr ""
"Vous pourriez peut-être essayer de la percer. Mon géologue dit qu'il y a une grotte de roche ordinaire derrière cette matière."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:6
msgid "Sven Forkbeard sent us to find out why you are not working."
msgstr "Sven Forkbeard nous envoie savoir pourquoi vous ne travaillez pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:6
msgid ""
"We started a new vein a while back, and we've reached a section of rock that's too strong for our picks."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons attaqué une nouvelle veine il y a quelque temps, et nous sommes tombés sur une roche trop dure pour nos pioches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:7
msgid ""
"The section that was too strong for our picks?  That's great!  Thank you!"
msgstr "La roche qui était trop dure pour nos pioches ? Formidable ! Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:7
msgid "We cleared out your rock."
msgstr "Nous avons dégagé votre roche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:8
msgid "Where was that rock again?"
msgstr "Où était cette roche, déjà ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:9
msgid "Uh, no.  Sorry."
msgstr "Euh, non. Désolés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC9.rude:9
msgid ""
"We always need good miners.  I'll be here if you ever change your mind."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons toujours besoin de bons mineurs. Je serai là si jamais vous changez d'avis."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:2
msgid "All right!  See you there!"
msgstr "Entendu ! On se retrouve là-bas !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:3
msgid "We're supposed to take you to see Bjarni."
msgstr "Nous devons vous conduire auprès de Bjarni."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:3
msgid ""
"What, you think I want to go gallivanting around with you?  Not likely.  Besides, I need a drink!  When you're ready to see Bjarni, you can find me in the tavern in Sturmford."
msgstr ""
"Quoi, vous croyez que j'ai envie de courir les routes avec vous ? Sûrement pas. D'ailleurs, j'ai besoin d'un verre ! Quand vous serez prêts à voir Bjarni, vous me trouverez à la taverne de Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:4
msgid "Let's go."
msgstr "Allons-y."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:4
msgid "Woooweee!!  Freedom!!"
msgstr "Youhouuu !! Liberté !!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:5
msgid ""
"Bjarni sent you?  To get me?  What are we waiting for?  I may be an old man now, but I can move just as good as when I was twenty!  And don't worry if you lose me.  I know my way around.  If we get separated I'll meet you outside."
msgstr ""
"C'est Bjarni qui vous envoie ? Pour me chercher ? Qu'attendons-nous ? Je suis peut-être vieux maintenant, mais je bouge aussi bien qu'à vingt ans ! Et ne vous inquiétez pas si vous me perdez. Je connais le chemin. Si nous sommes séparés, je vous retrouverai dehors."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:5
msgid "We've been sent by Bjarni Thorvaldssen to rescue you."
msgstr "Bjarni Thorvaldssen nous envoie vous sauver."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:6
msgid "We've come to take you back to Sturmford."
msgstr "Nous sommes venus vous ramener à Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:6
msgid "What?  Who are you?"
msgstr "Quoi ? Qui êtes-vous ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:7
msgid "I know the way from here!"
msgstr "Je connais le chemin à partir d'ici !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:7
msgid "What is it, General?"
msgstr "Qu'y a-t-il, Général ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:8
msgid "Come on, General."
msgstr "Venez, Général."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:8
msgid "Sure thing!  Ready to go!"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! Prêt à partir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:9
msgid "Sorry to bother you, old man."
msgstr "Désolés de vous avoir dérangé, vieil homme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC90.rude:9
msgid "Wait!  Come back!  Keep an old man some company."
msgstr "Attendez ! Revenez ! Tenez donc compagnie à un vieil homme."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:2
msgid ""
"I wish someone would show those Yobboes the what for!  They certainly deserve it!"
msgstr ""
"J'aimerais bien que quelqu'un donne une bonne leçon à ces Yobboes ! Ils l'ont bien mérité !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:3
msgid "Mercy be on you!"
msgstr "Que le ciel vous bénisse !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:3
msgid "We'll get your plow back for you."
msgstr "Nous allons vous rapporter votre charrue."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:5
msgid ""
"Those darned Yobboes took it!  As payment for protection against Sturmford they say.  I think they just like watching us suffer!"
msgstr ""
"Ces maudits Yobboes me l'ont prise ! En paiement de leur protection contre Sturmford, qu'ils disent. Je crois surtout qu'ils aiment nous voir souffrir !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:5
msgid "What happened to your plow?"
msgstr "Qu'est-il arrivé à votre charrue ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:6
msgid "Yeah, I guess."
msgstr "Oui, je suppose."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:7
msgid ""
"Thank you!  I was afraid I wasn't going to be able to get the plowing done for the planting!"
msgstr ""
"Merci ! J'avais peur de ne pas pouvoir labourer à temps pour les semailles !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:7
msgid "We have your plow."
msgstr "Nous avons votre charrue."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:8
msgid ""
"Isn't that some sort of illness?  I think my brother Dean came down with that a few weeks ago.  I'd stay away from him if I were you!  It's very contagious!"
msgstr ""
"Ce n'est pas une sorte de maladie ? Je crois que mon frère Dean l'a attrapée il y a quelques semaines. À votre place, je ne l'approcherais pas ! C'est très contagieux !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC91.rude:9
msgid "I've got my plow back, thanks to you!"
msgstr "J'ai récupéré ma charrue, grâce à vous !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:1
msgid ""
"I hate those Yobboes!  Who among us has the nerve to stand up to them?"
msgstr ""
"Je déteste ces Yobboes ! Qui parmi nous aura le courage de leur tenir tête ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:2
msgid "We'll find your herbs for you."
msgstr "Nous allons retrouver vos herbes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:2
msgid "You will?  Thank you!"
msgstr "C'est vrai ? Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:3
msgid ""
"Those Yobboes took them from me because I refused to heal one of them."
msgstr ""
"Ces Yobboes me les ont prises parce que j'ai refusé de soigner l'un des leurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:3
msgid "What happened to your herbs?"
msgstr "Qu'est-il arrivé à vos herbes ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:5
msgid "We've got your bag of herbs."
msgstr "Nous avons votre sac d'herbes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:5
msgid "You have?  Wonderful!  Thank you so much!"
msgstr "C'est vrai ? Merveilleux ! Merci infiniment !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:6
msgid ""
"That's some monastery to the south.  We get a lot of pilgrims stopping here on their way down there."
msgstr ""
"C'est un monastère au sud. Beaucoup de pèlerins font halte ici en s'y rendant."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC92.rude:7
msgid "Thank you for bringing my herbs back!"
msgstr "Merci d'avoir rapporté mes herbes !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:1
msgid "I've got my dolly back!  See!  Lori's all happy now!  Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"J'ai retrouvé ma poupée ! Regardez ! Lori est toute contente maintenant ! Merci !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:2
msgid ""
"I can't find it!  Little Lori has been missing since the Yobboes came.  I'm getting real worried about her!"
msgstr ""
"Je ne la trouve pas ! La petite Lori a disparu depuis que les Yobboes sont venus. Je commence à m'inquiéter vraiment pour elle !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:2
msgid "What happened to your dolly?"
msgstr "Qu'est-il arrivé à ta poupée ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:3
msgid "That's the name of the place I live at!"
msgstr "C'est le nom de l'endroit où j'habite !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:4
msgid "We've found your dolly."
msgstr "Nous avons retrouvé ta poupée."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:4
msgid "You found my dolly?  Thank you!  Oh Lori, are you alright?"
msgstr "Vous avez retrouvé ma poupée ? Merci ! Oh, Lori, tu vas bien ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC93.rude:5
msgid ""
"I'm not supposed to talk to anyone I don't know.  Especially since the Yobboes came."
msgstr ""
"Je n'ai pas le droit de parler aux inconnus. Surtout depuis que les Yobboes sont venus."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC94.rude:1
msgid "No one of consequence."
msgstr "Personne d'important."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC95.rude:1
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "Bien sûr que non."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:11
msgid "We'd like to talk to you about your \"news\"."
msgstr "Nous aimerions vous parler de vos « nouvelles »."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:11
msgid "What about my news?"
msgstr "Qu'ont-elles, mes nouvelles ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:2
msgid "Marsaili A'Lanth in Sturmford.  She's been telling me all the news."
msgstr ""
"Marsaili A'Lanth, à Sturmford. C'est elle qui me raconte toutes les nouvelles."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:2
msgid "We promise."
msgstr "Nous le promettons."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:3
msgid "Don't tell anyone I told you!"
msgstr "Ne dites à personne que c'est moi qui vous l'ai dit !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:4
msgid "People.  Everyone's been talking about it."
msgstr "Les gens. Tout le monde en parle."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:4
msgid "We want to know who you have been hearing it from."
msgstr "Nous voulons savoir de qui vous tenez tout cela."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:5
msgid ""
"They say he's a coward!  I heard he found a snake under his bed and cried like a baby!  Some ruler."
msgstr ""
"On dit que c'est un lâche ! Il paraît qu'il a trouvé un serpent sous son lit et qu'il a pleuré comme un bébé ! Drôle de souverain."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:5
msgid "What about Sigmund?"
msgstr "Et Sigmund ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:6
msgid ""
"Oh, but I have so much!  There's the story about Sigmund, and what I've heard about Sturmford will make your head spin!"
msgstr ""
"Oh, mais j'en ai tant ! Il y a l'histoire de Sigmund, et ce que j'ai entendu sur Sturmford va vous faire tourner la tête !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:6 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:8
msgid "What news?"
msgstr "Quelles nouvelles ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:7
msgid ""
"Me?  Certainly you don't think I..?  No, I guess you do.  Alright, but you've got to promise not to tell who told you."
msgstr ""
"Moi ? Vous ne pensez tout de même pas que je... ? Si, je vois que si. Bon, d'accord, mais vous devez promettre de ne pas dire qui vous l'a dit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:7
msgid "Not everyone.  The people we spoke to said you were the source."
msgstr ""
"Pas tout le monde. Les gens à qui nous avons parlé disent que la source, c'est vous."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:8
msgid "Oh, it's you.  Never mind."
msgstr "Oh, c'est vous. Laissez tomber."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:9
msgid ""
"I heard they are going to invade soon.  Their army is ten times bigger than ours.  We'll stand no chance.  We might as well surrender now."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire qu'ils vont bientôt nous envahir. Leur armée est dix fois plus nombreuse que la nôtre. Nous n'aurons aucune chance. Autant nous rendre tout de suite."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC96.rude:9
msgid "What about Sturmford?"
msgstr "Et Sturmford ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:2
msgid ""
"I heard Sigmund is worried about Sturmford.  They've been very quiet lately.  That's unusual for them."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que Sigmund s'inquiète au sujet de Sturmford. Ils sont très calmes ces derniers temps. Ça ne leur ressemble pas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  We would like to see what you have."
msgstr "Oui. Nous aimerions voir ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:4
msgid "Sorry, but we're closed."
msgstr "Désolé, mais nous sommes fermés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:5
msgid ""
"They're bred from dirty string and goat cheese.  You think I'm kidding?  Why don't you go smell one of them!"
msgstr ""
"Ils sont nés de ficelle crasseuse et de fromage de chèvre. Vous croyez que je plaisante ? Allez donc en renifler un !"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:7
msgid "Come back when you want to spend some money."
msgstr "Revenez quand vous voudrez dépenser de l'argent."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC97.rude:8
msgid "Would you like to buy a weapon?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous acheter une arme ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard that dog spit mixed with frog brains makes an excellent anti-undead potion."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu dire que de la bave de chien mêlée à de la cervelle de grenouille donne une excellente potion contre les morts-vivants."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:4
msgid "Yes.  Show us what you have."
msgstr "Oui. Montrez-nous ce que vous avez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:5
msgid ""
"Sometimes some traders come here with merchandise from there.  The stuff is expensive, but it's pretty good quality.  They make a kind of armor that you don't see around here."
msgstr ""
"Parfois, des marchands viennent ici avec des marchandises de là-bas. C'est cher, mais de plutôt bonne qualité. Ils fabriquent une sorte d'armure qu'on ne voit pas par ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC98.rude:6
msgid "Would you like some armor?"
msgstr "Voulez-vous une armure ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:2
msgid ""
"I've heard of this game they play in Frosgard.  They wear knives on their feet, and chase a biscuit around on a frozen lake!  It sounds like great fun to me.  I want to visit Frosgard and play this game."
msgstr ""
"J'ai entendu parler d'un jeu qu'on pratique à Frosgard. Ils portent des couteaux aux pieds et poursuivent un biscuit sur un lac gelé ! Ça me paraît très amusant. Je veux aller à Frosgard pour jouer à ce jeu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:3 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:4
msgid "We would like to look at your spells."
msgstr "Nous aimerions voir vos sorts."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:5
msgid "Who is that?  His name sounds familiar, but I can't quite place it."
msgstr ""
"Qui est-ce ? Son nom me dit quelque chose, mais je n'arrive pas à le situer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:6
msgid ""
"If you need some advice, go visit Tymon the Nord in Thjorgard.  He always helps me out."
msgstr ""
"Si vous avez besoin de conseils, allez voir Tymon le Nordique à Thjorgard. Il m'aide toujours."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC99.rude:6
msgid "What do you know about Adventuring?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous de l'aventure ?"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:1
msgid "Complete your training."
msgstr "Terminez votre entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:1
msgid ""
"The Old Man believes you are finally ready to leave Ravensford.  Read the scroll he's given you to begin your training.  If you don't think you need any training, sell your scroll back to a shopkeeper and head north."
msgstr ""
"Le Vieil homme pense que vous êtes enfin prêts à quitter Ravensford. Lisez le parchemin qu'il vous a donné pour commencer votre entraînement. Si vous pensez ne pas avoir besoin d'entraînement, revendez votre parchemin à un marchand et partez vers le nord."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:10
msgid ""
"The old man put you on the path.  Complete his task to prove your worth."
msgstr ""
"Le vieil homme vous a mis sur la voie. Accomplissez la tâche qu'il vous a confiée pour prouver votre valeur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:100
msgid "You've killed Guaire A'Velsi.  Return to Atli the Quick."
msgstr "Vous avez tué Guaire A'Velsi. Retournez voir Atli le Rapide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:101
msgid ""
"Stop Jarl Sven Forkbeard of Thjorgard from being assassinated. Show the letter to Jarl Sven in Thjorgard.  Return to Grehgknak the Right in Lindisfarne when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Empêchez l'assassinat de Jarl Sven Forkbeard de Thjorgard. Montrez la lettre à Jarl Sven à Thjorgard. Retournez voir Grehgknak le Juste à Lindisfarne quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:101 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:102
msgid "Stop Jarl Sven's assassination."
msgstr "Empêchez l'assassinat de Jarl Sven."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:102
msgid "Go to the Arena and stop Sven's double from being assassinated."
msgstr "Rendez-vous à l'Arène et empêchez l'assassinat du sosie de Sven."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:103
msgid "Find Harris Willington."
msgstr "Trouvez Harris Willington."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:103
msgid ""
"Find Harris Willington.  Report back to Jarl Sven of Thjorgard.  When you are finished return to Grehgknak the Right in Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez Harris Willington. Faites votre rapport à Jarl Sven de Thjorgard. Retournez ensuite voir Grehgknak le Juste à Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:104 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:105
msgid "Arrest the thief."
msgstr "Arrêtez le voleur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:104
msgid ""
"Go to the town hall clerks and find who is having trouble with theives.  When you have found the thief, arrest him, and take him to the town jail."
msgstr ""
"Allez voir les greffiers de l'Hôtel de Ville et découvrez qui a des ennuis avec des voleurs. Une fois le voleur trouvé, arrêtez-le et conduisez-le à la prison de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:105
msgid ""
"You've arrested Hatlati Oord for stealing.  Take him to the jail inside the Sturmford Town Hall."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez arrêté Hatlati Oord pour vol. Conduisez-le à la prison située dans l'Hôtel de Ville de Sturmford."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:106
msgid "Help the Oor'ds help themselves."
msgstr "Aidez les Oord à s'aider eux-mêmes."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:106
msgid ""
"Speak to Hatlati's family.  Find a way for them to provide for themselves."
msgstr ""
"Parlez à la famille d'Hatlati. Trouvez un moyen pour qu'ils puissent subvenir à leurs propres besoins."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:107
msgid "Find Itlor a job."
msgstr "Trouvez du travail à Itlor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:107
msgid ""
"Itlor wants a job so he can provide for his family.  There must be someone around Sturmford who is willing to give him a job.  Return to Grehgknak the right when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Itlor veut un travail pour pouvoir subvenir aux besoins de sa famille. Il doit bien y avoir quelqu'un dans les environs de Sturmford prêt à l'embaucher. Retournez voir Grehgknak le Juste quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:108
msgid "Find Everstrike."
msgstr "Trouvez Everstrike."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:108
msgid ""
"Find the bow known as Everstrike.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend when you have it."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez l'arc appelé Everstrike. Retournez voir Fenja Amie-des-Arbres quand vous l'aurez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:109
msgid ""
"Go to the Dungeon of Secrets in Frosgard.  Pass through the dungeon without setting off a single trap.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous au Donjon des Secrets à Frosgard. Traversez le donjon sans déclencher un seul piège. Retournez voir Fenja Amie-des-Arbres quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:109 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:110
msgid "Pass through Dungeon of Secrets."
msgstr "Traversez le Donjon des Secrets."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:11
msgid ""
"Snorri the Fist has instructed you to meet Abbot Leffery Caid in Lindisfarne.  He will show you how to summon the dragon."
msgstr ""
"Snorri le Poing vous a demandé de rencontrer l'abbé Leffery Caid à Lindisfarne. Il vous montrera comment invoquer le dragon."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:110
msgid ""
"You've completed the Dungeon of Secrets.  Return to Fenja Tree-friend."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez terminé le Donjon des Secrets. Retournez voir Fenja Amie-des-Arbres."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:111
msgid "Find a new priest for the new temple."
msgstr "Trouvez un nouveau prêtre pour le nouveau temple."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:111
msgid ""
"Find a priest who would be willing to take over the new temple to Igdrasa you are building.  Return to Gray Slemnir when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez un prêtre qui accepterait de prendre en charge le nouveau temple d'Igdrasa que vous construisez. Retournez voir Slemnir le Gris quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:112
msgid "Find a new Tree of Life."
msgstr "Trouvez un nouvel Arbre de Vie."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:112
msgid ""
"Find the Ruined Temple in Frosgard and recover the Tree of Life symbol.  Take it to Gray Slemnir in Guberland when you have acquired it."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez le Temple en ruine de Frosgard et récupérez le symbole de l'Arbre de Vie. Apportez-le à Slemnir le Gris à Guberland une fois que vous l'aurez."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:113
msgid ""
"Find Nath'i A'Mor in Frosgard and convince him to teach you the Ritual of Consecration.  Return to Gray Slemnir when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez Nath’i A’Mor à Frosgard et convainquez-le de vous enseigner le Rituel de Consécration. Retournez voir Slemnir le Gris quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:113
msgid "Learn the Ritual of Consecration."
msgstr "Apprenez le Rituel de Consécration."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:114
msgid ""
"Find the Green Man in Frosgard, and ask him what you can do to help him return to Frosgard."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez l'Homme Vert à Frosgard et demandez-lui ce que vous pouvez faire pour l'aider à revenir à Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:114
msgid "Find the Green Man."
msgstr "Trouvez l'Homme Vert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:115 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:116
msgid "Get a promise from Frosgard."
msgstr "Obtenez une promesse de Frosgard."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:115
msgid ""
"Get a promise from at least seven residents of Frosgard that they will not neglect the Green Man.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Obtenez d'au moins sept habitants de Frosgard la promesse qu'ils ne négligeront pas l'Homme Vert. Retournez voir l'Homme Vert quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:116
msgid ""
"The citizens of Frosgard have promised not to neglect the Green Man.  Return to him when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"Les habitants de Frosgard ont promis de ne pas négliger l'Homme Vert. Retournez le voir quand vous aurez accompli ses autres tâches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:117
msgid ""
"Find someone in Frosgard who will repair the old maypole.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez quelqu'un à Frosgard qui réparera le vieux mât de mai. Retournez voir l'Homme Vert quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:117 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:118
msgid "Fix the maypole in the center of town."
msgstr "Réparez le mât de mai au centre de la ville."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:118
msgid ""
"Soxolf will fix the maypole at the center of town.  Return to the Green Man when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"Soxolf réparera le mât de mai au centre de la ville. Retournez voir l'Homme Vert quand vous aurez accompli ses autres tâches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:119 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:120
msgid "Get Tryygva to erect a runestone."
msgstr "Faites ériger une pierre runique par Tryygva."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:119
msgid ""
"Speak to Jarl Tryygva of Frosgard.  Convince him to commit a promise to celebrate the Green Man to stone and place that stone next to the maypole.  Return to the Green Man when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Parlez à Jarl Tryygva de Frosgard. Convainquez-le de graver dans la pierre la promesse de célébrer l'Homme Vert et de placer cette pierre à côté du mât de mai. Retournez voir l'Homme Vert quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:12
msgid ""
"Leffery Caid has the relic.  Perhaps now you will meet the dragon in his cave in Lindisfarne."
msgstr ""
"Leffery Caid a la relique. Peut-être rencontrerez-vous maintenant le dragon dans sa grotte de Lindisfarne."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:120
msgid ""
"Tryygva agreed to erect a runestone.  Return to the Green Man when you've finished his other tasks."
msgstr ""
"Tryygva a accepté d'ériger une pierre runique. Retournez voir l'Homme Vert quand vous aurez accompli ses autres tâches."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:121
msgid "Find Verhoffin's Diary."
msgstr "Trouvez le Journal de Verhoffin."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:121
msgid ""
"Go to the Verhoffin Ruins on the Isle of Ashes and recover Verhoffin's Diary.  Return to Johannes Bem in Thjorgard when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous aux Ruines de Verhoffin sur l'Ile des Cendres et récupérez le Journal de Verhoffin. Retournez voir Johannes Bem à Thjorgard quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:122
msgid "Become a Lich."
msgstr "Devenez une Liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:122
msgid "Follow the Lich Instructions and become a lich."
msgstr "Suivez les Instructions de la Liche et devenez une liche."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:123
msgid "Find the Training Hall in Thjorgard and survive its trials."
msgstr ""
"Trouvez la Salle d’entraînement de Thjorgard et survivez à ses épreuves."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:123
msgid "Survive the Training Hall."
msgstr "Survivez à la Salle d’entraînement."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:124
msgid ""
"Find out who is sabotaging Sturmford's defenses.  Report back to Bjarni Herjolfssen when you have uncovered who it is."
msgstr ""
"Découvrez qui sabote les défenses de Sturmford. Faites votre rapport à Bjarni Herjolfssen quand vous aurez découvert de qui il s'agit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:124
msgid "Find the saboteur."
msgstr "Trouvez le saboteur."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:125
msgid ""
"Jarl Bjarni has given you a love letter he wrote to Kira the Cold.  Take it to her in Thronheim, and report back to Bjarni when you have her response."
msgstr ""
"Jarl Bjarni vous a confié une lettre d'amour qu'il a écrite à Kira la Froide. Apportez-la-lui à Thronheim, puis faites votre rapport à Bjarni quand vous aurez sa réponse."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:125
msgid "Take love letter to Kira the Cold."
msgstr "Apportez la lettre d'amour à Kira la Froide."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:126
msgid ""
"Ludwig Van dropped his manuscript down the cellar of his Beet Hoven.  Go down into the sewers below his Beet Hoven and bring his manuscript back for him."
msgstr ""
"Ludwig Van a laissé tomber son manuscrit dans la cave de son Beet Hoven. Descendez dans les égouts sous son Beet Hoven et rapportez-lui son manuscrit."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:126
msgid "Retrieve Ludwig's Manuscript."
msgstr "Récupérez le manuscrit de Ludwig."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:127 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:128
msgid "Convince the Dook to leave Guberland."
msgstr "Convainquez le Dook de quitter Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:127
msgid ""
"Go to the Dook's Castle in Guberland and convince the Dook to leave.  Return to Jarl Markel of Guberland when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous au Château de Dook à Guberland et convainquez le Dook de partir. Retournez voir Jarl Markel de Guberland quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:128
msgid ""
"You've convinced the Dook to leave.  Return to Jarl Markel of Guberland."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez convaincu le Dook de partir. Retournez voir Jarl Markel de Guberland."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:129 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:130 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:131
msgid "Get Nicolai a job."
msgstr "Trouvez du travail à Nicolai."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:129
msgid ""
"Nicolai Ironfist of Drangheim is down on his luck.  Try to find him a job.  There's got to be a circus around here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Nicolai Ironfist de Drangheim n'a pas de chance en ce moment. Essayez de lui trouver du travail. Il doit bien y avoir un cirque quelque part par ici."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:13
msgid ""
"Bjarni Thorvaldssen, the Jarl of Sturmford has asked you to rid Anskram Keep in Sturmford of the imps that have inhabited it.  Destroy the portals they are coming from.  Return to him when you are finished."
msgstr ""
"Bjarni Thorvaldssen, le Jarl de Sturmford, vous a demandé de débarrasser le Donjon d'Anskram, à Sturmford, des diablotins qui l'ont envahi. Détruisez les portails par lesquels ils arrivent. Retournez le voir quand ce sera fait."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:13 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:14
msgid "Clear out Anskram Keep."
msgstr "Nettoyez le Donjon d'Anskram."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:130
msgid ""
"Thorir Mouth of Guberland offered Nicolai a job.  Return to Nicolai in Drangheim to tell him."
msgstr ""
"Thorir la Bouche, de Guberland, a offert un travail à Nicolai. Retournez voir Nicolai à Drangheim pour le lui annoncer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:131
msgid ""
"Nicolai has accepted the job.  Return to Thorir Mouth in Guberland for your reward."
msgstr ""
"Nicolai a accepté le travail. Retournez voir Thorir la Bouche à Guberland pour recevoir votre récompense."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:132 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:133 assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:134
msgid "Find out who is spreading gossip."
msgstr "Découvrez qui répand des commérages."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:132
msgid ""
"Jarl Sigmund of Drangheim is worried about the gossip spreading throughout his clan.  Find out who's tongue is wagging.  Return to Jarl Sigmund in Drangheim when you have discovered who is responsible."
msgstr ""
"Jarl Sigmund de Drangheim s'inquiète des commérages qui se répandent dans tout son clan. Découvrez qui a la langue trop bien pendue. Retournez voir Jarl Sigmund à Drangheim quand vous aurez découvert le responsable."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:133
msgid ""
"Greudach A'Dorad has fingered Marsaili A'Lanth in Sturmford.  Go find them and tell them to stop spreading the rumors."
msgstr ""
"Greudach A’Dorad a dénoncé Marsaili A'Lanth, de Sturmford. Allez la trouver et dites-lui de cesser de répandre ces rumeurs."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/mm9/dialogue/rude/NPC997.rude:134
msgid ""
"Marsaili A'Lanth refused to stop spreading lies.  Return to Sigmund with the information."
msgstr ""
